            58 => 
            array (
                'id' => 231,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Effective Leadership Training',
                'description' => '<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Because effective leaders are critical to the effective operation of any business. They need to have both the competence and the confidence to lead those working for them by example, communicating with and inspiring them to engage in the corporate vision and achieving the organisation&rsquo;s business goals.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Without the necessary leadership skills, the transition to being a leader can be a difficult one. Your staff members might excel above expectations in their current roles but, without leadership skills training, they might be less successful in leadership roles. This could be because of a lack of knowledge or experience. That&rsquo;s why it is so important to provide leadership development training. Our leadership training course helps them to understand the role of a leader, the tasks involved, and what it takes to be a good leader.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>A well-structured LPC &nbsp;Effective leadership programme can help people to realise their potential and boost their confidence to take on a leadership role. &nbsp;Effective Leadership training programmes can help teach the essential skills and techniques required to look at challenges from a different perspective.Discover your leadership patterns and foundations, diagnose your leadership tasks<br />
&nbsp;</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
                'days_content' => '["<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; Course introduction and setting the objectives according to the participant needs.</strong></h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Defining leadership and its impact on the organization.</li>\\n\\t<li>The essential traits and values of a successful leader.</li>\\n\\t<li>Commitment to the vision of an organization.</li>\\n\\t<li>Understanding the difference between leading and managing</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;Your personality traits and ability to lead; personality matrix</strong></h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>The leadership styles unpacked; advantages and disadvantages of each and how to adapt it appropriately to different people and situation</li>\\n\\t<li>Your personal leadership plan; the importance of aligning your values, beliefs and ambition and sparking your employees&rsquo; motivation by tapping into their own values and ambitions</li>\\n\\t<li>Importance and value of trust</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\\n\\n<h6><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;Understanding and setting the teams purpose</strong></h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Types of teams, team formation.</li>\\n\\t<li>Resolving team conflicts and conformity; techniques.</li>\\n\\t<li>Setting targets and monitoring the flow of work.</li>\\n\\t<li>Identifying and solving problems</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;Understanding the nature of organizational change</strong></h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Types of organizational change</li>\\n\\t<li>Barriers and requirements for successful organizational change</li>\\n\\t<li>Organizational change models</li>\\n\\t<li>Mediating resistance to change</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;Why people resist delegating and when it does and does not work</strong></h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Choosing who to delegate to and how to do so successfully</li>\\n\\t<li>What is mentoring and factors to consider before starting to mentor anyone, as well as how to structure such a relationship</li>\\n\\t<li>Summary and personal development plan</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
                'related_courses' => '[213,154,142,211]',
                'category_id' => 41,
                'online' => 0,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:43:35',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:43:35',
            ),
