            60 => 
            array (
                'id' => 233,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Leadership Fundamentals Training',
                'description' => '<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Leadership isn&rsquo;t defined by the job title. It&rsquo;s about developing the perspective, skills and personal style to get results that matter. &nbsp;Individual contributors get the work done as they lead project teams, serve as key role models in the organization and are influential team members.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>&nbsp;Being an effective leader is crucial to one&rsquo;s personal success and the success of the organization.&nbsp; The Leadership Fundamentals program was developed to introduce the essentials of effective leadership for greater success, faster.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>This course will focus on the crucial aspects of leadership, such as motivating and leading the team, translating the company&rsquo;s vision into everyday work of the team, as well as getting the best from all the employees in the organisation, whilst increasing their level of responsibility and effectiveness. This course centres on tactful leadership skills that are successful in any business. By creating extraordinary leaders and engaging them at all levels in the company, the organization will create the culture that guides smoothly all the processes through trust.</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p>&ndash; Speaking and listening skills, body language.</p>\\n\\n<p>&ndash; Interpersonal skills for leaders</p>\\n\\n<p>&ndash; Speaking and active listening skills, body language</p>\\n\\n<p>&ndash; Fundamental principles for time management, planning and setting priorities.</p>\\n\\n<p>&ndash; Dealing with interruptions and understanding and managing stress.</p>\\n","<p>&ndash; Characteristics of a great leader (empathy, awareness, persuasion, conceptualization, foresight, stewardship)</p>\\n\\n<p>&ndash; Different styles of leadership</p>\\n\\n<p>&ndash; Increasing influence by modelling organizational commitment and enabling the employees</p>\\n","<p><strong>&ndash;&nbsp;</strong>Understanding and setting the teams purpose</p>\\n\\n<p>&ndash; Types of teams, team formation</p>\\n\\n<p>&ndash; Resolving team conflicts and conformity; techniques.</p>\\n\\n<p>&ndash; Setting targets and monitoring the flow of work.</p>\\n\\n<p>&ndash; Identifying and solving problems</p>\\n","<p>&ndash; Change in a business environment.</p>\\n\\n<p>&ndash; Concept of skills audit for identifying areas of development.</p>\\n\\n<p>&ndash; Coaching, mentoring and staff developing.</p>\\n\\n<p><strong>&ndash;&nbsp;</strong>Summary and personal development plan.</p>\\n","<p><strong>&ndash;&nbsp;</strong>Stakeholder Relations</p>\\n\\n<p>&ndash; Indicators of Network</p>\\n\\n<p>&ndash; Standards for successful public engagement</p>\\n"]',
                'related_courses' => '[231,211,142,154]',
                'category_id' => 41,
                'online' => 0,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:43:35',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:43:35',
            ),
