            66 => 
            array (
                'id' => 243,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Mastering Team Leadership Skills',
                'description' => '<p>Team working is vital to organizational success, and working in teams is much more effective than working with the old fashioned bureaucratic management. This has been well illustrated by first the Japanese experience and later in other countries around the world. But the transition from hierarchy to teamwork requires the study and application of the principles of team style management.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<h6>&nbsp; &nbsp;This Mastering Team Leadership Skills will provide essential team leadership skills to those who are newly promoted to the role.</h6>

<h6>&nbsp;</h6>

<p>The Five-days programme develops and improves leadership skills to enhance effectiveness within the team and organisation, enabling new team leaders to step up to their new responsibilities. It is also relevant to exist team leaders wanting to update their skills and to aspiring individuals who have the potential for future development into a team leader role.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
                'days_content' => '["<h6><strong>Building a High-Performance Team</strong></h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<p>&ndash; The Achievement of Teamwork.<br />\\n&ndash; High Performance Team Masterplan.<br />\\n&ndash; Recognising Effective Team Behaviours.<br />\\n&ndash; Identifying Ineffective Team Behaviours.<br />\\n&ndash; Comprehending Team Player Styles.<br />\\n&ndash; Handling Obstacles to Effective Teams.</p>\\n","<h6><strong>Leading Different Types of Teams</strong></h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<p>&ndash; Employing Teams.<br />\\n&ndash; Creating Virtual Teams through Technology.<br />\\n&ndash; Overcoming Resistance to Teamwork.<br />\\n&ndash; Meeting Team Performance Challenges.<br />\\n&ndash; Comprehending the Stages of Team Development.<br />\\n&ndash; Essential Skills for Team Leaders.</p>\\n","<h6><strong>Self-Motivation and Development</strong></h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<p>&ndash; Harnessing the Power of Your Abilities.<br />\\n&ndash; Choosing Empowering Beliefs and Values.<br />\\n&ndash; Building Your Self Confidence.<br />\\n&ndash; Maintaining a Positive Attitude.<br />\\n&ndash; Strengthening Determination and Commitment.<br />\\n&ndash; Turning Ideas into Action.</p>\\n","<h6><strong>Dealing with Team Conflict</strong></h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<p>&ndash; Defining Team Conflict.<br />\\n&ndash; Comprehending the Causes of Conflict.<br />\\n&ndash; The Thomas-Kilman Conflict Mode Instrument.<br />\\n&ndash; Dealing with Different Learning Styles.<br />\\n&ndash; Managing Conflict Effectively.<br />\\n&ndash; Obtaining the Benefits of Productive Disagreement.</p>\\n","<h6><strong>Dealing with Difficult Team Members</strong></h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<p>&ndash; Common Causes of Difficult People on a Team.<br />\\n&ndash; Types of Difficult People.<br />\\n&ndash; Adopting an Assertive Approach.<br />\\n&ndash; Models for Effective Counselling.<br />\\n&ndash; Managing the Difficult Team Member.<br />\\n&ndash; Dealing Appropriately with Personal Criticism.</p>\\n"]',
                'related_courses' => '[241,233,154,142]',
                'category_id' => 41,
                'online' => 0,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:43:35',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:43:35',
            ),
