            96 => 
            array (
                'id' => 287,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Advanced Interviewing Techniques for Managers and  Employers',
                'description' => '<p>The job interview is a chance to connect the dots and determine whether a candidate is really qualified for a job. Beyond the questions you ask, how you conduct the job interview is just as important. It&rsquo;s not always an easy meeting to navigate, but adopting best practice employer interview techniques can make a significant difference towards your outcome.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>People interviewing for jobs today often fail because they are using yesterday&rsquo;s strategies. Recruiting technology has become more sophisticated, and the best employers are constantly changing the way interviews are done.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Our Five-days&nbsp;<strong>Advanced Interviewing Techniques for managers and employers</strong> course gives you detailed strategies for handling tough competency-based, or behavioural, interviews so that you can communicate the knowledge, skills, and abilities that you have and that employer&rsquo;s demand.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>The&nbsp; Course&nbsp;provides effective interviewing techniques for employers and managers, to conduct successful interviews for selecting and attracting the right staff or candidate for the job role. This course&nbsp;will help you to become a better interviewer when recruiting and has been designed for managers who have had little formal training or experience within this area.</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
                'days_content' => '["<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6><strong>Fundamentals of interviews</strong></h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Importance of interviewing skills</li>\\n\\t<li>Identifying types of interviews</li>\\n\\t<li>Understanding pre-employment testing</li>\\n\\t<li>Success factors</li>\\n\\t<li>Identifying success factors</li>\\n\\t<li>Defining a job</li>\\n\\t<li>Analyzing and establishing the culture</li>\\n\\t<li>Writing success factors</li>\\n\\t<li>Using the Success Factor Worksheet</li>\\n\\t<li>Finalizing success factors</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6><strong>Planning and preparing</strong></h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Planning for an interview</li>\\n\\t<li>Analyzing a candidate&rsquo;s resume</li>\\n\\t<li>Identifying lead questions</li>\\n\\t<li>Identifying sample point questions</li>\\n\\t<li>Preparing an agenda</li>\\n\\t<li>Customizing an interview</li>\\n\\t<li>Preparing for an interview</li>\\n\\t<li>Making the office</li>\\n\\t<li>Ensuring privacy</li>\\n\\t<li>Defining personality styles</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6><strong>Handling and conducting</strong></h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Handling an interview</li>\\n\\t<li>Identifying types of candidates</li>\\n\\t<li>Understanding the importance of silence</li>\\n\\t<li>Doing an interview</li>\\n\\t<li>Opening the interview</li>\\n\\t<li>Gathering information</li>\\n\\t<li>Closing the interview</li>\\n\\t<li>Taking notes</li>\\n\\t<li>Identifying Effective communication techniques</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6><strong>Evaluating and deciding</strong></h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Evaluating a candidate</li>\\n\\t<li>Identifying types of bias</li>\\n\\t<li>Making a decision</li>\\n\\t<li>Ranking a candidate</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6><strong>Following up</strong></h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Following up after an interview</li>\\n\\t<li>Finding the appropriate candidate</li>\\n\\t<li>Identifying steps to follow up</li>\\n\\t<li>Understanding self-evaluation</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6><strong>Interviews laws</strong></h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>&nbsp;Identifying key points</li>\\n\\t<li>&nbsp;Identifying permitted and prohibited questions&nbsp;</li>\\n\\t<li>Answering questions Hiring employees</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
                'related_courses' => '[283,279,281,285]',
                'category_id' => 5,
                'online' => 0,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:43:38',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:43:38',
