            131 => 
            array (
                'id' => 329,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Quality Management Professional for Healthcare',
                'description' => '<p>This comprehensive program is designed to help participants understand the intricacies of quality management in the healthcare sector. With a particular focus on patient safety, process improvement, and compliance with regulatory standards, we aim to equip you with the skills and knowledge necessary to excel in healthcare quality management.</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Introduction to Quality Management in Healthcare<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Overview of Quality Management: Definitions and principles.</li>\\n<li>The Importance of Quality Management in Healthcare.</li>\\n<li>Patient Safety: Identifying and mitigating risks in healthcare.</li>\\n<li>Introduction to Healthcare Standards and Regulations.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Quality Improvement Processes<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Developing a Quality Improvement Plan.</li>\\n<li>Utilizing Process Improvement Methodologies (e.g., Six Sigma, Lean).</li>\\n<li>Root Cause Analysis in Healthcare.</li>\\n<li>Engaging Stakeholders in Quality Improvement Initiatives.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Tools and Techniques for Quality Control<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Introduction to Statistical Process Control in Healthcare.</li>\\n<li>Key Performance Indicators and Benchmarking.</li>\\n<li>Data Collection and Analysis for Quality Improvement.</li>\\n<li>Implementing Clinical Practice Guidelines to Standardize Care.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Compliance and Ethics in Healthcare Quality Management<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding Regulatory Standards (e.g., JCI, ISO in healthcare).</li>\\n<li>Ethical Considerations in Healthcare Quality Management.</li>\\n<li>Patient Rights and Confidentiality.</li>\\n<li>Developing a Compliance Program.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Leadership and Culture in Healthcare Quality Management<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Fostering a Culture of Quality and Safety.</li>\\n<li>Change Management in Healthcare.</li>\\n<li>Developing and Maintaining a Quality Management System.</li>\\n<li>Through engaging lectures, practical exercises, and discussions, participants will gain a thorough understanding of the critical role that quality management plays in delivering high-quality healthcare services.</li>\\n<li>This program will empower healthcare professionals with the tools and knowledge necessary to lead quality improvement initiatives within their organizations.</li>\\n</ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 7,
                'online' => 1,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:44:07',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:44:07',
            ),
            132 => 
            array (
                'id' => 330,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Process Management Mapping and Improvement',
                'description' => '<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Process Management refers to aligning processes with an organization&#39;s strategic goals, designing and implementing process architectures, establishing process measurement systems that align with organizational goals, and educating and organizing managers so that they will manage processes effectively.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>&nbsp;When it comes to understanding and improving processes, the science and art of process mapping becomes very handy. This is the main theme of this course which aims to develop process mapping skills for participants by helping them understand the different types of process mapping approaches from simple flow charts to value stream mapping.</p>

<p><br />
