            140 => 
            array (
                'id' => 340,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Writing HR Policies and Procedures',
                'description' => '<p>As companies start to grow, they need formal HR policies and procedures to effectively manage their human capital. Whether you&rsquo;re writing HR policies and procedures from scratch or updating your existing documentation, it&rsquo;s important to follow certain guidelines to ensure company-wide adoption .</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Human resource policies are formal rules and guidelines that businesses put in place to manage their employees. HR procedures, on the other hand, are step-by-step instructions that specify what actions should be taken to comply with these policies. Defining these policies and procedures is one of the core functions of human resource management.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>This course will provide the necessary skills for effectively writing HR policies and procedures. The course has been specifically designed for Human Resource professionals, administrators, and managers who are in charge of HR policies and procedures</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6><strong>Methodology of HR Management</strong></h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Role of HR management</li>\\n\\t<li>Understanding the HR deliverables model</li>\\n\\t<li>Concept of &ldquo;HR as Business partner&rdquo;</li>\\n\\t<li>Understanding the move from &ldquo;Traditional HR&rdquo; to &ldquo;Strategic HR&rdquo;</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6><strong>Human Resources Policies and Procedures</strong></h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Understanding the HR policies</li>\\n\\t<li>Understanding the HR procedures</li>\\n\\t<li>Importance of HR policies and procedures</li>\\n\\t<li>Developing the format of HR policies and procedures</li>\\n\\t<li>Understanding the importance of Statute inclusion</li>\\n\\t<li>Practical training on HR policy and procedures</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6><strong>Development of human resources procedures</strong></h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Nature&nbsp;of policies and procedures</li>\\n\\t<li>Policies versus procedures</li>\\n\\t<li>Why are HR policies and procedures required?</li>\\n\\t<li>Expressing values in HR policies and procedures</li>\\n\\t<li>Importance of statutory inclusions</li>\\n\\t<li>Formulating HR policies and procedures</li>\\n\\t<li>A partial list of policies</li>\\n\\t<li>Contents and sections of a policy</li>\\n\\t<li>Practical policy writing activities</li>\\n\\t<li>Differences between processes and procedures</li>\\n\\t<li>Considerations in developing processes and procedures</li>\\n\\t<li>Building your process</li>\\n\\t<li>Use of flowchart symbols</li>\\n\\t<li>Writing detailed procedures to support process maps</li>\\n\\t<li>Main considerations in developing HR procedures</li>\\n\\t<li>Developing HR procedures &ndash; practical application</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p><br />\\n&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6><strong>Creating HR Policy, Processes, Procedures</strong></h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Key indicators in creating/developing</li>\\n\\t<li>Use of Flowchart symbols</li>\\n\\t<li>Effective writing of policies and procedures in detailed format</li>\\n\\t<li>Understanding the development process</li>\\n\\t<li>Understanding the HR management system</li>\\n\\t<li>Review of the course and &ldquo;Question and Answer session&rdquo;</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n</ul>\\n","<h6><strong>Techniques of Writing</strong></h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Basic writing tips</li>\\n\\t<li>Writing in an impersonal style</li>\\n\\t<li>Organizing paragraphs and sentences</li>\\n\\t<li>Using simple, specific and positive language</li>\\n\\t<li>Using active verbs</li>\\n\\t<li>Applying easy and effective grammatical rules</li>\\n\\t<li>The gunning fog index for writing complexity&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</li>\\n\\t<li>Grammar and use of active verbs</li>\\n\\t<li>Writing not in a personal form</li>\\n\\t<li>How to organise and present?</li>\\n\\t<li>Why use simple, specific and positive language?</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<ul>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6><strong>Human Resources Management Systems (HRMS) and&nbsp;policies and procedures</strong></h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Introduction and briefing</li>\\n\\t<li>Relating HRMS to&nbsp;policies and procedures</li>\\n\\t<li>The various applications\\n\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t<li>Oracle human resources management system</li>\\n\\t\\t<li>Sap&nbsp;human resources management system</li>\\n\\t\\t<li>Other options</li>\\n\\t</ul>\\n\\t</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<ul>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
                'related_courses' => '[336,307,301,281]',
                'category_id' => 5,
                'online' => 0,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:44:08',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:44:08',
            ),
