ative</strong></h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Authorize teams to make decisions</li>\\n\\t<li>Provide a positive, encouraging environment</li>\\n\\t<li>Reward success</li>\\n\\t<li>Building Trust: the 4 C model to engage and empower others</li>\\n\\t<li>Programme review and commitment statement</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
