</ul>\\n","<h6><strong>Driving Strategic Performance &amp; Success</strong></h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Transforming the organization to enable strategic success</li>\\n\\t<li>Monitoring and adjustment</li>\\n\\t<li>Balancing the focus on performance and strategy</li>\\n\\t<li>Spreading leadership capabilities throughout the organization</li>\\n\\t<li>Maximizing organizational learning and knowledge transfer to embed strategic success</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
