h6>Risk-based Audit Engagement: Control Evaluation</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Managing risks</li>\\n\\t<li>Definition of control</li>\\n\\t<li>Types of controls</li>\\n\\t<li>Evaluating controls</li>\\n\\t<li>Tools for evaluating controls</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Risk-based Audit Engagement: Communicating Results</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Purpose of communicating</li>\\n\\t<li>Why audit reports fail to communicate</li>\\n\\t<li>Communicating an audit observation</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Risk-based Audit Engagement: Implementation Challenges</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Roadblocks to success</li>\\n\\t<li>Personal implementation challenges</li>\\n\\t<li>Possible solutions&nbsp;</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
                'related_courses' => '[278,459,549,783]',
                'category_id' => 8,
