ty</li>\\n\\t<li>Measure Success and ROI</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<h6><strong>Digital Transformation Strategy Development &ndash; Group Work</strong></h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Keeping Up With Change &ndash; Do&rsquo;s and Don&rsquo;ts</li>\\n\\t<li>Digital Strategy &ldquo;Dragons Den&rdquo;</li>\\n\\t<li>Strategy Completion &amp; Feedback</li>\\n\\t<li>Digital Transformation Strategy Plan</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
