            'description' => '<p>In today&rsquo;s fast-paced, ever-changing business environment, an organisation&rsquo;s ability to respond is key to survival and success. It is not the &lsquo;organisation&rsquo; however that decides when, why or how to respond, it&rsquo;s the people within it. Organisation Development (OD) is rooted in the deep connection between the best business processes and structures and the people working with them.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Practising OD means balancing economic growth and impact with human systems perspectives, building an agile, resilient and emotionally intelligent workforce, promoting compassionate, ethical and sustainable leadership and organisational practices, and having a clear sense of purpose. It is concerned with creating great organisations and cultures!</p>

