            302 => 
            array (
                'id' => 517,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Fundamentals of Investment Management',
                'description' => '<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Investment management is a booming industry responsible for the handling and generation of large quantities of money. And for vast numbers of monetary transactions across the globe.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Investment management services include elements of asset and stock selection, financial analysis and continuous monitoring of investments, and implementation of investment plans. As a part of financial services provided, investment management companies are today employing investment or fund managers and staff in great numbers and focusing on generating impressive revenues.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>This Course in Investment Management covers a whole host of interesting topics, including: The Financial System and its Elements, Introduction to Market Instruments, Investments and Asset Classes, and Principles in Investing.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>The course will teach you everything you need to know to become an Investment Manager.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<h6><strong>Investment Management Fundamentals</strong></h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<p>In this section the role played by investment managers within the financial markets is covered. The spotlight on clients and their needs allows participants to place the markets in context.</p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Introducing the Investment Markets and Investment Fundamentals</li>\\n\\t<li>Sources of Investment Return Drivers</li>\\n\\t<li>Understanding Investments Statistics</li>\\n\\t<li>Investment Performance Measurement</li>\\n\\t<li>Economic Impact on the Financial Markets</li>\\n\\t<li>What are the financial markets and why do they exist?</li>\\n\\t<li>The major players and the role of the investment banks( Investors &ndash; Borrowers )</li>\\n\\t<li>Key investor clients within financial markets</li>\\n\\t<li>Institutional investors ( Pension Funds- Insurance Companies &ndash; Sovereign Wealth Funds )</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6><strong>Bespoke Investment Management Process</strong></h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<p>Solutions offered to key clients and the style of asset management are discussed.</p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>9 stages in the investment management process</li>\\n\\t<li>Client investment objectives</li>\\n\\t<li>Active vs. passive investment</li>\\n\\t<li>Benchmarks</li>\\n\\t<li>Equity Valuation and Stock Selection</li>\\n\\t<li>Style Bets in the Markets</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<h6><strong>Asset Classes for Investment</strong></h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<p>Language and jargon of the major asset classes are covered, at a fundamental level.</p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Features of equity</li>\\n\\t<li>Features of bonds( Government- Corporate)</li>\\n\\t<li>Features of foreign exchange</li>\\n\\t<li>Introducing the Investment Markets and Investment Fundamentals</li>\\n\\t<li>Sources of Investment Return Drivers</li>\\n\\t<li>Understanding Investments Statistics</li>\\n\\t<li>Investment Performance Measurement</li>\\n\\t<li>Economic Impact on the Financial Markets</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<h6><strong>Risk and Return</strong></h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<p>Clients are buying risk and return from the investment management industry.</p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Introducing the Investment Markets and Investment Fundamentals</li>\\n\\t<li>Sources of Investment Return Drivers</li>\\n\\t<li>Understanding Investments Statistics</li>\\n\\t<li>Investment Performance Measurement</li>\\n\\t<li>Economic Impact on the Financial Markets</li>\\n\\t<li>Modern portfolio theory</li>\\n\\t<li>Assessing portfolio performance</li>\\n\\t<li>Measurement of risk and return ( Sharpe ratio- Information ratio)</li>\\n\\t<li>Investment products</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6><strong>Where the Industry is heading: New Trends in Investment Management</strong></h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Are Structured Finance and Engineered Products a new wave Again?</li>\\n\\t<li>Hedge Fund Strategies Overview</li>\\n\\t<li>The Other Alternative Assets &ndash; The Commodity Markets</li>\\n\\t<li>Real Estate and Real Assets</li>\\n\\t<li>Private Equity</li>\\n\\t<li>Obtaining Alternative Investment</li>\\n\\t<li>The Major Trends in the Investment Management Industry</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
                'related_courses' => '[515,509,185,183]',
                'category_id' => 34,
                'online' => 0,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:44:56',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:44:56',
            ),
