n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Duration attribution</li>\\n\\t<li>Yield curve analysis and decomposition</li>\\n\\t<li>Yield curve attribution</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<h6><strong>Performance Measurement and Attribution for Derivatives</strong></h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Futures</li>\\n\\t<li>Swaps</li>\\n\\t<li>Options, warrants and convertible bonds</li>\\n\\t<li>Market neutral attribution: 130/30 funds</li>\\n\\t<li>Multi-period Attribution</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
