<p>The Managing Data Protection Compliance course &nbsp;is made of two units: <strong>First:</strong> Data Protection Compliance &mdash; covers the fundamental concepts of data protection law including key definitions and the data protection principles, and looks at basic measures organisations can take to comply with relevant parts of the legislation. <strong>Second:</strong> Applying Data Protection Law in Practice &mdash; builds on the unit above to develop knowledge about how to apply the legal requirements in a practical setting.</p>

