strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li>Risk communication process</li><li>General management and Leadership styles</li><li>Motivational and management theories</li><li>Conflict management</li></ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[546,584,583,502]',
                'category_id' => 44,
                'online' => 1,
