            337 => 
            array (
                'id' => 555,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Business Strategy Essentials',
                'description' => '<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>A business strategy creates a vision and direction for the whole organisation. It is important that all people within a company have clear goals and are following the direction or mission of the organisation. A strategy can provide this vision and prevent individuals from losing sight of their company&#39;s aims.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Learn to use planning tools and techniques and when to apply them. Become more self-aware of the leadership styles and preferences and reflect on the impact on the implementation of strategies and plans. The ability to communicate and delegate will affect staff engagement and consequently the success of your plans.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>This&nbsp;Business Strategy Essentials course&nbsp;will provide high calibre staff, team leaders and professionals with the knowledge and skills to contribute to strategy formulation and implementation. Delegates will acquire strategic awareness and learn how this impacts operational activities.</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Is Strategic Thinking Relevant to all managers?</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Ask yourself if Is strategy an art or a science?</li>\\n\\t<li>Learn How to think strategically.</li>\\n\\t<li>The tasks of leaders and stakeholders in strategy progression.</li>\\n\\t<li>Does strategy equate to renovation?</li>\\n\\t<li>How operational and middle leaders participate?</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<h6>Turning Strategies into Plans</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Mission, vision, values and goal settings.</li>\\n\\t<li>Aligning persons and goals.</li>\\n\\t<li>Methods &amp; strategies for arranging.</li>\\n\\t<li>Preparing for the unpredictable.</li>\\n\\t<li>Tasks, liabilities and duties.</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>The Leadership Role in implementing Strategies</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>If technics and plans demand change, how do people react?</li>\\n\\t<li>Your leadership style(s)</li>\\n\\t<li>The function of managers in querying and listening</li>\\n\\t<li>How to proceed methods and plans:\\n\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t<li>Encouragement.</li>\\n\\t\\t<li>Delegation.</li>\\n\\t\\t<li>Managing accomplishment.</li>\\n\\t</ul>\\n\\t</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Effects of Power on Strategic success</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Organisational rituals and practices.</li>\\n\\t<li>What is Power and how is it presented?</li>\\n\\t<li>Collaboration &amp; challenge.</li>\\n\\t<li>Individual methods for running networks and relationships.</li>\\n\\t<li>Coping with pressure.</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Why a Strategic Outlook supports Career Progression?</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>progressing method in 21st Century Organisations.</li>\\n\\t<li>More conventional method improvement: Kotter&rsquo;s Eight Stage model.</li>\\n\\t<li>Key management skills required for career advancement.</li>\\n\\t<li>Individual Leadership enhancement Plans.</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
