Software Selection.</li>\\n\\t</ul>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>Data Entry and Data Management.</li>\\n\\t<li>Writing Up the Information System Plan.</li>\\n\\t<li>Conclusion.</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Equipment Planning</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Warehouse Equipment Planning Methodology.\\n\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t<li>Define Functions to Be Performed.</li>\\n\\t\\t<li>Identify Equipment Alternatives.</li>\\n\\t\\t<li>Evaluate the Equipment Alternatives.</li>\\n\\t\\t<li>Present Value.</li>\\n\\t\\t<li>Evaluating Alternatives: A case Study.</li>\\n\\t\\t<li>Select the Equipment.</li>\\n\\t\\t<li>Identify and Select the Vendor.</li>\\n\\t</ul>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>Conclusion</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Types of Warehouse Equipment</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Dock Equipment.</li>\\n\\t<li>Storage Equipment.</li>\\n\\t<li>Material Handling Equipment.</li>\\n\\t<li>Conclusion.</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Planning Warehouse Staff Requirements</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Determine the Tasks to Be Performed.</li>\\n\\t<li>Determine the Operating and Clerical Personnel Requirements.</li>\\n\\t<li>Determine Administrative Personnel Requirements.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Planning Warehouse Personnel-Related Areas and Services</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Warehouse Offices.</li>\\n\\t<li>Food Services.</li>\\n\\t<li>Lavatories.</li>\\n\\t<li>Locker Rooms.</li>\\n\\t<li>Medical Facilities</li>\\n\\t<li>Safety Concerns</li>\\n\\t<li>Employee Parking</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
