rong>Post-project</strong></p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Objectives met?</li>\\n\\t<li>Budget sign-off.</li>\\n\\t<li>Customer appraisal.</li>\\n\\t<li>Project review document.</li>\\n\\t<li>Team reassigned.</li>\\n\\t<li>Transfer of responsibilities.</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
