sign, Technology &amp; Process Risk</li>\\n\\t<li>Procurement &amp; Specification risk</li>\\n\\t<li>Variations and Cost Impact</li>\\n\\t<li>Payment and Multi- currency Contracts</li>\\n\\t<li>Delay, Liquidated Damages and Extensions of Time (EOT)</li>\\n\\t<li>Completion and Testing &amp; Effects of Acceptance</li>\\n\\t<li>Using Contractual Clauses to Manage Liabilities and Risks</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<h6><strong>Contract Completion &ndash; Critical Issues</strong></h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Acceptance of Punch List of Defects -&nbsp;<em>What is the effect?</em></li>\\n\\t<li>Passing of Tile and Risk -<em>&nbsp;Safety &amp; Insurance</em></li>\\n\\t<li>Warranties and Guarantees</li>\\n\\t<li>Passing of Intellectual Property Rights</li>\\n\\t<li>Defects -&nbsp;<em>Exculpatory Clauses</em></li>\\n\\t<li>Dealing with Disputes &ndash;&nbsp;<em>Considering the Different Options</em></li>\\n\\t<li>Discussion on Issues Participants have Faced and How It was Handled</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
