nd reinforcement</li>\\n\\t<li>Concrete mixes and specifications in repair.</li>\\n\\t<li>Methods of repair slabs, beams, columns and foundations</li>\\n\\t<li>Best ways of using epoxy in repair</li>\\n\\t<li>Case study for repair ring beam for tanks</li>\\n\\t<li>Case study for repair foundation</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<h6>A new modern method for repair</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Repair by using steel sections</li>\\n\\t<li>CFRP for repair</li>\\n\\t<li>Principal of CFRP design</li>\\n\\t<li>Integrity management system</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
