<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>It is crucial that you develop an effective plan that will enable you to test your product or service, and make any necessary alterations and developments that may be needed for improvement. It all starts from coming up with a realistic idea and turning it into a business.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Business Start-Up&nbsp;Training&nbsp;course will lead you through the intersection of the lean start-up and design thinking, focused on creative industries, and by the end of the course you will have tested and validated business concept, and have practiced pitching your concept to others.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>By the end of the course, you will have discussed and evaluated all the core elements of your business plan and will have a received extensive feedback on your business ideas. You will have a more clearly defined value proposition, which is based on a better understanding of your customers&rsquo; needs, and your strengths as a founder, and you will be ready to take your idea forward, and pitch to customers and potential funders.</p>',
