duction distribution agreements</li>\\n\\t<li>Joint ventures in the oil industry</li>\\n\\t<li>Practical examples</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Production and decommission phase agreements</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>The main form of a crude oil sale agreement</li>\\n\\t<li>Abandonment, decommissioning and restoration</li>\\n\\t<li>The principle contracts for the end of the lifecycle of a petroleum field</li>\\n\\t<li>Principle methods of payment under the agreement</li>\\n\\t<li>Principle forms of crude oil sale agreements</li>\\n\\t<li>The role of letters of credit</li>\\n\\t<li>Practical examples</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
