, guarantees and letters of assurance</li>\\n\\t<li>Solutions for rapid risk management</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<h6>Management of Conflict and &ldquo;How to solve them&rdquo;</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Understanding on how to create contracts for avoiding conflicts</li>\\n\\t<li>Steps for solving multi-level conflict</li>\\n\\t<li>Steps for contract negotiation</li>\\n\\t<li>Importance of Laws and contracts and Litigation and Arbitration in a contract</li>\\n\\t<li>Process of conflict management</li>\\n\\t<li>Review of the course and &ldquo;Question and Answer session&rdquo;</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
