                    468 => 
                    array (
                        'id' => 694,
                        'lang_code' => 'en',
                        'name' => 'Essential Skills for Project Scheduling and Planning',
                        'description' => '<p>Project Planning and Scheduling is one of the most important activities for a Project Manager when starting and managing any type of project. Many mistakes are made during the first few weeks shaping the project scope, leading up to a plan and a schedule.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Efficient project planning is very important for a project as many times late delivery causes a lot of problems to project managers worldwide. Many numbers of projects have gone past/over-run their delivery period due to lack of planning and scheduling of a project which leads to loss as the cost increase and thus causes inefficiency.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Thus, Essential Skills for Project Scheduling and Planning&nbsp; training course on efficient skills for project planning and scheduling will teach the methods and techniques for stepwise project planning to improve work efficiency and thus increase the profits</p>',
                        'duration' => '5',
                    'days_content' => '["<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Fundamentals of Project Planning</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Introduction to project management</li>\\n\\t<li>Introduction to project planning</li>\\n\\t<li>How to execute a project plan?</li>\\n\\t<li>Understanding the type of constraints to a project : &ldquo;Time&rdquo;, &ldquo;Cost&rdquo; and &ldquo;Scope&rdquo;</li>\\n\\t<li>Delivery of a project</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Fundamental of Project Scheduling</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Understanding of the economic impacts and interest rates impact on a project due to delay</li>\\n\\t<li>Understanding the concept of &ldquo;Work Break-down Structures&rdquo;</li>\\n\\t<li>Training on preparation of &ldquo;Gantt Charts&rdquo;- for preparing project schedule</li>\\n\\t<li>Understanding the concept of &ldquo;Float&rdquo;</li>\\n\\t<li>Understanding the concept of Precedence diagram method(PDM)</li>\\n\\t<li>Methodology of Building schedule</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Scheduling of Network and Critical Way</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Introduction to activity development</li>\\n\\t<li>Training on network calculations</li>\\n\\t<li>Understanding the concept of &ldquo;Forward and Backward pass&rdquo;</li>\\n\\t<li>Introduction to &ldquo;Lead and Lag&rdquo; scheduling</li>\\n\\t<li>Understanding the importance of (Project Evaluation and Review technique) (PERT)</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Methodology of Advanced Planning Techniques and Project Control</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Training on preparation of LSM (Line of balance schedule)</li>\\n\\t<li>Understanding the system of project control</li>\\n\\t<li>Understanding the analysis of earned value</li>\\n\\t<li>Understanding the concept of earned value reporting</li>\\n\\t<li>Methodology of the &ldquo;Resource Allocation Algorithm&rdquo; &ndash; for prioritising resources</li>\\n\\t<li>Methodology for &ldquo;Time and Cost trade-off&rdquo;</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Schedule and Reporting of Project Progress</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Tracking and monitoring of the progress of a project</li>\\n\\t<li>Methods for acceleration of a project schedule</li>\\n\\t<li>&ldquo;How does the project schedule fail or Crash?&rdquo; &ndash; understanding and prevention methods</li>\\n\\t<li>Understanding the concept of &ldquo;Lean Project Management&rdquo; &ndash; a systematic method for elimination of waste</li>\\n\\t<li>Review of the course and &ldquo;Question and Answer session&rdquo;</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
                        'related_courses' => '[611,497,699,707]',
                        'category_id' => 44,
                        'online' => 1,
