n and where project contracts need to be used and how they should be managed.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Present the risk back to your sponsor and understand financial implications.</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Comprehend how to develop the project financial budget.</li>\\n\\t<li>Comprehend what critical project elements that constantly need monitoring.</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<h6>&nbsp;Handling Change</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Comprehend how to be active in managing change.</li>\\n\\t<li>Comprehend what to do if the project is behind schedule or over budget.</li>\\n\\t<li>What is the best way to manage a customer when change requires extra budget or time<strong>.</strong></li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Handle the Change</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Comprehend the best way of interfacing with your stakeholders during meetings.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;It is time to meet with the customer and tell them about the change.</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Actions, Issues and Change &hellip; how to report on them.</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<h6>&nbsp;Finishing the Project</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Comprehend the best way to complete a project.</li>\\n\\t<li>Distinguish the best way of transitioning projects to the customer.</li>\\n\\t<li>Comprehend how to make the best use of lesson learnt.</li>\\n\\t<li>Comprehend how can to turn a complicated project into a big success.</li>\\n\\t<li>How well should the project manager know the customer and Comprehending why it is important.</li>\\n\\t<li>Comprehending strategies on how project managers can improve the relationship with their customers</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
