<p>Repairing and rehabilitation is a booming industry, so if you are having plans to change your career, then join this Course to be a part of an Upcoming Advanced Industry in Construction.</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<h6>Introduction to Causes of Damage in a Structure</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Process of concrete deterioration</li>\\n\\t<li>Sulphate attack and Chemical attack on concrete</li>\\n\\t<li>Reinforcement corrosion</li>\\n\\t<li>Defects in construction</li>\\n\\t<li>Case studies</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Prediction and Assessment of Damage in a Concrete Structure</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Planning and strategies for predicting damage in a structure</li>\\n\\t<li>Visual inspection of damage in a structure</li>\\n\\t<li>NDT &ndash;Tests on a structure to predict damage</li>\\n\\t<li>Predicting service life of a structure</li>\\n\\t<li>Case studies</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<h6>Main Focus (Repair and Rehabilitation of structures)</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Introduction to concrete repair and rehabilitation</li>\\n\\t<li>Repair methods and material required for repairing</li>\\n\\t<li>Prevention techniques of reinforcement corrosion</li>\\n\\t<li>Repair guidelines as per ACI-562.</li>\\n\\t<li>Patch repairing</li>\\n\\t<li>Case studies<strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></li>\\n</ul>\\n","<h6>Case Studies and Crack Repair Methods</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Concrete crack repair methods and guidelines</li>\\n\\t<li>Prevention techniques of damage as per guidelines</li>\\n\\t<li>Service life extension techniques</li>\\n\\t<li>Case studies</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<h6>Repair Guidelines as per ACI-562</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Added repair guidelines as per ACI-562</li>\\n\\t<li>The repair contractor&rsquo;s duties</li>\\n\\t<li>The material supplier&rsquo;s duties</li>\\n\\t<li>Review of the entire week and &ldquo;Question and Answer session&rdquo;</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
                'related_courses' => '[490,258,706,620]',
                'category_id' => 19,
