elief Systems</li>\\n\\t<li>Pressure Relief Valves vs. Rupture Discs</li>\\n\\t<li>Codes, Standards and Best Practices</li>\\n\\t<li>Specifics of Pressure Relief Systems for Pumps, Compressors, Turbines</li>\\n\\t<li>Process Plant Disposal Systems</li>\\n\\t<li>Disposal Hazards, Risk Assessment and Environmental Factors</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<h6>Process Monitoring and Control</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Safety Instrumented Systems</li>\\n\\t<li>Process Plant Monitoring and Control System: SCADA</li>\\n\\t<li>Emergency De-Pressuring Systems (EDP)</li>\\n\\t<li>Prevention of Fire and Gas or Dust Explosions</li>\\n\\t<li>Safety Consideration in Plant Layout and Equipment Spacing</li>\\n\\t<li>Management of Change and Integrity Operation Window</li>\\n\\t<li>Plant Equipment Inspection and Maintenance Procedures</li>\\n\\t<li>Final Conclusions</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
                'related_courses' => '[824,586,590]',
                'category_id' => 15,
                'online' => 1,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:46:04',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:46:04',
