            140 => 
            array (
                'id' => 877,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Project Management with Primavera P6',
                'description' => '<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Primavera P6 is an enterprise project portfolio management solution aimed at enhancing project management efficiency. Primavera P6 boosts efficiency by reducing costs, mitigating risks, and robust delivery of projects. As the industry dynamics is fast changing due to economic uncertainties and fluctuating demand on the delivery front makes project management looks for efficient methods to execute projects.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Primavera P6 software is developed by Oracle to manage multiple projects identifying the key roles of the team and assign tasks following a work breakdown structure. Primavera P6 offers project management tools that help project management executives to maintain the project schedule aligned with the budget.&nbsp;</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Project Management with Primavera P6&nbsp;Training course is focused on practical application of Project Management using Primavera P6. Similarly if you are working in small or a medium scale firm, or if you are new to Project Management and Primavera, you will get to know all the required core concepts of Project Management along with examples and you will learn their implementation in Primavera P6 from start to end.</p>

<p><br />
This course is so designed that it covers every aspect of implementation. If you are working in large scale firms then you will get a picture of how projects are managed there. This will make you able to organize projects, control access to projects, organize and control resources and in effectively planning, monitoring and controlling of the project.<br />
&nbsp;</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<h6>Introduction to Project Management Body of Knowledge (PMBOK)</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>An overview of Project Schedule Management.</li>\\n\\t<li>Fundamentals of Project Management.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Introduction to Primavera Systems and Oracle Primavera P6 PPM</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Primavera P6 Installation.</li>\\n\\t<li>Primavera P6 Interface and Preferences.</li>\\n\\t<li>Understanding P6 Data.</li>\\n\\t<li>Access Control in Primavera P6.</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<h6>&nbsp;Enterprise Project Structure</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Work Breakdown Structure.</li>\\n\\t<li>Planning your Work Schedule.</li>\\n\\t<li>Understanding a Sample Project.</li>\\n\\t<li>Creating a New Project in Primavera P6.</li>\\n\\t<li>Project Window Options.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n</ul>\\n","<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<h6>Understanding Project Must Finish and Total Float</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Role of Calendars in Scheduling.</li>\\n\\t<li>Understanding and Adding Calendars.</li>\\n\\t<li>Project and Database Default Calendar.</li>\\n\\t<li>Creating WBS in Primavera P6.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Understanding Percentage Complete Types</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Understanding Activity Types.</li>\\n\\t<li>Setting Defaults for New Activities.</li>\\n\\t<li>Adding Activities.</li>\\n\\t<li>Estimating Duration of Activities.</li>\\n\\t<li>Adding Duration of Activities.</li>\\n\\t<li>Understanding Relationships.</li>\\n\\t<li>Adding Relationships and Scheduling.</li>\\n\\t<li>Understanding Scheduling Algorithm.</li>\\n\\t<li>Scheduling Options.</li>\\n\\t<li>Formatting Bars, Columns and Timescale.</li>\\n\\t<li>Group, Sorts and Layouts.</li>\\n\\t<li>Filtering in Primavera P6.</li>\\n\\t<li>Printing, Exporting and Importing.</li>\\n\\t<li>Reporting in Primavera P6.</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Understanding and Adding Baseline</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Updating a Project.</li>\\n\\t<li>Assigning Baselines and Monitoring a Project.</li>\\n\\t<li>Adding and Assigning New Currency.</li>\\n\\t<li>Understanding Roles, Resources and Expenses.</li>\\n\\t<li>Adding Resources.</li>\\n\\t<li>Duration Types in Primavera P6.</li>\\n\\t<li>Assigning Resources and Reviewing Resource Allocation.</li>\\n\\t<li>Adding Expenses.</li>\\n\\t<li>Developing Project Funding Requirements and Cost S-curve.</li>\\n\\t<li>Updating a Project with Resources and Expenses.</li>\\n\\t<li>Question and Answers.</li>\\n\\t<li>Discussion on Final Reports.</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
