            150 => 
            array (
                'id' => 889,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'The IT Leadership Programme',
                'description' => '<p>During these difficult and unpredictable times it has been technology leaders and their teams that have kept countless organisations working, without them many businesses would simply have ground to a halt. &nbsp;Tech has never been more central to organisations&rsquo; strategic priorities. &nbsp;This puts strong tech leaders and professionals in a great position, it also raises the stakes. &nbsp;</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>New skills and approaches will be needed to make you indispensable, being able to lead from a distance will require exceptional communication skills. Managing in an IT environment can greatly differ from traditional management practices.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>If you are transitioning from a technical expert to a manager or wishing to improve your management skills why not immerse yourself in the online IT Leadership Programme.&nbsp;</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>The IT Leadership Training course designed for IT managers looking to develop their IT leadership skills. &rdquo; It is a highly practical course, focusing on the leadership skills that have the biggest impact on business performance and career success. It is delivered by former CIOs and uses a variety of training styles, combining high quality presentations with case studies, role-plays, business simulations and round table discussions.&nbsp;</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
                'days_content' => '["<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp; &nbsp;Personal Leadership</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>How CIOs optimize time and activity</li>\\n\\t<li>Secrets of successful CIOs</li>\\n\\t<li>Leadership opportunities for IT professionals</li>\\n\\t<li>Building and maintaining reputation</li>\\n\\t<li>Developing a personal brand</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<h6>&nbsp; &nbsp;Peer Leadership</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Assessing your style of leadership</li>\\n\\t<li>Recognizing leadership styles in others</li>\\n\\t<li>Influencing strategies for the different leadership styles</li>\\n\\t<li>Corporate politics &mdash; the inside track</li>\\n\\t<li>Developing successful political networks</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<h6><em><strong>&nbsp;</strong></em></h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;Team Leadership</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>A model for high performing IT teams</li>\\n\\t<li>Understanding your team&rsquo;s dynamics</li>\\n\\t<li>Building and motivating IT teams</li>\\n\\t<li>Developing staff in real time</li>\\n\\t<li>Organizing IT teams to maximize performance</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<h6><strong>&nbsp;</strong> &nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<h6>Technology&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Innovation Leadership</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>The process of innovation and the creative mind-set</li>\\n\\t<li>Techniques to foster innovation</li>\\n\\t<li>The importance of technology in innovation</li>\\n\\t<li>Selecting the best innovation ideas</li>\\n\\t<li>Lanterns to the future &mdash; creating technology vision</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<h6><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;Corporate Leadership</strong></h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>T leaders at board level &mdash; what CEOs look for</li>\\n\\t<li>The responsibilities of IT corporate leadership</li>\\n\\t<li>A process model for IT to business alignment</li>\\n\\t<li>Technology governance structures</li>\\n\\t<li>IT&rsquo;s brand &ndash; aligning reality and perception</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
                'related_courses' => '[205,239,631]',
