t<li>Review Project Performance and/or Work Tasks Carried out by Contractor:</li>\\n\\t<li>How Effective was the Project and/or Work Task Planning?</li>\\n\\t<li>How Well Did the Contractor Perform?</li>\\n\\t<li>How Did the Job Go Generally?</li>\\n\\t<li>Record The Lessons Learned and Develop Appropriate Improvements</li>\\n\\t<li>Key Point Summary of Course Topics</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
