g the quality of concrete</li>\\n\\t<li>Understanding soil investigation and challenges of soil mechanics</li>\\n\\t<li>Precaution during construction foundations</li>\\n\\t<li>Skills of Checking:\\n\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t<li>The Construction Elements</li>\\n\\t\\t<li>The Design Drawings</li>\\n\\t\\t<li>The Soil Investigation Report</li>\\n\\t</ul>\\n\\t</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<h6>Changes, Claims, Counter Claims, and Dispute Resolution</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Causes of Change and How to Effectively Manage Changes</li>\\n\\t<li>Claims, Counter Claims, and Disputes</li>\\n\\t<li>Negotiation Strategies to Manage Multiple Claims and Disputes</li>\\n\\t<li>Complex Changes, Claims, and Disputes Management</li>\\n\\t<li>Alternative Dispute Resolution (ADR) Tools and Techniques (Mediation and Arbitration)</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
