            200 => 
            array (
                'id' => 946,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Data Analysis Fundamentals',
                'description' => '<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>The world is becoming more and more data-driven, with endless amounts of data available to work with. Big companies like Google and Microsoft use data to make decisions, but they&rsquo;re not the only ones.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Data analysis is used also by small businesses, retail companies, in medicine, and even in the world of sports. It&rsquo;s a universal language and more important than ever before. It seems like an advanced concept but data analysis is really just a few ideas put into practice.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Data analysis&nbsp;is&nbsp;important&nbsp;in business to understand problems facing an organisation, and to explore&nbsp;data&nbsp;in meaningful ways.&nbsp; Data&nbsp;in itself is merely facts and figures.&nbsp;Data analysis&nbsp;organises, interprets, structures and presents the&nbsp;data&nbsp;into useful information that provides context for the&nbsp;data.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>The main purpose of the Data Analysis Fundamentals training course is to give the attendees a practical knowledge and good understanding of real-world data analysis . The course includes data analysis process, visualisations, data sharing, and creating professional and easy to understand dashboards.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
                'days_content' => '["<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Introduction to data analysis solutions</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Recognize the Value of Using Data to Answer Questions and Address Business Issues</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Explain How Data Has Become the Strategic Business Asset It Is Today</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Data analytics and data analysis concepts</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Introduction to the challenges of data analytics</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Volume &ndash; data storage</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Introduction to Amazon S3</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Introduction to data lakes</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Introduction to data storage methods</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p><br />\\n&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Velocity &ndash; data processing</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Discover Usable Data: Its Source, Type, Value, Quality, Location, and Relationships</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Profile the Data to Determine What Is Important or Relevant</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Organize and Manage Data Appropriately</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Acquire Data from Any Source</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Introduction to data processing methods</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Introduction to batch data processing</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Introduction to stream data processing</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Variety &ndash; data structure and types</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Introduction to source data storage</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Introduction to structured data stores</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Introduction to semistructured and unstructured data stores</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Identify and Resolve Problems Associated with Data Collection</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Articulate the Pros and Cons of Data Manipulation</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Determine If Data Samples Are Adequate</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Create a Table That Is Ready to Be Analyzed</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Value.&nbsp; Reporting, business intelligence and Analyzing the Data</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Introduction to analysing data</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Introduction to visualizing data</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>&nbsp;Understand Which Data-Analysis Tools Best Answer Common Analytical Business Questions</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Articulate How the Microsoft&reg; Excel Analysis ToolPak and Other Programs Can Be Used for Advanced Data Analysis</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Choose the Appropriate Tool and Technique to Analyze Your Data</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Putting the pieces together</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Veracity &ndash; cleansing, transformation</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Understanding data integrity</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Understanding database consistency</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Introduction to the ETL process</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
                'related_courses' => '[1024,1026,1030,1036]',
