                'id' => 1010,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Community Development and Leadership',
                'description' => '<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>We believe that community leaders are made, not born&ndash; which is why we invest so much time and effort into leadership development and training. We also believe that people learn best by doing, which is why our training always focuses on putting the theory and the skills into practice.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>The Community Development and&nbsp; Leadership training&nbsp;course offers the knowledge in Community Development, and covers the values, concepts, and practices commonly found in the community development sector, showing you how to consider community health in trying to understand community development. You will learn to identify and address serious issues in your community.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>The&nbsp;course will ensure that you get a clear understanding of the will learn about the different media channels that can be used to engage the public, how to develop t improve your knowledge and skills of community development.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
