\n\\t<li>Successful Partnerships In Community Development - Lesson Summary.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Community Development - Evaluating And Sustaining The Project</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Community Development - Evaluating and Sustaining the Project - Learning Outcomes Choosing an Evaluation Format.</li>\\n\\t<li>Evaluation Methods.</li>\\n\\t<li>Sustaining Momentum.</li>\\n\\t<li>Community Development - Evaluating and Sustaining the Project - Lesson Summary.</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;Diversity And Inclusion</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Introduction to Diversity and Inclusion.</li>\\n\\t<li>Issues and Challenges.</li>\\n\\t<li>An Organizational Change Strategy Steps to Inclusivity.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Tools And Techniques For Implementing Inclusiveness</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Tools and Techniques for Implementing Inclusiveness.</li>\\n\\t<li>Outcomes Planning Inclusive Events.</li>\\n\\t<li>Responding to Opposition Sample Terms of Reference.</li>\\n\\t<li>Assessing the Community Demographic.</li>\\n\\t<li>Encouraging Diverse Community Involvement Key Representative Interviews.</li>\\n\\t<li>Conducting Focus Groups.</li>\\n\\t<li>Organizational Self-Assessment Tool.</li>\\n\\t<li>Roles and Responsibilities of Stakeholders Evaluating Your Success.</li>\\n\\t<li>Tools and Techniques for Implementing Inclusiveness.</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Planning Health Promotion Programs</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Planning Health Promotion Programs - Learning Outcomes Manage the Planning Process.</li>\\n\\t<li>Conduct a Situational Assessment.</li>\\n\\t<li>Set Goals, Audiences and Outcome Objectives.</li>\\n\\t<li>Choose Strategies and Activities and Assign Resources Develop.</li>\\n\\t<li>Indicators.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<h6>Seeking Funding For Community Projects</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Seeking Funding For Community Projects - Learning Outcomes Developing Program Plan.</li>\\n\\t<li>Seeking Funding.</li>\\n\\t<li>Manage the Proposal Development Process Developing Your Proposal.</li>\\n\\t<li>Producing and Packaging Proposal Submitting Proposal and Follow-Up.</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
