            261 => 
            array (
                'id' => 1036,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
            'name' => 'Mastering of Business Administration (MBA)',
                'description' => '<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>The contemporary business environment is defined by frequent and considerable change; in industry, markets, and technological advances. The MBA Essentials from London Premiere centre (LPC) arms you with essential hard and soft business skills to not only react and adapt to such changes but to excel in any business context. Using an immersive, interactive, and supported learning model, you&rsquo;ll enhance your managerial and leadership competencies at a fraction of the cost and commitment of a traditional MBA.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Mastering of Business Administration ( MBA) training course, balances the knowledge and theory which will enable you to think differently and make better decisions with the practical skills and techniques required to achieve a greater impact within your organisation. You&rsquo;ll also have the opportunity to expand your professional network by collaborating and engaging with an international cohort of like-minded business leaders on the course.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Enhance your managerial and leadership competencies with this course covering the key management skills essential for the successful running of any organization.&nbsp;This 10-Days course focuses on three core pillars of business management and leadership:&nbsp; the Strategic Environment, the Financial Toolkit, and the Human Element. Using a case study-based approach,</p>',
                'duration' => '10',
                'days_content' => '["<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Leading with influence</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>&nbsp;Evaluate the most effective persuasion tactics and principles to influence a business situation.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>The Strategic Environment: Economics for managers</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Understand the key economic principles and market forces that affect business.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Competitive strategy</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Explain why firms need to gain a competitive advantage, and how to create this advantage.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;Corporate strategy</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Discover how companies can grow and expand their business activities.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Financial accounting</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Explore the principles of accounting to improve your financial expertise.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Management accounting</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Explore the use of financial tools to make better business decisions.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;Analysing financial statements</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Learn how to analyse financial statements to identify problem areas</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>In the mind of the manager</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Discover techniques for minimising bias in judgements about people and finances in the workplace.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Nudging&rdquo; behaviour</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Learn how to influence your peers and the decisions made by consumers.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Organisational culture as a leadership tool</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Explore when culture change might be necessary to meet strategic objectives.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n"]',
