alancing</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Integration of Estimating, Planning &amp; Control</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Lean Project Management: Concept and Applications</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
