g Mandatory Schemes</li>\\n\\t<li>Voluntary Offsetting Market</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<h6>Carbon trading - Current schemes and future developments&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Several emissions trading schemes (ETSs) operating across the World</li>\\n\\t<li>The comparison of different trading systems of the World</li>\\n\\t<li>The future of carbon trading</li>\\n\\t<li>Broadening sectoral and GHG coverage</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
