            310 => 
            array (
                'id' => 1090,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Professional Report and Writing Skills',
                'description' => '<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>A report can be defined as a testimonial or account of some happening. It is purely based on observation and analysis. A report gives an explanation of any circumstance. In today&rsquo;s corporate world, reports play a crucial role. They are a strong base for planning and control in an organization, i.e., reports give information that can be utilized by the management team in an organization for making plans and for solving complex issues in the organization.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>A report discusses a particular problem in detail. It brings significant and reliable information to the limelight of top management in an organization. Hence, on the basis of such information, the management can make strong decisions. Reports are required for judging the performances of various departments in an organization.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Professional Report and Writing Skills training course equips delegates with the skills of planning, research, structuring, writing, editing, and presenting reports. Practical exercises and discussion throughout the course will give you a toolkit to use when report writing. This course will help Participants to be competent and confident in their written communication to senior management or important</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
                'days_content' => '["<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Overview of a Technical Report</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>How to Analyze Audience Characteristics?</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Deciding on relevant information to help the report achieve its purpose</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Structuring and sequencing that creates order and encourages the reader to read on</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Process of Writing</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Identifying the Sections of a Technical Report</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Use vocabulary that helps understanding and gets results</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Developing a persuasive tone to reinforce the argument</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Identifying Mechanical Elements</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Fundamentals</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>How sentences and paragraphs can give rhythm and pace to our writing</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Will my report get a positive response from my reader?</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>How to edit and proofread effectively</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Examining Methods of Research Papers</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Writing the Paper</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Gaining an understanding of how a report is structured &ndash; beginning, middle and end</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Choosing the best format for your purpose</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Developing a Thesis statement</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>How to Cite Sources</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Gaining an understanding of how a report is structured &ndash; beginning, middle and end</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Choosing the best format for your purpose</p>\\n\\t</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n"]',
                'related_courses' => '[819,553,937,535]',
