e</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Getting the Best from People</li>\\n\\t<li>Techniques for Resolving Conflict</li>\\n\\t<li>Conflict Management Programmes</li>\\n\\t<li>The Ground Rules</li>\\n\\t<li>Workplace Investigations</li>\\n\\t<li>The Importance of Good Records &ndash;&nbsp;<em>consider cloud-based software</em></li>\\n\\t<li>Personal Development Planning</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
