pment</li>\\n\\t<li>e-learning and its various applications</li>\\n\\t<li>The impact of social media on learning and development</li>\\n\\t<li>Digital learning assessment</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Performance management</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Closing the talent gap faster</li>\\n\\t<li>Enhancing the accuracy of performance assessment</li>\\n\\t<li>Systematic performance management acceptability</li>\\n\\t<li>New assessment methodologies</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Digitalization as a strategic partner</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>HR metrics and measurements</li>\\n\\t<li>Big data concepts and uses</li>\\n\\t<li>HR and cloud management</li>\\n\\t<li>A roadmap for solid HR digitalization processes</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
