ewable Energy</li>\\n\\t<li>Pricing Analysis for Biomass Projects</li>\\n\\t<li>Development Costs in Renewable Projects</li>\\n\\t<li>Value and Costs of Development and Research Stage</li>\\n\\t<li>Modelling Exploration and Development Options&nbsp;</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
