 study</li>\\n<li>Identifying and selecting benchmarking Metrics &amp; Partners</li>\\n<li>Running effective Lean and Agile projects and processes</li>\\n<li>Integrating performance management with Lean and Agile</li>\\n<li>The role of benchmarking in change management</li>\\n</ul>"]',
