            1 => 
            array (
                'id' => 1303,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Climate Emergency Programme',
                'description' => '<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>With rising temperatures and frequent natural disasters, the world is in a state of a climate emergency. Radical and urgent change is needed. Innovative companies can capture opportunities from the transition to global environmental sustainability, and fundamentally transform the way they do business.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>By attending the Climate&nbsp;Emergency Programme, you&#39;ll explore the critical need for change, as well as identify business opportunities that arise from addressing this emergency.&nbsp;</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>The Climate Emergency Training course will empower you to take the required action. Over the course period , you&rsquo;ll discover how to navigate risks and capture opportunities through catalysing change and reconceptualising the way you do business.&nbsp;</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Public sector professionals, policymakers, regulators, and those involved in non-profit organisations will learn to address the climate emergency from a systemic perspective, and gain the skills to integrate sustainability practices into business. While consultants will enhance their expertise and be able to advise clients on methods of climate-positive action.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
                'days_content' => '["<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Tackle the problem: The climate emergency</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Demonstrate an understanding of the role of business in the climate emergency</li>\\n\\t<li>Outline the importance of accessing relevant and up-to-date climate data</li>\\n\\t<li>Articulate your role in your system in relation to the climate emergency</li>\\n\\t<li>Identify ways to prioritise personal resilience while confronting the climate emergency</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Experience the future: Climate risks and opportunities</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Review the role of business in the climate emergency</li>\\n\\t<li>Examine the current state of business to determine climate-related risks and opportunities in your industry</li>\\n\\t<li>Interpret the implications of the climate emergency for the future</li>\\n\\t<li>Use scenario planning to understand the potential future for your system and how you might put this analysis into practice today</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Reimagine the future: Frameworks for a new economic system</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Explain the importance of considering a range of approaches to changing economic systems</li>\\n\\t<li>Determine the potential impact of new economic frameworks on definitions of growth in your industry</li>\\n\\t<li>Articulate the limitations of a linear economy in facilitating sustainable growth</li>\\n\\t<li>Justify which elements of new economic frameworks you would use to achieve goals in your organisation</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<h6>Address the emergency: Business model innovation</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Demonstrate an understanding of how and where systems are changing, and the impact these changes have on your business model</li>\\n\\t<li>Review how organisations are transforming their business models today</li>\\n\\t<li>Determine opportunities for innovation in your organisation based on your understanding of the business model transformation others are undertaking</li>\\n\\t<li>Apply an experimental approach to business model transformation</li>\\n\\t<li>Recommend how your organisation could adopt new business practices as part of transforming its business model</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Drive collective action: Collaboration</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Articulate the importance of building collaborative projects and relationships for your organisation as you address the climate emergency</li>\\n\\t<li>Investigate the different types of stakeholders your organisation may need to collaborate with</li>\\n\\t<li>Recommend how to communicate with a collaborator in a particular scenario</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Shape the future: Plan for climate action</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Deduce the change process your organisation may need to undertake to address the climate emergency</li>\\n\\t<li>Catalyse others to co-create a change plan</li>\\n\\t<li>Compile a customised change plan to address the climate emergency</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
                'related_courses' => '[1299,1301,1062,589]',
                'category_id' => 45,
                'online' => 0,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:48:27',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:48:27',
            ),
