            47 => 
            array (
                'id' => 1355,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Inventor Nastran : Linear and Nonlinear-Static Analysis',
                'description' => '<p>Inventor Nastran is&nbsp;a software for engineering simulation of stress, dynamics, and heat transfer in structures. Inventor Nastran Details. Inventor Nastran. Inventor Nastran Community. Inventor Nastran is a software for engineering simulation of stress, dynamics, and heat transfer in structures.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Inventor Nastran: Linear and Nonlinear-Static Analysis training course is an instructor designed and led, bespoke course that has been designed to provide an overview of the Basic and Advanced analysis types available at your disposal in Inventor Nastran.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>This course will make the Nastran&rsquo;s users capable of analysing parts and assemblies in order to check the design Serviceability. The participants will go through many powerful tools that help them in examining any structures. The aim of doing this course is &lsquo;&rsquo;how I can obtain results close to the reality&rsquo;&rsquo;</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>',
                'duration' => '3',
            'days_content' => '["<p>09.00 &ndash; 09.30 Introduction</p>\\n\\n<p>09.30 &ndash; 10.15 Part Analysis</p>\\n\\n<h6>10.15 &ndash; 10.30 Break</h6>\\n\\n<p>10.30 &ndash; 11.30 Part Analysis- Mesh Technique, and mesh quality</p>\\n\\n<p>11.30 &ndash; 12.00 Stress Singularity</p>\\n\\n<h6>12.00 &ndash; 12.30 Break</h6>\\n\\n<p>12.30 &ndash; 13.15 Assembly Analysis- Contacts Type</p>\\n\\n<p>13.15 &ndash; 14.00 Questions and Answers</p>\\n","<p>09.00 &ndash; 09.30 Introduction</p>\\n\\n<p>09.30 &ndash; 10.15 Connectors (Bolts connection + Rigid Connectors)</p>\\n\\n<h6>10.15 &ndash; 10.30 Break</h6>\\n\\n<p>10.30 &ndash; 11.30 Thin structure (Shell element)</p>\\n\\n<h6>11.30 &ndash; 11.45 Break</h6>\\n\\n<p>11.45 &ndash; 12.30 Beam Elements</p>\\n\\n<p>12.30 &ndash; 13.15 Mixed Elements</p>\\n\\n<p>13.15 &ndash; 14.00 Session close (Questions &amp; Answers)</p>\\n","<p>09.00 &ndash; 09.30 Introduction to Nonlinear Analysis</p>\\n\\n<p>09.30 &ndash; 10.00 Nonlinear</p>\\n\\n<h6>10.00 &ndash; 10.15 Break</h6>\\n\\n<p>10.15 &ndash; 10.45 Geometric Nonlinearity</p>\\n\\n<p>10.45 &ndash; 11.15 Elastic properties</p>\\n\\n<p>11.15 &ndash; 12.00 Flexure test</p>\\n\\n<p>12.00 &ndash; 13.00 Impact Test</p>\\n"]',
