L AREAS</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li>HR (Human Resources) functions and activities</li><li>Project Management and Planning - an overview.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>THE IMPORTANCE OF THE CLIENT</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li>Why are customers so important</li><li>How to keep this&nbsp;in focus</li><li>Complaint Handling</li></ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[574,1318,910,554]',
