            100 => 
            array (
                'id' => 1414,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
            'name' => 'Certified Planner (AICP) (Preparation Course)',
            'description' => '<p><span style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);">Planning plays a crucial role in shaping human settlements, aiming to create sustainable, functional, and inclusive environments. The Certified Planner (AICP) designation is recognized as a standard of professional competence in the field of planning, encompassing a broad range of knowledge in urban and regional development. Certified planners are responsible for balancing social, economic, and environmental considerations to develop strategies that address the complexities of land use, infrastructure, and community needs. This involves a deep understanding of spatial analysis, community engagement, and policy formulation to create plans that are both effective and aligned with legal frameworks.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);">The Certified Planner (AICP) course builds on these foundational principles, offering participants comprehensive training in the core competencies of planning. Through this course, participants will explore research methodologies and data collection strategies, learn to develop and implement plans and policies and gain the skills to monitor and evaluate their effectiveness. A key component of the course is its emphasis on communication and leadership, essential for engaging stakeholders and guiding projects toward successful outcomes. Additionally, the course provides focused preparation for the AICP exam, ensuring that participants are equipped with the knowledge and skills required for certification and advancing their careers in planning.</span></p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Fundamental Planning Knowledge</strong><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Definition of planning and its historical context</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Analyzing the patterns of human settlement</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding the legal principles and statutory basis of planning</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Introduction to planning theories</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring the core values of planning</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing the way of using technology in planning and its tools</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing responsibilities according to the APIC code of ethics</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Research and Assessment Methods</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring research types and methodologies</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Distinguishing between qualitative and quantitative research</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Identifying and evaluating data sources</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding the methodology of spatial analysis and its techniques</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Determining the importance of community engagement in understanding a community</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring data collection strategies and tools for identifying planning issues</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Planning and Policy Development</strong><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Introduction to planning aspects and plan preparation process</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Recognizing the importance of understanding state and federal laws</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding the process of formulating and drafting policies</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Steps for developing interrelated vision, goals, objectives, and priority statements</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing the importance of engaging stakeholders and communities in scoping a plan, policy, and project</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Methods and techniques for addressing conflict interests and demands</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing funding and financing strategies for plan implementation</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring ways of addressing community character and form</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Plan Implementation</strong><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Steps of developing rules, regulations, and policies for implementation</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Methods for assessing proposals and projects for consistency with adopted plans and regulations</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Strategies for building strategic partnerships to facilitate plan implementation</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing common types of challenges in plan implementation and their mitigation methods</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Best practices for assigning responsibilities and drafting action steps</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Tools and techniques for monitoring and evaluating plans and policies</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Communication, Management, and Leadership</strong><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding the principles of clear and effective communication</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Determining the role of leadership in public decision-making and support of plan-making</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing the importance of promoting social justice and considering cultural sensitivity during communication</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Techniques for developing an evidence-based argument to support policies and actions</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing the aspects of internal and external management</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring coaching and mentoring techniques used by managers and leaders</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding the planner’s approach to complex problem-solving and decision-making</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Mock-up Exam </span></li></ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 8,
                'online' => 0,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:49:03',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:49:03',
            ),
