ols | Development | Legal | Tools of the trade</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li>Design Standards and Urban Design</li><li>Capital Improvement Programs</li><li>Incentives: Public, Private and Instutional</li><li>Real Estate Economics</li><li>Construction impacts | Capital, operating, maintenance and lifecycle cost</li><li>Ownership rights | Case law | Land, building, fire and related codes</li><li>Visual evaluation tools | GIS | Graphic presentation of quantitative information</li></ul>"]',
