            'description' => '<p>Competency-based Human Resource Management (HRM) has become a significant area in HR. Competency-Based Human Resource Management details the way to transform the human resource department with the intention that job competencies &ndash; instead of job descriptions &ndash; become the building blocks for all HR efforts.&nbsp;</p>

