mpliance roles and responsibilities.</li>\\n\\t<li>Apply the three stages of the Compliance Cycle when developing a CMS.</li>\\n\\t<li>Use the ACA Compliance Checklist (and other resources) to plan and document compliance activities.</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<h6><strong>Managing the Collection Floor</strong></h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Describe effective inventory management strategies.</li>\\n\\t<li>Operate a compliant collection floor.</li>\\n\\t<li>Develop key performance indicators (KPIs) to measure performance.</li>\\n\\t<li>Develop and understand efficient, effective, and compliant practices for the collection floor.</li>\\n\\t<li>CASE STUDIES | Previous year exam questions</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
