                'lang_code' => 'en',
            'name' => 'Professional Collection Specialist Designation (PCS)',
                'description' => '<p>Collection specialist oversee the financial collection department of a company and are responsible for the correct invoicing of clients and the timely receiving of payment. They also observe and review the interactions of staff members with clients to ensure that collections are done according to company policies and regulations.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

