                'duration' => '5',
                'days_content' => '["<h6><strong>Development of the The Project</strong></h6><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li>Define goals and objectives.</li><li>Establish a budget.</li><li>Build your team.</li><li>Pick your venue and date.</li><li>Develop event branding.</li><li>Plan your program.</li><li>Confirm sponsors, exhibitors, and speakers.</li><li>Identify and select tech tools.</li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: black;\\">Management of Risk, Finance and Human Resources</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li>Exploring risk identification and assessment techniques and tools</li><li>Discussing strategies for effective management of contracts</li><li>Strategies to manage event funding and financial resources</li><li>Understanding the process of developing a budget for a meeting/ event</li><li>Discovering the way of establishing and managing monetary transaction procedures</li><li>Exploring techniques for assessing staffing needs and determining selection criteria&nbsp;</li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: black;\\">Meeting or Event Design</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li>Discovering the steps of developing a program: From theme development to outcome measurement</li><li>Understanding how to select and engage speakers and performers</li><li>Discussing guidance and strategies for selecting and coordinating food and beverage</li><li>Identifying criteria for selecting design requirements and decorations</li><li>Recognizing the importance of managing and oversing audiovisual and technical requirements</li><li>Discussing how to plan for managing attendees’ movements and controlling protocols&nbsp;</li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: black;\\">Site Management</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li>Discussing criteria for selecting meeting/ event site</li><li>Tools and techniques for developing site maps and floorplans</li><li>Steps of creating a logistics plan to manage meeting/ event site</li><li>Determining the importance of implementing the logistics plan during site set-up, operation, and takedown</li><li>Best practices for managing on-site communication</li><li>Discussing how to set communication procedures and protocols for each audience&nbsp;</li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: black;\\">Marketing</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li>Understanding the process of developing a marking plan</li><li>Exploring strategies for creating and managing marketing materials, including content and designs</li><li>Identifying the importance of aligning product design and specification with the marketing plan</li><li>Discovering different types of promotional activities to expand market reach</li><li>Discussing the role of public relations activities in promoting and succeeding meetings/ events</li><li>Best practices for managing meeting-related sales activities</li><li>Do and don’t for CMP exam</li></ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
