<p>With a Carbon Management Plan in place, your organisation will have clarity of direction and a well-defined set of projects that will enable you to meet your commercial goal (cost-saving and revenue-generating) and meet compliance/supply chain requirements and employee engagement. In short, this sets you up to be a better business</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Fundamentals of Carbon Management Training course provides you with the tools and information needed for measuring and managing your organisation&#39;s carbon emissions. This course will equip individuals with an understanding of Climate Change, Greenhouse Gases, Carbon and Energy.&nbsp;</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>The course includes key learning around the key drivers of climate change, measurement, methodologies, application and performance management.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

