            186 => 
            array (
                'id' => 1505,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Digital Transformation and Innovation',
                'description' => '<p>Although disruption has long been a threat for some industries, the rise of digital technologies has accelerated the pace of disruption in virtually every industry, creating immense ambiguity and unease.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Meanwhile, uncertainty continues to accelerate in the broader business environment as the rate at which new technologies emerge increases exponentially - all while competition becomes increasingly fierce. The dominance of established leaders has never been more under threat.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>The Digital Transformation training course is designed to offer professionals a comprehensive understanding of the pace of digitalization and the imperative it creates in the business landscape. This comprehensive Digital Transformation training takes professionals through the frameworks that help them identify the key areas to digitize including strategy, core process and technology.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Digital Transformation and Innovation course is ideal for professionals with a strong desire to gain mastery of the various opportunities for digital technology and data management practices to transform their businesses.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><br />
&nbsp;</p>',
                'duration' => '10',
            'days_content' => '["<h6><strong>Living in a Digital World</strong>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>What is Digital Transformation?</li>\\n\\t<li>Tradition Linear Value Chain</li>\\n\\t<li>Homing and Switching Costs</li>\\n\\t<li>Two Sided-Networks</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<h6>Digital Transformation Domains</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Customers</li>\\n\\t<li>Competition</li>\\n\\t<li>Data</li>\\n\\t<li>Innovation</li>\\n\\t<li>Value</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<h6>Overview of Customer Networks</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Customer Network Paradigm</li>\\n\\t<li>Marketing Funnel</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Introduction to Digital Customer Behaviours</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Access Strategy</li>\\n\\t<li>Engage Strategy</li>\\n\\t<li>Customise Strategy</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<h6>Platform Business Models</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Overview of Platforms</li>\\n\\t<li>Platforms Types</li>\\n\\t<li>Platform Business Model Map</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<h6>Artificial Intelligence (AI) in Business</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Basics of Machine Learning (ML)</li>\\n\\t<li>How to Apply AI and ML in Business</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<h6>Basics of Big Data at Work</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>New Unstructured Data Sources</li>\\n\\t<li>Unstructured Data Tools</li>\\n\\t<li>Templates of Value</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<h6>Business Innovation Through Experimentation</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Principles of Experimentation</li>\\n\\t<li>Convergent Experimental Method</li>\\n\\t<li>Divergent Experimental Method</li>\\n\\t<li>Value Proposition Adaptation</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<h6>Planning &amp; Preparing for Transformation</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Taking stock of a Businesses&rsquo; current position</li>\\n\\t<li>Defining the End State</li>\\n\\t<li>Building a Plan</li>\\n\\t<li>Delegate Self-analysis</li>\\n\\t<li>Key principles; Do&rsquo;s &amp; Do Not&rsquo;s</li>\\n\\t<li>Building the Guiding Team</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Aligning Goals, People and Systems</h6>\\n\\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Getting All on Board</li>\\n\\t<li>Dealing with Resistance</li>\\n\\t<li>Managing People through Change</li>\\n\\t<li>Project and Programme Management</li>\\n\\t<li>Monitoring &amp; Control</li>\\n\\t<li>Sustainment</li>\\n</ul>\\n","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<h6>Executing on Digital</h6>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>How to execute your digital strategy&nbsp;</li>\\n\\t<li>Strategic agility&nbsp;</li>\\n\\t<li>Data culture</li>\\n\\t<li>Resource accumulation&nbsp;</li>\\n\\t<li>Executing on AI strategies</li>\\n</ul>\\n"]',
