                'lang_code' => 'en',
            'name' => 'Preparation for Certified Asset Management Assessor (CAMA)',
            'description' => '<p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">Preparation for Certified Asset Management Assessor (CAMA) course&nbsp;establishes an individual\'s credentials in asset management knowledge and comprehension, globally.</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">This course prepares asset management professionals who are considering writing the Certified Asset Management Assessor Exam. CAMA certification is not only for current or future assessors. This certification benefits professionals who want to demonstrate their understanding of true asset management and the new standard for management systems for AM for which ISO 55001 exists.</span></p><p><br></p><p>﻿This course is a preparation course, and designed to equip you with the necessary skills and knowledge to prepare for the certification, should you choose to pursue it in the future</p>',
