            'name' => 'Certified International Supply Chain Professional (Preparation Course)',
            'description' => '<p>This Certification Program is a core certification program of the International Purchasing And Supply Chain Management Institute.</p><p><br></p><p>This program offers the designation of CISCP (Certified International Supply Chain Professional, Entry Level) to candidates who demonstrate their understanding of the fundamentals of the profession through the successful completion of rigorous professional certification examinations based upon the INTERNATIONAL SUPPLY CHAIN MANAGEMENT BODY OF KNOWLEDGE (ISCMBOK).&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>This course is a preparation course, and designed to equip you with the necessary skills and knowledge to prepare for the certification, should you choose to pursue it in the future</p>',
