 font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">What is and is not permissible during change communication&nbsp;</span></p>","<p style=\\"margin: 0in;\\"><strong><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">The main factors that cause an organisational change</span></strong></p>\\n<p style=\\"margin: 0in;\\"><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">&middot;<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Understand change from the perspective of the corporate culture</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">&middot;<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Components of company and institutions culture&nbsp;</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">&middot;<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Types of cultural change in institutions and companies</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">&middot;<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Common mistakes in dealing with changing the current culture</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;\\"><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\"><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"text-indent: -24px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">&middot;<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"text-indent: -24px; font-size: 11pt;\\">20 steps to support change in company culture</span></span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;\\">&nbsp;</p>"]',
