rative adaptation to situations of change</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">&middot;<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">A needs assessment for a change</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">&middot;<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Preparing and planning for change</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">&middot;<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">&nbsp;Kotter\'s 8 - Steps Change Model</span></p>","<p style=\\"margin: 0in;\\"><strong><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Understanding and coping with resistance to change</span></strong></p>\\n<p style=\\"margin: 0in;\\"><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">&middot;<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Individuals and organisational change</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in 1.0in;\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Courier New\';\\">o<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Why do people resist change?</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in 1.0in;\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Courier New\';\\">o<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Forms of resistance to change and ways to deal with it</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in 1.0in;\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Courier New\';\\">o<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Individual factors versus group factors</span></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\"><br /><!-- [if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br /><!--[endif]--></span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">&middot;<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Stages of individual adaptation to organisational change</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo6; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in 1.0in;\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Courier New\';\\">o<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Model (SARAH)</span></p>\\n