"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Understanding the business need</span></p>","<p style=\\"margin: 0in;\\"><strong><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Considering the Options</span></strong></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">&middot;<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Distinguishing between needs and wants</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">&middot;<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Performing an options analysis</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">&middot;<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Creative thinking and problem-solving</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">&middot;<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Consideration of the risks and opportunities.</span></p>","<p style=\\"margin: 0in;\\"><strong><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">The Risk Assessment</span></strong></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">&middot;<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">The risk management process and application.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">&middot;<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Identifying and assessing the risks of the preferred option.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">&middot;<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Identifying and managing key stakeholders.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">&middot;<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Establishing the cost estimate.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">&middot;<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Contingency determination.</span></p>","<p style=\\"margin: 0in;\\"><strong><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">The Feasibility Assessment and Evaluation</span></strong></p>\\n<p style=\\"margin: 0in;\\"><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">&middot;<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Determining the most feasible option.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">&middot;<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Financial analysis techniques.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">&middot;<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Methods that ignore the time value of money and flows.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">&middot;<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Discounting methods</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">&middot;<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Net Present Value, Internal Rate of Return</span></p>","<p style=\\"margin: 0in;\\"><strong><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Preparing the Report</span></strong></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">&middot;<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Developing the feasibility report.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">&middot;<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Understand the characteristics of proper communication.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">&middot;<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Identifying how interpersonal relationships ensure successful feasibility studies.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">&middot;<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Real case feasibility study review and analysis</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">&middot;<span style=\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\">Summary, key messages and learning outcomes</span></p>"]',
