style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Identifying the impact of education policy on the labour market</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Gender and Labor Market Outcomes&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding the theory of discrimination and its impact</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Recognizing gender disparities in wages and employment</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understand the gender pay gap and its causes</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing the role of policies in reducing gender inequality in the labour market</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Identifying the importance of diversity and inclusion in the workplace</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Real-world examples of discrimination and the gender pay gap</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Economics of Immigration&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the term of Brain Drain</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the impact of immigration on the labour market of source and destination countries</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Identifying the impact of immigration on wages and employment rates</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the economic assimilation of immigrants</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Recognizing the impact of public policy on immigration outcomes and labour market integration</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Case studies on immigration and its outcomes on the labour market</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Optimal Compensation Systems</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding the theories of agency and efficiency wage</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Recognizing the relationship between salaries and employee productivity</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Identifying the characteristics of an optimal compensation system</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Methods and techniques for designing optimal compensation systems for different types of employment</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Distinguishing between performance-based and incentive-based compensation</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Techniques for assessing pay equity and fairness in compensation systems</span></li></ul>"]',
