                'id' => 1611,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Foundations for Business Leadership',
                'description' => '<p><span style="color: #212529; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica Neue, Arial, Noto Sans, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol, Noto Color Emoji;">Foundations for Business Leadership</span><span style="font-size: 16px; color: #212529; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; background-color: #ffffff;">&nbsp;is a powerful new virtual learning experience which rapidly prepares you to step up to general management without the need to travel for study.</span><br style="font-size: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; background-color: #ffffff;" /><br style="font-size: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; background-color: #ffffff;" /><span style="font-size: 16px; color: #212529; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; background-color: #ffffff;">You can take Global Management Foundations as a stand-alone program or as credit toward your IMD Executive MBA degree if you are considering a longer learning journey.</span></p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<div><strong>Build your foundations</strong></div>\\n<div>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n</div>\\n<div>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Entrepreneurship</li>\\n<li>Strategic thinking</li>\\n<li>Negotiation</li>\\n<li>Accounting</li>\\n</ul>\\n</div>","<div><strong>Leadership bootcamp</strong></div>\\n<div>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n</div>\\n<div>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Leading self and others (with coaching)</li>\\n<li>Team contracting</li>\\n<li>Experiential exercise (VR)</li>\\n<li>Feedback and action planning</li>\\n<li>Moving forward</li>\\n</ul>\\n</div>","<div><strong>Lead in a changing world</strong></div>\\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\\n<div>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Operations &ndash; supply chain management</li>\\n<li>Business finance for executives</li>\\n<li>Future-ready strategies</li>\\n<li>Digital marketing strategies</li>\\n</ul>\\n</div>","<div><strong>Real impact</strong></div>\\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\\n<div>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Economics</li>\\n</ul>\\n</div>","<div>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Building executive presence</li>\\n<li>Integrative consulting project with external organization</li>\\n</ul>\\n</div>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 41,
