            282 => 
            array (
                'id' => 1617,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Forecasting and Demand Planning, Best practice',
                'description' => '<p class="MsoNormal">Demand management requires aligning with consumer trends, historical sales and seasonality data, amongst other factors. It also looks at constantly changing circumstances that affect demand. These factors include regulatory changes, economic shifts, labour force changes, natural disasters, weather patterns, or global crisis events. Therefore, demand planning should be a continuous process ingrained in your business. Ambitious organisations must effectively plan to meet it.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
<p class="MsoNormal">This course will give you a perspective on demand planning principles and success drivers and describe the best practices that firms use today. You will be able to identify the relevant business process, tools, and people capabilities, that are critical to ensure an efficient and successful demand planning function.</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
                'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Demand Management Overview</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Overview of Demand Planning</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Definition of Demand</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Sources of Demand</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Definition of Demand Management</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Customer of the Demand Plan</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Benefits of Demand Planning</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Challenges in Demand Planning and management</p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","<p><strong>Role of the Demand Planning Organisation</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Demand Planners &ndash; Role, Responsibilities, and Expectations</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Demand management within Supply Chain</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Effective Demand Planning Process characteristics and behaviors</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Integration with Planning &amp; Control function</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Best Practices, Examples, and Principles</p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","<p><strong>Forecasting</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>The four pillars of Forecasting</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Principles of Forecasting</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Quantitative and Qualitative Forecasting</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Probabilistic forecasting.</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Moving average demand</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Linear regression</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Seasonal trends</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Sales forecast</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Tracking Forecast Accuracy</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Determining Safety Stock</p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","<p><strong>Performance Measurements</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>How to Use Performance Measurements</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Monthly Planning Cycle</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Demand Plan Accuracy Measurement</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>When to Measure</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Planning Strategies</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Process Measurements</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Examples</p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","<p><strong><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Demand Planning Best Practices</span></strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Demand Planning Best Practices</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Get buy-in and demand accountability</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Have accurate inventory data</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Demand sensing / Assessing factors affecting demand</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Actively shaping demand with marketing, promotion, and pricing tools</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Due diligence when choosing &amp; implementing the right demand planning software</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Improvement Methodology and Mindset</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Addressing Critical Issues</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Case Studies and hands-on exercises</span></li>\\n</ul>"]',
