<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>This Value Engineering (VE) course is a creative, organized approach which engages project stakeholders to define their business or performance requirements, maximises creativity and innovation to identify best value solutions, enabling more robust, effective decision-making during project planning, procurement and execution and through focusing on performance requirements and avoiding abortive work.</p>
