            292 => 
            array (
                'id' => 1629,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Advanced Value Engineering',
                'description' => '<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Value engineering is a systematic approach aimed at achieving the desired functions of a product, a process, a system, or a service at minimum overall cost without affecting the quality, reliability, performance and safety. It is neither a glorified suggestion program nor a means of cheapening an item, process, or procedure. It does, however, seek to eliminate unnecessary costs. VE is not about selecting the cheapest option; instead, it is about realizing the best value for money, improving the productivity, competitiveness, and effectiveness of organizations, and stimulating innovation.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>This course is designed to provide the participants with expert guidance for securing real benefits and cost savings by implementing VE in their projects with a greater emphasis on the development of project scope, cost estimates, design solutions, and budgets.&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>The course significantly enhances creative thinking, problem-solving, objective assessment, and informed decision-making skills within the project management context.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
                'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Framework for Applying Value Engineering in Projects:</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p>&bull; What is Value?</p>\\n<p>&bull; What is Value Engineering? Why is it important?</p>\\n<p>&bull; Defining Value Engineering concepts and principles</p>\\n<p>&bull; How and when is Value Engineering applied?</p>\\n<p>&bull; Project stakeholders analysis and management</p>\\n<p>&bull; Understanding teamwork and cross-functional Project Teams and team player styles</p>","<p><strong>The Function Analysis Phase - Expressing Project Functional Needs and Constraints:</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Overview of Different Value Engineering Phases / Job Plan</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>The Information Phase &ndash; steps and procedures</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>The need for Function Analysis in projects</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Developing FAST Diagrams to identify critical project components and perform project value analysis</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Defining project constraints &ndash; relationships and trade-offs</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Aspects of Cost Estimating</p>","<p><strong>The Creative Phase - Inspiring Creativity in Your Project Team:</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p>&bull; Risk Management</p>\\n<p>&bull; Relationships between Value, Cost and Worth</p>\\n<p>&bull; Facilitation skills</p>\\n<p>&bull; Creativity and Creative thinking within the project environment</p>\\n<p>&bull; Creativity techniques as applied to optimize project value</p>\\n<p>&bull; Blocks to creativity within the project team</p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","<p><strong>The Evaluation Phase - Making Informed Project Decisions:</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p>&bull; Reaching consensus and leveraging the power of project team collaboration</p>\\n<p>&bull; Idea selection</p>\\n<p>&bull; Evaluation methods and value criteria</p>\\n<p>&bull; Development phase</p>\\n<p>&bull; Techniques in problem-solving</p>\\n<p>&bull; Life-cycle costing analysis</p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","<p><strong>The Planning and Reporting Phases - Getting Results Through Effective Communication:</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Effective Decision-making in a project environment</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Develop action plans and assign project roles and responsibilities</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Reporting VE findings to Senior Management and project stakeholders</p>\\n<p>&bull;<span style=\\"white-space: pre;\\"> </span>Integrating VE into the project process and Continuous Improvement and application at project initiation</p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[1627,1621]',
                'category_id' => 44,
                'online' => 1,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:49:59',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:49:59',
