<p>&nbsp;</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Introduction to Project Planning and Control</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>What is Project Planning and Control?</li>\\n<li>Benefits of Project Planning and Control</li>\\n<li>Principles and Concepts of Project Planning and Control</li>\\n<li>Roles and Responsibilities of Project Planning and Control</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","<p><strong>Project Planning and Control Foundation Level</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Project Planning and Control Framework</li>\\n<li>Planning and Scheduling Techniques</li>\\n<li>Resource Management</li>\\n<li>Budgeting and Cost Management</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","<p><strong>Project Planning and Control Foundation Level (continued)</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Risk and Issue Management</li>\\n<li>Quality Management</li>\\n<li>Change Control</li>\\n<li>Progress Monitoring and Reporting</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Project Planning and Control Practitioner Level</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Project Planning and Control Process</li>\\n<li>Integrated Planning and Control</li>\\n<li>Advanced Scheduling Techniques</li>\\n<li>Benefits and Value Management</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","<p><strong>Project Planning and Control Practitioner Level (continued)</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Stakeholder Management</li>\\n<li>Communication and Information Management</li>\\n<li>Leadership and Teamwork</li>\\n<li>Exam tips and preparation</li>\\n</ul>"]',
