3, 37, 41);\\">Applying the Plans Theme</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: black;\\">PRINCE2® Processes and Themes (continued)</strong></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">&nbsp;</span></p><ul><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Applying the Risk Theme</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Applying the Change Theme</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Applying the Progress Theme</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Introduction to the PRINCE2® Practitioner exam format and</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">study materials</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: black;\\">PRINCE2® Risk Analysis and Planning Control</strong></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">&nbsp;</span></p><ul><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Identification of project risks and how to manage them</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">using the PRINCE2® approach</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Review of the PRINCE2® processes and themes</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Enhanced focus on risk management with new tools for handling uncertainty.</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Updated discussions on applying the seven principles in various contexts.</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Applying PRINCE2® to a case study</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Detailed discussion of the seven principles of PRINCE2® and</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">how to apply them in practice</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Technical workshops on project planning and control,</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">including work breakdown structure, product-based planning,</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">and project scheduling</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: black;\\">PRINCE2® Communication and Stakeholder management</strong></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">&nbsp;</span></p><ul><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">The importance of communication and stakeholder management</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">in PRINCE2®</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Review of PRINCE2® tailoring and how to apply the</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Updated techniques for effective communication in agile and hybrid environments.</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Tailoring guidance to adapt PRINCE2 to specific organizational needs.</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">methodology to different project environments</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Case studies and practical exercises to reinforce learning</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">and facilitate application of PRINCE2® methodology in</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">real-world scenarios.</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exam tips</span></li></ul>"]',
