                'description' => '<p>This program offers an in-depth understanding of the principles and applications of sustainability in an urban development context. The course is structured to progressively build your knowledge, starting from the basics of sustainability and urban development, then delving into its three main aspects: environmental, social, and economic. We will explore practical case studies, discuss emerging trends, and you will have the opportunity to apply your learning through interactive activities. By the end of this course, you will be equipped with the knowledge and skills to contribute effectively to sustainable urban development initiatives in your community or organization.</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
                'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Introduction to Sustainable Urban Development<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding the evolution of urban development and the necessity for sustainable practices.</li>\\n<li>Defining the principles of sustainability: environmental, social, and economic pillars.</li>\\n<li>Introduction to the concept of sustainable urban development and \\"Smart Cities\\".</li>\\n<li>Exploring global urban trends and identifying sustainable and unsustainable practices</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Environmental Sustainability in Urban Development<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Exploring the role and importance of green infrastructure in cities: green spaces, urban forestry, and natural water management systems.</li>\\n<li>Discussing the impact and significance of sustainable transport systems: public transport, cycling, and walking.</li>\\n<li>Investigating energy efficiency in urban environments: techniques for reducing energy consumption and strategies for implementing renewable energy sources.</li>\\n<li>Applying knowledge to design an environmentally friendly urban space.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Social Sustainability in Urban Development<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding the importance of inclusive urban planning for equitable access to services and opportunities.</li>\\n<li>Examining the impact of urban design on public health and safety.</li>\\n<li>Discussing the role of community engagement in urban development.</li>\\n<li>Creating an urban equity map to identify areas of social disparity in a chosen urban area.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Economic Sustainability in Urban Development<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Defining the balance between economic growth and sustainability: the potential of green jobs.</li>\\n<li>Delving into sustainable housing and real estate: affordable housing and sustainable construction practices.</li>\\n<li>Understanding the strategies for financing sustainable urban initiatives: public-private partnerships and other models.</li>\\n<li>Developing a sustainable business model for an urban initiative.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Technological Innovation and the Future of Sustainable Urban Development<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Examining the role of technology in sustainable urban development: digitalization, data analytics, and AI in urban planning.</li>\\n<li>Discussing the concept of Smart Cities: IoT, automation, and their impact on urban sustainability.</li>\\n<li>Understanding the opportunities and challenges of implementing new technologies in urban spaces: privacy issues, digital divide, and infrastructure demands.</li>\\n<li>Envisioning and designing a future city that leverages technology for sustainable urban development.</li>\\n</ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[621,765,833]',
                'category_id' => 16,
                'online' => 0,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:50:44',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:50:44',
            ),
            394 => 
            array (
                'id' => 1734,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Strategic Procurement Master',
                'description' => '<p>This course aims to provide a comprehensive understanding of strategic procurement, focusing on key elements such as supplier management, strategic sourcing, negotiation, and contract management. We will also discuss future trends, including digitalization and sustainable procurement. By the end of the course, you will be equipped with the knowledge and skills to develop and implement an effective strategic procurement plan in your organization.</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
                'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Understanding Strategic Procurement<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Introduction to Strategic Procurement: Definition, importance, and evolution.</li>\\n<li>The role of strategic procurement in an organization\'s success.</li>\\n<li>Alignment of procurement strategy with corporate strategy.</li>\\n<li>The strategic procurement process: From needs assessment to contract management.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Supplier Management and Relationship Building<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Identification and selection of suppliers: Criteria and strategies.</li>\\n<li>Building and managing supplier relationships: Communication, performance monitoring, and dispute resolution.</li>\\n<li>Supplier development and performance improvement.</li>\\n<li>Supplier risk management: Identification, assessment, and mitigation.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Strategic Sourcing and Category Management<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Introduction to strategic sourcing: Definition, process, and benefits.</li>\\n<li>Category management in procurement: Approach, benefits, and challenges.</li>\\n<li>Cross-functional teams in strategic sourcing and category management.</li>\\n<li>Role of market intelligence in strategic sourcing and category management.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Negotiation and Contract Management<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Negotiation strategies in procurement: Preparation, techniques, and closing.</li>\\n<li>Developing and managing contracts: Types of contracts, key components, and legal considerations.</li>\\n<li>Performance-based contracting: Objectives, implementation, and challenges.</li>\\n<li>Conflict resolution in contract management: Techniques and best practices.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Future Trends in Strategic Procurement<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Impact of digitalization on strategic procurement: Automation, AI, and blockchain.</li>\\n<li>Sustainable procurement: Strategies, benefits, and challenges.</li>\\n<li>Skills for the future: Essential competencies for strategic procurement professionals.</li>\\n<li>Developing a strategic procurement plan: Steps, considerations, and presentation.</li>\\n</ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 18,
                'online' => 1,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:50:44',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:50:44',
            ),
