                'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Introduction to Marketing Strategy and Planning</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li>Overview of Marketing Strategy and Planning: Definitions, differences, and connections.</li><li>Importance of marketing strategy and planning in business.</li><li>Understanding the Marketing Planning Process: From identifying market needs to evaluation and control.</li><li>Introduction to Marketing Strategy: From market segmentation to positioning.</li></ul>","<p><strong>Developing a Marketing Strategy</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li>Developing a marketing strategy: Aligning marketing with organizational objectives.</li><li>Customer Relationship Management: Understanding customer needs, building relationships, and managing customer feedback.</li><li>Market Forecasting: Identifying, assessing, and forecasting market trends.</li><li>Branding and positioning: Strategies for effective branding and positioning.</li></ul>","<p><strong>Enhancing Marketing Effectiveness with Technology</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li>Understanding and implementing digital marketing principles.</li><li>The role of technology in enhancing marketing effectiveness: Social media, SEO, and content marketing.</li><li>Customer engagement strategies: Creating engaging content and managing online communities.</li><li>Data-Driven Marketing: Utilising data analytics for informed decision-making.</li></ul>","<p><strong>Ethical and Customer-centric Marketing</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li>Understanding ethical marketing: Transparency, data privacy, and fair competition.</li><li>The role of marketing in sustainability: Sustainable marketing strategies.</li><li>Implementing ethical and customer-centric marketing practices: Challenges and solutions.</li><li>Regulatory compliance in marketing: Understanding relevant laws and regulations.</li></ul>","<p><strong>Future Trends in Marketing Strategy and Planning</strong></p><p><strong><span class=\\"ql-cursor\\">﻿</span></strong></p><ul><li>Impact of globalisation on marketing strategy and planning.</li><li>Exploring the potential of emerging technologies: AI, machine learning, and automation in marketing.</li><li>The future of marketing strategy and planning: Predictions and preparations.</li><li>Skills for the future: Essential skills for marketing professionals in the digital age.</li></ul>"]',
