                'id' => 1779,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Budgeting, Forecasting, Business Planning and Economic Modelling',
                'description' => '<p>This comprehensive program is designed to help participants understand the key aspects of budgeting, forecasting, business planning, and economic modelling, with a specific focus on strategic financial planning, operational efficiency, and sustainable practices. Through a blend of theory, practical examples, and future trends, we aim to equip you with the skills and knowledge required to excel in this field</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
                'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Introduction to Budgeting, Forecasting, Business Planning and Economic Modelling<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Overview of Budgeting, Forecasting, Business Planning and Economic Modelling: Definitions, differences, and interconnections.</li>\\n<li>Importance of financial planning in business.</li>\\n<li>Understanding the Financial Planning Cycle: From identifying needs to evaluation and review.</li>\\n<li>Introduction to Economic Modelling: From building models to interpreting results.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Strategic Financial Planning<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Developing a financial planning strategy: Aligning financial planning with organizational objectives.</li>\\n<li>Budgeting and Forecasting: Techniques, tools, and best practices.</li>\\n<li>Risk Management in Financial Planning: Identifying, assessing, and mitigating financial risks.</li>\\n<li>Developing a Business Plan: Elements, importance, and implementation.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Operational Efficiency in Financial Planning<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding and implementing principles of efficient financial planning.</li>\\n<li>The role of technology in enhancing operational efficiency: ERP systems, AI, and Machine Learning.</li>\\n<li>Capital Budgeting: Techniques for effective capital expenditure planning.</li>\\n<li>Performance Analysis: Ensuring the financial health of the business.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Ethical and Sustainable Financial Planning<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding ethical financial planning: Transparency, accountability, and fairness.</li>\\n<li>The role of financial planning in sustainability: Strategies for long-term financial health.</li>\\n<li>Implementing ethical and sustainable financial planning practices: Challenges and solutions.</li>\\n<li>Regulatory compliance in financial planning: Understanding relevant laws and regulations.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Future Trends in Budgeting, Forecasting, Business Planning and Economic Modelling<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Impact of globalization on financial planning.</li>\\n<li>Exploring the potential of emerging technologies: Blockchain, AI, and automation.</li>\\n<li>The future of financial planning: Predictions and preparations.</li>\\n<li>Skills for the future: Essential skills for financial planning professionals in the digital age.</li>\\n</ul>"]',
