                'id' => 1790,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Advanced Payroll Mastery: A Comprehensive Guide to Payroll Management',
                'description' => '<p>This in-depth program is designed to help participants master the complexities of payroll management, with a focus on compliance, efficiency, and employee satisfaction. Through a combination of theoretical concepts, practical examples, and industry insights, we aim to provide you with the expertise needed to excel in advanced payroll management.</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
                'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Introduction to Advanced Payroll Management<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Overview of Payroll Management: Core concepts, importance, and roles in business.</li>\\n<li>Payroll Components: Gross pay, deductions, net pay, benefits, and taxes.</li>\\n<li>Introduction to Payroll Compliance: Understanding regulatory requirements.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Ensuring Compliance and Reporting<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Deep Dive into Payroll Taxes: Withholding, reporting, and remittance.</li>\\n<li>Reporting Obligations: W-2, 1099, quarterly reports.</li>\\n<li>Keeping Records: How to document and retain payroll records effectively.</li>\\n<li>Handling Multi-state Payroll: Complying with different state laws and requirements.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Effective Payroll Processing Strategies<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Payroll Cycles &amp; Processing: Bi-weekly, monthly, and irregular payments.</li>\\n<li>Utilizing Technology: Payroll software, automation, and integration with HR systems.</li>\\n<li>Payroll Reconciliation and Error Rectification: Best practices.</li>\\n<li>Outsourcing Payroll: Pros, cons, and considerations.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Compensation and Employee Management<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Designing Compensation Packages: Balancing salaries, bonuses, and benefits.</li>\\n<li>Managing Employee Benefits: Health insurance, retirement plans, paid time off.</li>\\n<li>Employee Queries &amp; Grievances: Addressing and resolving payroll-related queries.</li>\\n<li>International Payroll: Managing payroll across borders.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>The Future of Payroll Management<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Technological Trends: Artificial Intelligence, cloud computing, and more.</li>\\n<li>Regulatory Changes: Staying ahead in a changing legal environment.</li>\\n<li>Payroll Fraud and Security: Protecting sensitive data.</li>\\n<li>Skill Development: Building skills for the future of payroll management.</li>\\n</ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 5,
                'online' => 0,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:51:20',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:51:20',
            ),
            450 => 
            array (
                'id' => 1791,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
            'name' => 'Certified Procurement Professional (Preparation Course)',
                'description' => '<p>This rigorous program is designed to provide participants with a holistic understanding of procurement management, focusing on strategic sourcing, contract negotiation, risk management, and ethical procurement practices. By blending theory, real-world examples, and best practices, we aim to empower you with the skills and knowledge necessary to become a Certified Procurement Professional.</p><p>This rigorous program is designed to provide participants with a holistic understanding of procurement management, focusing on strategic sourcing, contract negotiation, risk management, and ethical procurement practices. By blending theory, real-world examples, and best practices, we aim to empower you with the skills and knowledge necessary to become a Certified Procurement Professional.</p><p><br></p><p>This course is a preparation course, and designed to equip you with the necessary skills and knowledge to prepare for the certification, should you choose to pursue it in the future</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Introduction to Procurement Management</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li>Procurement in the Business Context: Definitions, objectives, and significance.</li><li>The Procurement Process: Overview of procurement cycle stages.</li><li>Procurement Planning: Identifying needs, market research, and budgeting.</li><li>Introduction to Certified Procurement Professional (CPP) certification.</li></ul>","<p><strong>Strategic Sourcing</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li>Developing a Sourcing Strategy: Aligning sourcing with organizational goals.</li><li>Supplier Selection: Criteria, evaluation techniques, and supplier performance.</li><li>Supplier Relationship Management: Building and maintaining productive relationships.</li><li>Global Sourcing: Challenges and opportunities in international procurement.</li></ul>","<p><strong>Contract Negotiation and Management</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li>Principles of Contract Negotiation: Preparing, conducting, and closing negotiations.</li><li>Contract Types and Terms: Understanding different contract structures.</li><li>Managing Contracts: Monitoring performance, payments, and changes.</li><li>Dispute Resolution: Techniques and best practices.</li></ul>","<p><strong>Risk Management and Compliance</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li>Risk Analysis in Procurement: Identifying, assessing, and mitigating risks.</li><li>Developing Contingency Plans: Ensuring business continuity.</li><li>Ethical Procurement: Fair practices, transparency, and anti-corruption.</li><li>Compliance: Adhering to procurement laws, regulations, and standards.</li></ul>","<p><strong>Preparing for the Certified Procurement Professional Exam</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li>Exam Overview: Format, content, and scoring.</li><li>Study Strategies: Techniques for effective preparation.</li><li>Practice Exam: Simulated exam session with feedback.</li><li>Career Prospects: Opportunities and pathways as a Certified Procurement Professional.</li></ul><p><br></p>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 12,
                'online' => 1,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:51:21',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:51:21',
            ),
