            'description' => '<p>This comprehensive program is designed to provide participants with an in-depth understanding of International Public Sector Accounting Standards (IPSAS), essential for transparency and accountability in public sector financial reporting. The course covers the fundamentals of IPSAS, practical application, and the latest developments. Through a combination of lectures, case studies, and hands-on exercises, participants will gain the skills necessary to implement and apply IPSAS effectively in their organizations.</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
                'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Introduction to IPSAS<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Overview of International Public Sector Accounting Standards.</li>\\n<li>The role of IPSAS in public sector financial reporting.</li>\\n<li>Key objectives and principles of IPSAS.</li>\\n<li>Introduction to cash-based and accrual-based accounting.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Understanding and Applying Accrual-based IPSAS<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Assets, liabilities, revenues, and expenses under accrual-based IPSAS.</li>\\n<li>Financial statement presentation and disclosure requirements.</li>\\n<li>Practical application: Preparing financial statements following accrual-based IPSAS.</li>\\n<li>Case studies on accrual-based IPSAS implementation.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Understanding and Applying Cash-based IPSAS<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Receipts and payments under cash-based IPSAS.</li>\\n<li>Financial reporting under the cash basis of accounting.</li>\\n<li>Transition from cash-based to accrual-based accounting.</li>\\n<li>Case studies on cash-based IPSAS implementation.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>IPSAS and Public Sector Accountability<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>The importance of transparency and accountability in public sector financial reporting.</li>\\n<li>The role of IPSAS in enhancing financial integrity and governance.</li>\\n<li>Addressing corruption and fraud through effective financial reporting.</li>\\n<li>IPSAS adoption and stakeholders&rsquo; expectations.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Implementation Challenges and Latest Developments<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Common challenges in transitioning to and implementing IPSAS.</li>\\n<li>Strategies for successful IPSAS implementation.</li>\\n<li>Staying updated with the latest developments in IPSAS.</li>\\n<li>Future trends and the evolving landscape of public sector accounting standards.</li>\\n</ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 34,
                'online' => 0,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:51:23',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:51:23',
            ),
            460 => 
            array (
                'id' => 1801,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Comprehensive Road Design and Engineering',
                'description' => '<p>This in-depth program is designed to provide participants with a robust understanding of the fundamentals, methodologies, and cutting-edge practices in road design and engineering. Through a blend of theory, real-world examples, case studies, and hands-on sessions, this course aims to equip engineers and related professionals with the skills and knowledge required to excel in road design and contribute to sustainable infrastructure development.</p>',
                'duration' => '10',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong>&nbsp;Introduction to Road Design and Engineering<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Overview of Road Design and Engineering</li>\\n<li>History and Evolution of Road Engineering</li>\\n<li>Types of Roads and Classification</li>\\n<li>Introduction to Road Geometrics</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Geometric Design of Roads<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Horizontal Alignments</li>\\n<li>Vertical Alignments</li>\\n<li>Cross-sectional Elements</li>\\n<li>Sight Distances and Safety Considerations</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Road Construction Materials<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Subgrade and Embankment Materials</li>\\n<li>Pavement Materials: Bituminous, Concrete, etc.</li>\\n<li>Material Testing and Quality Control</li>\\n<li>Sustainable and Recycled Materials for Roads</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Pavement Design<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Pavement Types and Structures</li>\\n<li>Traffic Loading and Volume Considerations</li>\\n<li>Design of Flexible and Rigid Pavements</li>\\n<li>Pavement Thickness Design</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Drainage Design for Roads<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Importance of Drainage in Road Design</li>\\n<li>Surface and Subsurface Drainage Systems</li>\\n<li>Design of Culverts and Drainage Channels</li>\\n<li>Erosion Control and Stormwater Management</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Road Safety and Traffic Engineering<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Traffic Flow and Capacity</li>\\n<li>Road Signs and Markings</li>\\n<li>Intersection Design</li>\\n<li>Road Safety Audits</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Sustainable Practices in Road Design<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Environmental Considerations in Road Design</li>\\n<li>Green Roads and Sustainable Materials</li>\\n<li>Noise and Air Quality Management</li>\\n<li>Climate Change Resilience in Road Design</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Road Design Software and Technology<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Introduction to Road Design Software (AutoCAD Civil 3D, MXROAD, etc.)</li>\\n<li>3D Modeling and BIM in Road Design</li>\\n<li>Use of GIS in Road Planning</li>\\n<li>Hands-on Practice Sessions</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Legal, Regulatory, and Contractual Aspects<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Standards and Specifications (AASHTO, IRC, etc.)</li>\\n<li>Legal and Regulatory Aspects of Road Construction</li>\\n<li>Tendering and Contracts in Road Projects</li>\\n<li>Ethics in Engineering and Anti-Corruption Practices</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Road Maintenance, Rehabilitation, and Course Conclusion<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Road Performance Evaluation</li>\\n<li>Road Maintenance Strategies and Techniques</li>\\n<li>Road Rehabilitation and Reconstruction</li>\\n</ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 16,
                'online' => 1,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:51:24',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:51:24',
            ),
