                'id' => 1839,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'APMG Project Planning and Control',
                'description' => '<p>This comprehensive course focuses on practical methods for successful project planning and control, teaching attendees how to manage projects effectively and deliver on time and within budget.</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
                'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Introduction to Project Planning and Control<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding the importance of project planning and control.</li>\\n<li>Overview of the project life cycle and key stages.</li>\\n<li>Key roles and responsibilities in project planning and control.</li>\\n<li>Discussion: Challenges in project planning and control.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Developing Effective Project Plans<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Steps in developing a project plan.</li>\\n<li>Tools and techniques for effective project scheduling.</li>\\n<li>Case Study: Analysis of a successful project plan.</li>\\n<li>Workshop: Developing a project plan.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Monitoring and Controlling Projects<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Techniques for monitoring project progress.</li>\\n<li>Understanding project control cycles.</li>\\n<li>The role of performance metrics in project control.</li>\\n<li>Workshop: Implementing project control techniques.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Resolving Project Issues and Risk Management<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Strategies for issue resolution in project management.</li>\\n<li>Principles of risk management in projects.</li>\\n<li>Identifying and mitigating project risks.</li>\\n<li>Effective issue and risk management in projects.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>The Future of Project Planning and Control<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Emerging trends in project planning and control.</li>\\n<li>The role of technology in project management.</li>\\n<li>Preparing for the future: Key skills for project leaders.</li>\\n<li>Discussion: The future of project management.</li>\\n</ul>"]',
