                'id' => 1847,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Navigating Joint Ventures and Collaborations in the Oil and Gas Industry',
                'description' => '<p>This comprehensive programme provides a detailed exploration of joint ventures and collaborative agreements in the oil and gas industry. It is designed to equip attendees with essential knowledge and skills needed to effectively negotiate, manage, and succeed in such partnerships.</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
                'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Understanding Joint Ventures and Collaborations<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Overview of joint ventures and collaborations in the oil and gas industry.</li>\\n<li>Key benefits, challenges, and considerations in forming these partnerships.</li>\\n<li>Understanding the roles and responsibilities of each party.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Formation and Structuring of Agreements<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Essential elements and clauses in joint venture and collaboration agreements.</li>\\n<li>Structuring partnerships for optimal benefits and risk mitigation.</li>\\n<li>Case study: Successful joint ventures in the oil and gas industry.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Negotiation and Management of Agreements<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Essential negotiation skills for joint venture and collaboration agreements.</li>\\n<li>Techniques for managing and maintaining effective partnerships.</li>\\n<li>Dealing with disputes and challenges in partnerships.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Legal and Regulatory Considerations<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding legal and regulatory considerations in joint ventures and collaborations.</li>\\n<li>Compliance with local and international oil and gas regulations.</li>\\n<li>Addressing legal disputes in joint ventures.</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","<p><strong>Operational Challenges and Success Factors<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Operational considerations in joint venture and collaboration agreements.</li>\\n<li>Strategies for successful operation and management of partnerships.</li>\\n<li>Preparing for future trends and challenges in oil and gas partnerships.</li>\\n</ul>"]',
