                'id' => 1849,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Embracing Fintech Innovation: A Corporate Governance Perspective',
                'description' => '<p>This comprehensive, 2-day program is designed to equip Board members with a deep understanding of corporate governance in the rapidly evolving Fintech industry. Attendees will gain insights into emerging technologies, financial products, and risk management strategies pertinent to the Fintech industry.</p>',
                'duration' => '2',
                'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Corporate Governance and the Rise of Fintech<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Role and importance of corporate governance in the Fintech industry.</li>\\n<li>Understanding new and emerging technologies in the Fintech landscape.</li>\\n<li>Implications of these technologies on corporate governance.</li>\\n<li>Discussion on the governance strategy for integrating Fintech innovations.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Latest Developments and Risk Management in Fintech<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>In-depth look into the latest developments in Fintech products and services.</li>\\n<li>Understanding and navigating risk in the Fintech landscape.</li>\\n<li>Practical strategies for effective risk management in the Fintech industry.</li>\\n<li>Scenario-based learning: Application of Fintech risk management principles.</li>\\n</ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
