            10 => 
            array (
                'id' => 1853,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'System Security and Fraud Prevention in ERP Environment',
                'description' => '<p>Organizations heavily rely on ERP systems to optimize their operations, manage resources, and facilitate effective decision-making. These systems consolidate various administrative functions within a single application, spanning from Human Resources to Supply Chain Management. However, alongside their advantages, ERP systems also introduce distinct challenges tied to security vulnerabilities and the potential for fraudulent activities.</p>
<p>As technology continually reshapes business processes, LPC Training offers top-tier Safety and Security Training to bolster robust system security and fraud prevention practices.</p>
<p>This training has been meticulously designed to furnish you with the essential knowledge, tools, and strategies required for safeguarding your organization\'s ERP environment. It encompasses a comprehensive approach to unravel the intricacies of upholding a secure ERP environment while remaining watchful against potential fraudulent activities that could undermine the integrity and operational effectiveness of these systems.</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p><strong>Introduction to ERP (Enterprise Resource Planning) Security Fundamentals<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>What is ERP Security?</li>\\n<li>ERP security in a cybercrime world</li>\\n<li>Understanding the importance of system security in ERP environments.</li>\\n<li>security challenges and vulnerabilities in ERP systems</li>\\n<li>Common Vulnerabilities of ERP Systems<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>Elements of ERP security<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Infrastructure security</li>\\n<li>Network security</li>\\n<li>Operating system security</li>\\n<li>Database security</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","<h1><span style=\\"font-size: 12pt;\\">Access Control and Secure User Authentication Methods<br /></span></h1>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Methods and techniques for securing user access.</li>\\n<li>Strong password policies and multi-factor authentication username and password/two-factor authentication/biometrics</li>\\n<li>Health and safety training and supervision</li>\\n<li>Consulting with employees</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","<h1><span style=\\"font-size: 12pt;\\">Mitigate ERP risks in a remote work environment.</span></h1>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Risk assessment - Identify ERP risks</li>\\n<li>Implement ERP controls</li>\\n<li>Review ERP performance</li>\\n<li>Update ERP system</li>\\n<li>Communicate your ERP security strategy<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>Fraud Prevention in ERP Environment<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Types of fraud occur within ERP environments.</li>\\n<li>Fraud Risks in ERP Systems</li>\\n<li>Internal and external fraud on business operations</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Data Analytics and strategies to prevent fraud<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Data analytics and its role in fraud prevention, by identifying patterns and anomalies indicating potential fraud</li>\\n<li>Fraud detection tools and techniques in ERP systems.</li>\\n<li>Gathering evidence, interviewing techniques, and maintaining chain of custody.<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>Solutions for detecting and preventing fraud<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Phishing attack protection</li>\\n<li>Ransomware protection</li>\\n<li>Cyberthreat hunting</li>\\n<li>Insider threat security</li>\\n<li>Threat intelligence</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Ethics, Reporting, and Investigation<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Ethical considerations in fraud prevention and detection.</li>\\n<li>Reporting incidents to relevant stakeholders and law enforcement.</li>\\n<li>Reviewing real-world case studies of fraud incidents within ERP environments.</li>\\n<li>Analyzing how effective investigation techniques were applied to uncover fraud.</li>\\n</ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 15,
                'online' => 1,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:51:53',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:51:53',
            ),
