ques, and maintaining chain of custody.<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>Solutions for detecting and preventing fraud<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Phishing attack protection</li>\\n<li>Ransomware protection</li>\\n<li>Cyberthreat hunting</li>\\n<li>Insider threat security</li>\\n<li>Threat intelligence</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Ethics, Reporting, and Investigation<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Ethical considerations in fraud prevention and detection.</li>\\n<li>Reporting incidents to relevant stakeholders and law enforcement.</li>\\n<li>Reviewing real-world case studies of fraud incidents within ERP environments.</li>\\n<li>Analyzing how effective investigation techniques were applied to uncover fraud.</li>\\n</ul>"]',
