                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Chat GPT and other Generative AI applications for Business',
                'description' => '<p><span lang="EN-GB">Generative AI, Process Automation, and Emerging Technologies: Business Administration, Procurement, Contract and HR Management, Investment Decisions" is a meticulously designed 5-day training program tailored to meet the needs of today\'s dynamic business environment.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">In an era where technology is reshaping how organizations operate, this training offers a deep dive into the transformative power of Generative AI, process automation, and emerging technologies. This course bridges the gap between technological innovation and practical application, focusing on core areas such as business administration, procurement, contract management, HR management, and investment decisions</span></p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\"><strong>Introduction to Generative AI and its Business Relevance<br /><br /></strong></span></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Generative AI in the Business Context</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Understanding Generative AI and its Components</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Real-World Applications across Different Sectors</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Chat GPT and its competitors</span></li>\\n</ul>","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\"><strong>Hands-on with Chat GPT and Similar Tools (1.5 hrs)<br /><br /></strong></span></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Prompts and scripts to leverage the power of Generative AI</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Demonstrations and Interactive Sessions</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Creating Basic AI Models for Business Needs</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Legal and Ethical Considerations </span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Responsibilities and Regulations in AI</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">GDPR and Data Privacy</span></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\"><strong>Leveraging AI in Human Resources and Administration<br /><br /></strong></span></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">AI in Human Resources Management</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Recruitment Automation</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Employee Engagement</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Training &amp; Development</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">AI in Administration and Contract Management</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Document Automation</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Contract Analysis</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Administrative Efficiency</span></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\"><strong>Financial Management, Investment, and CSR<br /><br /></strong></span></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">AI in Finance and Accounting</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Fraud Detection</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Predictive Analysis</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Automation in Reporting</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">AI in Investment and Development Banking</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Algorithmic Trading</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Risk Management</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Sustainable Investment Strategies</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">AI in Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR)</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Social Impact Analysis</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Stakeholder Engagement</span></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\"><strong>Process Automation Across Sectors<br /><br /></strong></span></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Introduction to Process Automation</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Understanding Automation Tools</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Automation in Different Business Functions</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Building Automation Workflows</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Exploring Emerging AI Technologies</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">AI at the Edge</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Quantum Computing</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Blockchain and AI</span></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"]',
