                'duration' => '3',
                'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Introduction to Community Policing and The Lagos State Neighbourhood Watch<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding the concept of community policing</li>\\n<li>Historical development and evolution</li>\\n<li>The role of government and organizations in community safety</li>\\n<li>Origin and establishment</li>\\n<li>Legal framework and responsibilities</li>\\n<li>Key milestones in its development</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p><strong>Community Engagement and Partnerships<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Building trust within the community</li>\\n<li>Collaborating with local organizations and residents</li>\\n<li>Effective communication and conflict resolution</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p><strong>Crime Prevention at the Grassroots Level</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Identifying local crime trends</li>\\n<li>Implementing crime prevention strategies</li>\\n<li>Mobilizing community resources for safety</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Training and Development<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>The importance of well-trained personnel</li>\\n<li>Local and international training programs</li>\\n<li>Defensive tactics and equipment<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>Infrastructure and Technology<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Infrastructure improvements for neighborhood safety</li>\\n<li>The role of technology in enhancing security</li>\\n<li>Patrolling and surveillance techniques<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>Legal and Ethical Considerations<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding legal frameworks and regulations</li>\\n<li>Ethical challenges in community policing</li>\\n<li>Accountability and transparency</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","<p><strong>The Role of Leadership in Lagos State Neighbourhood Safety Agency<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->Leadership in community policing</li>\\n<li>Motivating and managing personnel</li>\\n<li>Empowering community leaders</li>\\n<li>Evolution into a full-fledged agency</li>\\n<li>Collaborating with federal police and other security outfits</li>\\n<li>Achievements and challenges<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>Future Directions and Community Participation<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Vision for the future of community policing in Lagos State</li>\\n<li>Encouraging active community participation</li>\\n<li>Graduation and certificates</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 15,
