<p>Through a dynamic combination of lectures, interactive workshops, case studies, and group discussions, participants will gain the skills necessary to address contemporary transportation challenges. From sustainable urban mobility planning to the integration of emerging technologies, this course will empower professionals, researchers, and students to navigate the complex landscape of transportation demand management and analysis, ultimately contributing to more efficient, environmentally friendly, and accessible transportation systems. Join us to explore the future of transportation and make a lasting impact on the way we move.</p>',
