<p>Join us on this educational journey as we delve into the fascinating world of forensic auditing and investigations. Your success is our priority, and we\'re here to support your professional growth every step of the way.</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
                'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Introduction to Fraud and Forensic Auditing<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Welcome and Course Overview</li>\\n<li>Understanding Fraud: Types and Characteristics</li>\\n<li>The Impact of Fraud on Organizations</li>\\n<li>Role of Internal Auditor in Fraud Detection</li>\\n<li>Introduction to Forensic Auditing</li>\\n<li>Case Studies and Real-World Examples</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","<p><strong>Forensic and Investigative Agile Auditing</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Agile Auditing Principles and Practices</li>\\n<li>Adapting Agile Techniques to Forensic Investigations</li>\\n<li>Agile Tools for Forensic Auditors</li>\\n<li>Hands-On Workshop: Agile Auditing in Practice</li>\\n<li>Case Studies on Agile Forensic Investigations</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","<p><strong>Fraud Detection and Digital Forensics<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Identifying Key Fraud Indicators and Red Flags</li>\\n<li>Behavioral Red Flags in Fraud Cases</li>\\n<li>Using Data Analytics for Fraud Detection</li>\\n<li>Digital Forensics Essentials</li>\\n<li>Importance of Data Analysis in Fraud Detection</li>\\n<li>Practical Data Analysis Techniques</li>\\n<li>Guest Speaker: Digital Forensics Expert</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Fraud Control and Methodology<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Lessons from Audit for Fraud Control</li>\\n<li>Creating a Fraud Control Framework</li>\\n<li>Fraud Risk Assessment</li>\\n<li>Forensic Methodology and Investigation Tools</li>\\n<li>Hands-On Exercise: Building a Fraud Investigation Plan</li>\\n<li>Ethical Considerations in Forensic Auditing</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Investigating and Legal Aspects<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Responding When Fraud is Suspected</li>\\n<li>Interview Techniques for Successful Investigations</li>\\n<li>Gathering and Preserving Evidence</li>\\n<li>Legal Aspects of Using Forensic Data in Investigations</li>\\n<li>Case Studies on Successful Investigations</li>\\n<li>Course Recap, Certification Ceremony, and Closing Remarks</li>\\n</ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
