<p>By the end of this program, you\'ll be proficient in testing a variety of protection relays and equipped to navigate OMICRON\'s support ecosystem. Whether you\'re an experienced engineer or a newcomer to protection testing, this course will elevate your expertise and contribute to the reliability and safety of power systems. Join us on this educational journey to become a proficient power system protection tester.</p>',
