            54 => 
            array (
                'id' => 1897,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Government Oversight and Empowerment of NGOs: Managing, Sustaining, and Fostering Social Entrepreneurship',
            'description' => '<p>In an ever-evolving world, the role of non-profit organizations (NGOs) in addressing societal challenges has become increasingly vital. As guardians of social welfare, it is essential for governments to not only regulate but also empower these NGOs effectively. At LPC we Welcome you to our comprehensive 5-day course, "Government Oversight and Empowerment of NGOs: Managing, Sustaining, and Fostering Social Entrepreneurship."<br /><br /></p>
<p>This transformative course is designed to provide government officials, policymakers, and NGO supervisors with the knowledge and tools necessary to navigate the intricate landscape of NGO supervision. Over these five days, LPC will delve into the intricacies of managing NGOs, exploring governance structures, financial management, and project oversight. We\'ll also delve into the exciting realm of social entrepreneurship within NGOs, equipping you with strategies to promote innovation and sustainability.<br /><br /></p>
<p>Through interactive sessions, case studies, and expert insights, you will gain a holistic understanding of the non-profit sector\'s dynamics and learn to harness its potential for societal betterment. Join us on this educational journey as we empower you to facilitate positive change through effective NGO oversight and support.</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
                'days_content' => '["<p><span style=\\"font-size: 14pt;\\"><strong>Introduction to NGOs and Their Role</strong></span><br /><br /></p>\\n<p><strong>Understanding the Non-Profit Sector<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>What are NGOs, their mission, and importance</li>\\n<li>The role of government in regulating and supervising NGOs<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>Legal Framework and Regulations<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Laws and regulations governing NGOs</li>\\n<li>Registration and compliance requirements</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","<p><span style=\\"font-size: 14pt;\\"><strong>Managing NGO Operations</strong></span></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Governance Structures<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>NGO board, committees, and leadership</li>\\n<li>Board responsibilities and best practices<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>Financial Management<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Budgeting and financial planning</li>\\n<li>Fundraising and resource mobilization<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>Project Management<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Project planning, implementation, and monitoring</li>\\n<li>Impact assessment and reporting</li>\\n</ul>","<p><span style=\\"font-size: 14pt;\\"><strong>Effective Oversight and Supervision<br /><br /></strong></span></p>\\n<p><strong>Government\'s Role in Oversight<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>The role of government agencies in supervising NGOs</li>\\n<li>Compliance checks and audits<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>Monitoring and Evaluation<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Developing monitoring and evaluation frameworks</li>\\n<li>Tools and techniques for assessing NGO performance</li>\\n</ul>","<p><span style=\\"font-size: 14pt;\\"><strong>Promoting Social Entrepreneurship in NGOs</strong></span><br /><br /></p>\\n<p><strong>Introduction to Social Entrepreneurship</strong><br /><br /></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>What is social entrepreneurship?</li>\\n<li>Examples of successful social enterprises<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>Integrating Social Entrepreneurship in NGOs<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Strategies for NGOs to engage in social entrepreneurship</li>\\n<li>Balancing social and financial goals<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>Case Studies and Best Practices<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Examining case studies of NGOs involved in social entrepreneurship</li>\\n<li>Learning from successful models</li>\\n</ul>","<p><span style=\\"font-size: 14pt;\\"><strong>Building Collaborations and Sustainability</strong></span></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p><strong>Collaboration with Government<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Building partnerships between government and NGOs</li>\\n<li>Leveraging government resources for NGO initiatives<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>Sustainability Strategies<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Diversifying funding sources</li>\\n<li>Developing long-term sustainability plans<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>Course Conclusion and Certification<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Recap of key learnings and takeaways</li>\\n<li>Certification ceremony</li>\\n</ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 41,
                'online' => 1,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:52:05',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:52:05',
