            56 => 
            array (
                'id' => 1899,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'VMware vSAN Masterclass: Installation, Configuration, and Management',
                'description' => '<p>In today\'s rapidly evolving IT landscape, VMware vSAN stands as a pivotal technology, transforming how we manage and optimize storage resources in virtualized environments. This comprehensive 5-day program is your key to mastering the intricacies of VMware vSAN, providing you with the essential knowledge and practical skills needed to excel in deploying, configuring, and managing vSAN.<br /><br /></p>
<p>Over the course of this program, you will embark on a journey that begins with an in-depth exploration of vSAN\'s architecture, components, and advantages. You will then move on to planning and deploying vSAN clusters, crafting storage policies, ensuring data resilience, and delving into advanced features. By the end, you\'ll be well-versed in monitoring and troubleshooting vSAN clusters.<br /><br /></p>
<p>Whether you\'re a seasoned IT professional or new to virtualization, this course will empower you to harness the full potential of VMware vSAN, enhancing your organization\'s efficiency and data storage capabilities. Join us for a transformative learning experience that will advance your career and impact your organization\'s data management positively.</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
                'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Introduction to vSAN and Planning<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Introduction to vSAN and its architecture.</li>\\n<li>vSAN software components, advantages, and use cases.</li>\\n<li>Requirements and planning considerations for vSAN clusters.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Deploying vSAN<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Ensuring hardware compatibility and compatibility validation.</li>\\n<li>Host hardware settings for optimal performance.</li>\\n<li>Deploying and configuring vSAN clusters.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>vSAN Storage Policies and Resilience<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding vSAN object structure.</li>\\n<li>Creating, applying, and modifying storage policies.</li>\\n<li>Configuring resilience and data availability features.</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","<p><strong>Storage Efficiency, Security, and Advanced Features<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Discussing deduplication, compression, and erasure coding.</li>\\n<li>Configuring security and encryption options.</li>\\n<li>Exploring advanced features like HCI Mesh and File Services.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Cluster Maintenance, Monitoring, and Troubleshooting<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Managing cluster maintenance, stretched clusters, and two-node clusters.</li>\\n<li>Monitoring vSAN health and performance.</li>\\n<li>Troubleshooting common configuration and operational issues.</li>\\n</ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 50,
                'online' => 1,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:52:06',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:52:06',
            ),
