                'name' => 'Leading Digital Transformation and Innovation',
                'description' => '<p>This 5-day course provides a comprehensive guide for leaders and executives who are spearheading digital transformation and innovation within their organizations. It covers key strategic aspects, management techniques, and emerging technologies to successfully navigate and lead in the digital landscape.</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
                'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Introduction to Digital Transformation and Innovation<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Defining Digital Transformation and Why It Matters</li>\\n<li>Elements and Drivers of Digital Transformation</li>\\n<li>Introduction to Business Innovation</li>\\n<li>Building a Case for Digital Transformation</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Strategy Development for Digital Transformation<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Identifying Opportunities and Threats in Digital Space</li>\\n<li>Strategic Planning and Roadmapping</li>\\n<li>Aligning Digital Transformation with Corporate Strategy</li>\\n<li>Setting KPIs for Measuring Success</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Technologies Driving Transformation<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Cloud Computing and Its Role in Transformation</li>\\n<li>AI and Machine Learning for Business Innovation</li>\\n<li>IoT and Smart Technologies</li>\\n<li>Cybersecurity in a Digital World</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Leadership and Culture in Digital Transformation<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Leading Change and Overcoming Resistance</li>\\n<li>Fostering a Culture of Innovation and Inclusivity</li>\\n<li>Skills and Competencies for Digital Leadership</li>\\n<li>Talent Management and Retention Strategies</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Risk Management and Future Trends<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Assessing and Managing Risks in Digital Projects</li>\\n<li>Legal and Regulatory Considerations</li>\\n<li>Emerging Trends and Technologies in Digital Transformation</li>\\n<li>Preparing for the Future: Sustaining Momentum</li>\\n</ul>"]',
