            60 => 
            array (
                'id' => 1903,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Mastering Project Excellence',
                'description' => '<p>Greetings and a warm welcome to the "Mastering Project Excellence" course, a transformative 5-day learning journey meticulously crafted by LPC. Throughout this immersive experience, we\'ll dive deep into the dynamic realm of project management, empowering you with the skills needed for successful project leadership.<br /><br /></p>
<p>Our journey begins with a focus on the essentials during the "Fundamentals of Project Management" sessions. We\'ll explore key concepts, project life cycles, and effective planning methodologies. As we progress, day two will unravel the intricacies of "Project Risk Management," guiding you through risk identification, assessment, and mitigation.<br /><br /></p>
<p>Moving forward to day three, we\'ll delve into the financial aspects with "Project Cost Accounting &amp; Finance." Here, you\'ll gain insights into cost estimation, budgeting, and financial control. Day four places emphasis on "Managing Project Teams," covering team dynamics, communication strategies, and conflict resolution techniques.<br /><br /></p>
<p>Our final day, dedicated to "Project Administration," will encompass project execution, monitoring, closure, and lessons learned. Expect interactive sessions, real-world case studies, and practical exercises throughout, ensuring a comprehensive understanding of project management. Join us in this immersive learning experience, tailored by LPC, as we elevate your project management prowess together</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Fundamentals of Project Management<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Introduction to Project Management</li>\\n<li>Definition and importance of project management</li>\\n<li>Key project management terms and concepts</li>\\n<li>Project life cycle and phases</li>\\n<li>Project Initiation and Planning</li>\\n<li>Project initiation process</li>\\n<li>Project planning techniques</li>\\n<li>Work Breakdown Structure (WBS)</li>\\n<li>Project scheduling and Gantt charts</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Project Risk Management<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding Project Risks</li>\\n<li>Definition and types of project risks</li>\\n<li>Risk identification techniques</li>\\n<li>Risk assessment and prioritization</li>\\n<li>Risk register development</li>\\n<li>Risk Response Planning</li>\\n<li>Strategies for risk mitigation, acceptance, avoidance, and transfer</li>\\n<li>Creating a risk response plan</li>\\n<li>Monitoring and controlling project risks</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","<p><strong>Project Cost Accounting &amp; Finance<br /></strong>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Project Cost Estimation</li>\\n<li>Types of project costs</li>\\n<li>Estimating techniques (analogous, parametric, three-point)</li>\\n<li>Cost estimation tools and software</li>\\n<li>Budgeting and Cost Control</li>\\n<li>Creating a project budget</li>\\n<li>Earned Value Management (EVM)</li>\\n<li>Cost control techniques</li>\\n<li>Variance analysis</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Managing Project Teams: Improving Individual and Team Performance</strong><br /><br /></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding team roles and responsibilities</li>\\n<li>Building and leading effective project teams</li>\\n<li>Motivation and team engagement strategies</li>\\n<li>Communication and Conflict Resolution</li>\\n<li>Effective communication in project management</li>\\n<li>Conflict resolution strategies</li>\\n<li>Team collaboration tools</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Project Administration</strong><br /><br /></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Project Execution and Monitoring</li>\\n<li>Executing project plans</li>\\n<li>Monitoring project progress</li>\\n<li>Change management and control</li>\\n<li>Project Closure and Lessons Learned</li>\\n<li>Closing project activities</li>\\n<li>Conducting project post-mortem</li>\\n<li>Documenting and applying lessons learned</li>\\n<li>Course recap and final Q&amp;A</li>\\n</ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 44,
                'online' => 1,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:52:07',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:52:07',
            ),
