ith modules in areas such as digital economics, health analytics, big data, AI, and machine learning, you will learn to impact global health challenges through the use of data and analytics. Core modules include:<br /><br /></span></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul type=\\"disc\\">\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Design Thinking:  Solving Complex Problems Through a Disruptive Mindset .</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Contemporary Topics in Health Economics.</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Digital Economics.</span></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","<ul type=\\"disc\\">\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Evidence for Policy and Social Impact </span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Introduction to Health Analytics </span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-GB\\">Population Health Analytics </span></li>\\n</ul>"]',
