            87 => 
            array (
                'id' => 1930,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Mastering Quality Management: ISO 9001:2015 Comprehensive Training',
            'description' => '<p>Having an internationally recognized Quality Management System (QMS) allows you to enhance organizational performance and increase customer satisfaction.&nbsp;&nbsp;ISO 9001:2015 would help your organisation deliver and drive continual improvement in your services.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>This course is an introduction for individuals with little or no previous knowledge of ISO 9001 or a Quality Management System (QMS). Essentials of ISO 9001:2015 provides a general understanding of the necessary concepts of the ISO 9000 series of standards and the impact of the requirements on the day-to-day operations of organizations in any industry.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>The course explains the clauses of ISO 9001:2015, providing a foundation for understanding quality management principles. It would help you identify the structure and requirements of an effective QMS. You will gain the required skills to conduct a baseline review of your organization&rsquo;s current position and implement the key principles of ISO 9001:2015.</p>',
                'duration' => '10',
