<p>Over the span of five days, you will explore key areas such as corporate law, intellectual property, family law, criminal law, and international law, among others. The course combines theoretical learning with practical case studies, providing a comprehensive view of each legal field. You will gain insights into the latest legal trends, challenges, and opportunities, equipping you with the knowledge and skills to excel in your chosen area of legal expertise or to make informed decisions in legal matters.</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Overview of Legal Specializations<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<p><strong>Introduction to Various Fields of Law :</strong><br /><br /></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Corporate and Business Law Essentials</li>\\n<li>Intellectual Property Law and Its Impact</li>\\n<li>Understanding Family Law and Domestic Relations</li>\\n<li>Overview of Criminal Law and Justice System</li>\\n<li>Interactive Session: Choosing a Legal Specialization</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Corporate and Commercial Law<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<p><strong>Legal Aspects of Business Operations:</strong><br /><br /></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Contracts, Agreements, and Negotiations</li>\\n<li>Mergers, Acquisitions, and Corporate Restructuring</li>\\n<li>Compliance and Regulatory Issues</li>\\n<li>Case Studies: Corporate Legal Challenges</li>\\n<li>Workshop: Drafting a Business Contract</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Intellectual Property and Technology Law<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<p><strong>Fundamentals of Intellectual Property Rights:</strong><br /><br /></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Patent, Trademark, and Copyright Law</li>\\n<li>Legal Issues in Technology and Innovation</li>\\n<li>Digital Rights and Cyber Law</li>\\n<li>Role-Playing Exercise: IP Dispute Resolution</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Family Law and Criminal Law<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<p><strong>Key Concepts in Family Law: Marriage, Divorce, Custody:</strong><br /><br /></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Domestic Violence and Child Protection Laws</li>\\n<li>Basics of Criminal Law and Procedure</li>\\n<li>White-Collar Crimes and Corporate Fraud</li>\\n<li>Mock Trial: Criminal Case Simulation</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>International Law and Contemporary Issues</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p><strong>Principles of International Law and Human Rights:</strong><br /><br /></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Cross-Border Legal Issues and Dispute Resolution</li>\\n<li>Environmental Law and Sustainable Development</li>\\n<li>Emerging Legal Trends (AI, Blockchain)</li>\\n<li>Group Discussion: Legal Ethics and Professionalism</li>\\n<li>Course Conclusion and Certificate Distribution</li>\\n</ul>"]',
