                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Cloud Computing Training',
                'description' => '<p>Welcome to the "Cloud Computing" course, presented by LPC, where we delve into the dynamic world of cloud-based services. This course is designed for those eager to understand, set up, and maintain cutting-edge cloud computing environments. As businesses increasingly rely on cloud technology for efficiency, scalability, and cost savings, the demand for skilled cloud computing professionals is soaring. Over the course of five engaging days, you will learn the fundamentals of cloud computing, including various service models, deployment strategies, and best practices in cloud security and management.</p>
