            106 => 
            array (
                'id' => 1949,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Fleet Management Training',
                'description' => '<p>Embark on a comprehensive journey through the world of "Fleet Management" with LPC\'s specialized course. This program is meticulously designed for individuals who aspire to master the art of managing vehicle fleets, coordinating logistics, and overseeing drivers. In today\'s fast-paced business environment, effective fleet management is crucial for optimizing operational efficiency, reducing costs, and ensuring safety and compliance.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>With LPC and over five days, you will explore the various aspects of fleet management, including vehicle acquisition, maintenance strategies, driver management, and the use of technology in optimizing fleet operations. The course blends theoretical knowledge with practical applications, providing insights into the latest trends and best practices in the industry. Whether you are a professional in logistics, a fleet manager, or someone looking to enter this field, this course will equip you with the skills and knowledge to excel in managing a fleet of vehicles efficiently and effectively.</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Introduction to Fleet Management<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Overview of Fleet Management: Scope and Importance</li>\\n<li>Key Components of Fleet Management</li>\\n<li>Vehicle Acquisition and Financing Options</li>\\n<li>Fleet Policy Development and Implementation</li>\\n<li>Role of Technology in Modern Fleet Management</li>\\n<li>Case Studies: Effective Fleet Management Practices</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Driver Management and Safety<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Recruitment, Training, and Management of Drivers</li>\\n<li>Implementing Safety Programs and Compliance</li>\\n<li>Monitoring Driver Behavior and Performance</li>\\n<li>Accident Management and Reporting Procedures</li>\\n<li>Health and Wellness Programs for Drivers</li>\\n<li>Workshop: Developing a Driver Management Plan</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Maintenance and Operation of Fleet<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Preventive Maintenance Strategies</li>\\n<li>Managing Vehicle Repairs and Downtime</li>\\n<li>Fuel Management and Efficiency Techniques</li>\\n<li>Route Planning and Optimization</li>\\n<li>Utilizing Fleet Management Software</li>\\n<li>Hands-On Session: Fleet Maintenance Planning</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Cost Management and Optimization<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Cost Analysis and Budgeting for Fleet Operations</li>\\n<li>Reducing Operational Expenses</li>\\n<li>Lifecycle Cost Analysis of Fleet Vehicles</li>\\n<li>Implementing Green Fleet Practices</li>\\n<li>Fleet Replacement and Disposal Strategies</li>\\n<li>Group Activity: Fleet Cost Optimization Project</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Advanced Fleet Management Topics and Trends<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Emerging Trends in Fleet Management (Electric Vehicles, Autonomous Driving)</li>\\n<li>Data Analytics and Reporting in Fleet Operations</li>\\n<li>Legal and Regulatory Updates in Fleet Management</li>\\n<li>Strategic Planning and Future Outlook</li>\\n<li>Leveraging Partnerships and Outsourcing Options</li>\\n<li>Final Presentations and Course Wrap-Up</li>\\n</ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 12,
                'online' => 1,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:52:30',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:52:30',
            ),
