            120 => 
            array (
                'id' => 1963,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Onboarding and Induction Training',
                'description' => '<p>Embark on a transformative journey with LPC\'s "Onboarding and Induction" course, meticulously designed for human resource professionals, managers, and team leaders who aim to create impactful onboarding experiences for new hires. In the contemporary workplace, a strategic onboarding process is pivotal for employee engagement, retention, and productivity. This five-day intensive course will equip you with the tools and techniques to design and implement an effective onboarding and induction program.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Participants will learn how to streamline the integration of new employees into the company culture, align them with organizational goals, and foster a sense of belonging from day one. The course covers a range of essential topics, including orientation planning, role clarification, performance expectations, and socialization tactics. By the end of this course, you will be adept at crafting an onboarding experience that not only welcomes new hires but also accelerates their path to becoming valuable, contributing members of your organization. Join us at LPC to revolutionize your onboarding process and set the foundation for long-term employee success.</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
                'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Essentials of Onboarding and Induction</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>The Importance of Onboarding in Employee Lifecycle</li>\\n<li>Designing an Onboarding Framework: Key Components</li>\\n<li>Legal and Administrative Aspects of Induction</li>\\n<li>Workshop: Creating an Onboarding Checklist</li>\\n<li>Group Discussion: Best Practices in Onboarding</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Crafting the Onboarding Experience</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Developing Orientation Sessions and Welcome Materials</li>\\n<li>Role Clarification and Setting Expectations</li>\\n<li>Engaging New Hires with Interactive Learning Tools</li>\\n<li>Hands-On Exercise: Designing an Orientation Program</li>\\n<li>Peer Review: Sharing and Evaluating Onboarding Materials</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Cultural Integration and Socialization</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Fostering a Welcoming and Inclusive Workplace Culture</li>\\n<li>Strategies for Social Integration and Team Building</li>\\n<li>Mentorship and Support Systems for New Employees</li>\\n<li>Case Study Analysis: Effective Cultural Induction Practices</li>\\n<li>Role-Playing: Navigating Social Dynamics in Onboarding</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Performance Management in Onboarding</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Establishing Performance Goals and Feedback Loops</li>\\n<li>Training and Development During the Onboarding Period</li>\\n<li>Evaluating Onboarding Outcomes and Employee Progress</li>\\n<li>Group Activity: Setting SMART Goals for New Hires</li>\\n<li>Workshop: Developing a Performance Tracking System</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Enhancing and Evaluating the Onboarding Process</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Continuous Improvement in Onboarding Programs</li>\\n<li>Using Technology and Digital Tools for Induction</li>\\n<li>Gathering and Implementing Feedback from New Employees</li>\\n<li>Course Recap and Final Feedback</li>\\n<li>Participant Presentations: Innovative Onboarding Initiatives</li>\\n</ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 5,
                'online' => 1,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:52:34',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:52:34',
