                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Modern Strategic Brand Management & Public Relations Masterclass',
                'description' => '<p>Welcome to the "Modern Strategic Brand Management &amp; Public Relations Masterclass" course! We\'re excited to have you on board for this transformative 10-day learning adventure meticulously designed by LPC. Over the next few days, we\'ll explore the ever-evolving world of brand management and public relations, equipping you with the essential skills for effective brand stewardship.<br /><br /></p>
