ent</li>\\n<li>Competitors analysis</li>\\n<li>Competitive advantages identification</li>\\n<li>SMART objectives</li>\\n<li>Key performance indicators (KPIs)</li>\\n<li>Brand management plan development</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Brand Equity &amp; Public Relations<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Definition of brand equity</li>\\n<li>Building brand equity</li>\\n<li>Brand position</li>\\n<li>Brand associations</li>\\n<li>Brand identity</li>\\n<li>Communication with audience</li>\\n<li>Design principles</li>\\n<li>Brand experience</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Brand Marketing &amp; Public Relations<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Presence in media platforms</li>\\n<li>Events sponsorship</li>\\n<li>Marketing communication</li>\\n<li>Extend audience base</li>\\n<li>Dealing with questions</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Brand Extensions<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>New products development</li>\\n<li>Brand extension definition</li>\\n<li>Pros and cons of brand extension</li>\\n<li>Brand extension programs</li>\\n<li>Brand extension management</li>\\n<li>Brand extension evaluation</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Measuring &amp; Evaluation<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Brand performance assessment</li>\\n<li>Brand Compliance and Audits</li>\\n<li>Evaluation methods</li>\\n<li>Tracking surveys</li>\\n<li>Brand metrics</li>\\n<li>Press coverage sentiment</li>\\n<li>Media coverage</li>\\n<li>Brand audit</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Long-term brand<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Maintaining Brand consistency</li>\\n<li>Brand equity protection</li>\\n<li>Dealing with Brand Crisis</li>\\n<li>Brand revitalization</li>\\n<li>Customers acquisition</li>\\n<li>Global branding</li>\\n</ul>"]',
