            138 => 
            array (
                'id' => 1981,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Business Strategy Construction',
                'description' => '<p>Welcome to the "Business Strategy Construction" course, a transformative educational experience crafted by LPC. Over the next 5 days, you\'ll embark on a dynamic journey designed to equip you with the skills and insights needed to thrive in today\'s competitive business landscape.<br /><br /></p>
<p>In an era defined by rapid change and fierce competition, a well-crafted business strategy is not just advantageous&mdash;it\'s essential for long-term success. Through this immersive course, you\'ll gain a comprehensive understanding of strategic principles and learn how to construct, implement, and refine a robust strategy tailored to your organization\'s unique needs.<br /><br /></p>
<p>Throughout this interactive journey, we\'ll cover the fundamental principles of strategy, crafting tailored plans using hands-on tools. We\'ll analyze the competitive landscape, identify advantages, and set clear goals. We\'ll also focus on monitoring and adapting strategies for continuous improvement, concluding with a look at the future of business strategy, including the integration of sustainable practices.<br /><br /></p>
<p>Eager to unlock the power of strategic thinking? Let\'s embark on this journey together and build a winning business strategy.</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Foundation of Business Strategy</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Introduction to Business Strategy Construction</li>\\n<li>Utilize VMOST and stakeholder analysis</li>\\n<li>External threats and opportunities analysis</li>\\n<li>Internal analysis of resources, capabilities and practices</li>\\n<li>Strategy development for internal and external analysis</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Strategy Management</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Definition of strategic management</li>\\n<li>Master strategy formulation and strategy alignment for organizational direction</li>\\n<li>Setting SMART goals and objectives</li>\\n<li>Develop Key Success Factors (KSFs)</li>\\n<li>Operational and functional strategies formulation</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Strategy Implementation</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Develop a communication plan</li>\\n<li>Building a strategic leadership team to lead and direct the implication process</li>\\n<li>Adopting a strategic action plan</li>\\n<li>Strategic implementation challenges</li>\\n<li>Differentiate between reactive and proactive approaches</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Strategy Monitoring and Evaluation</strong><br /><br /></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Establishing Key Performance Indicators (KPIs) for measurement</li>\\n<li>Performance monitoring systems for strategic projects and initiatives</li>\\n<li>Operational performance and strategy alignment measurement</li>\\n<li>Strategic planning process report</li>\\n<li>Developing a contingency plan for unexpected circumstances</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>The Future of Business Strategy<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Emerging trends exploration in business environment</li>\\n<li>Sustainability integration through the implementation of the &ldquo;three pillars of sustainability&rdquo;</li>\\n<li>Sustainable strategy formulation</li>\\n<li>Competitive advantage maintains methods</li>\\n<li>Innovation and creativity adoption for future challenges</li>\\n</ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 16,
                'online' => 1,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:52:39',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:52:39',
            ),
