            144 => 
            array (
                'id' => 1988,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Fiber Composite Materials & Applications',
                'description' => '<p>Welcome to the "Fiber Composite Materials &amp; Applications" course! We\'re, delighted to welcome you to this transformative 20-day educational experience, meticulously curated by LPC. Over the next few days, you&rsquo;ll explore with LPC team the world of fiber composites, equipping you with the skills and knowledge to unlock the potential of these revolutionary materials.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Throughout your journey with LPC, we\'ll delve into theoretical foundations, engage in hands-on exercises, and hone practical techniques. We\'ll explore techniques for characterizing and testing composites, allowing you to analyze their performance and suitability for specific applications.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Join LPC on a journey to explore and utilize the full potential of these advanced materials!</p>',
                'duration' => '20',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Introduction to Composite Materials</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Identifying composite materials and key related terms</li>\\n<li>The advantages of composite materials over traditional materials</li>\\n<li>Understand the nature of fibers (hemp, pineapple, bamboo)</li>\\n<li>Classifying different types of composite materials</li>\\n<li>Understanding the nature of polymer composites</li>\\n</ul>","<p><span style=\\"font-size: 14pt;\\"><strong>Characteristics of Composite Materials</strong></span></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p><strong>Deleing into structural properties of composite materials</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Tensile strength</li>\\n<li>Flexural strength</li>\\n<li>Shear strength</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p><strong>Understanding thermal properties of composite materials</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Thermal Expansion</li>\\n<li>Thermal Conductivity</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p><strong>Analyzing morphological properties of composite materials</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Microstructure</li>\\n<li>Porosity</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p><strong>Exploring chemical properties of composite materials</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Corrosion Resistance</li>\\n<li>Chemical Stability</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p><strong>Understanding mechanical properties of composite materials</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Tensile Strength</li>\\n<li>Hardness</li>\\n<li>Toughness</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>X-ray Diffraction</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding the fundamental theory of x-ray diffraction</li>\\n<li>The role of x-ray diffraction identifying materials characterization</li>\\n<li>The principles of x-ray analysis</li>\\n<li>Exploring methods of x-ray diffraction</li>\\n<li>Advantages and disadvantages of x-ray diffraction technique</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Scanning Electron Microscopy (SEM)</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding the SEM technique</li>\\n<li>Principles of SEM analysis</li>\\n<li>Identifying SEM components</li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: square;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Electron Source</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Lenses</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Scanning Coil</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Detector</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; The display device</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Power supply</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Vacuum system</li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul>\\n<li>SEM analysis process</li>\\n<li>Advantages and disadvantages of SEM</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Particle Size Distribution (PSD)</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding PSD concepts</li>\\n<li>The importance of PSD</li>\\n<li>Techniques for PSD measurement</li>\\n<li>Preparation methods for PSD sampling</li>\\n<li>Advantages and disadvantages of PSD</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Physical Properties Testing</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Setting up experiments setup for physical properties testing</li>\\n<li>Methodology step-by-step for testing</li>\\n<li>Analyzing and interpreting data</li>\\n<li>Reporting testing results &nbsp;</li>\\n<li>Case study on physical property testing of fiber composite materials</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Fiber Composite Materials Applications</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Utilizing of fiber composite materials in automotive industry</li>\\n<li>Applications of fiber composite materials in sustainability and energy sector</li>\\n<li>Integrating fiber composite materials into construction industry</li>\\n<li><!--[endif]-->Implementation of fiber composite materials in the aircraft and aerospace industry</li>\\n<li>Exploring other common applications of fiber composite materials</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Strength Analysis and Variation of Elastic Properties</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Identifying key concepts of strength analysis and variation of elastic properties</li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: square;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Stress-strain relationships</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Elastic modulus</li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding the role of plantain in reinforcing polymer composites</li>\\n<li>Analysis of stress and strain of composite materials</li>\\n<li>Modeling techniques of composite materials</li>\\n<li>Case study on strength analysis and variation of elastic properties</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Classical Laminate Theory (CLT)</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Identifying laminated composites</li>\\n<li>Principles of classical laminate theory (CLT)</li>\\n<li>Calculation methods of CLT</li>\\n<li>Discussing the limitation of CLT</li>\\n<li>Analyzing laminate with CLT</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Measurement &amp; Evaluation of Fiber Composites</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Importance of measuring and evaluation fiber composites</li>\\n<li>Understanding non-destructive testing</li>\\n<li>Methods of non-destructive testing</li>\\n<li>Case study on measuring and evaluating fiber composites</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Fiber Testing &amp; Quality Control</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Importance of fiber testing for quality control assurance</li>\\n<li>Testing methods for evaluating fiber properties</li>\\n<li>Standards for fiber properties testing</li>\\n<li>Strategies for effective quality control &nbsp;</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Fiber Testing &amp; Quality Control</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Importance of fiber testing for quality control assurance</li>\\n<li>Testing methods for evaluating fiber properties</li>\\n<li>Standards for fiber properties testing</li>\\n<li>Strategies for effective quality control &nbsp;</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Fiber &amp; Polymer in Practical Laboratory&nbsp;</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Fundamentals of fiber composite manufacturing</li>\\n<li>Hybrid construction methods for high-performance applications</li>\\n<li>Preparation of modes for testing</li>\\n<li>Designing prototypes for testing</li>\\n<li>Examining prototype in practical laboratory</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Fiber and Polymer Processing in Textile Industry &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><!--[endif]-->Use of composite reinforcement in the textile industry</li>\\n<li>Fundamentals of fiber composite manufacturing</li>\\n<li>Textile processing techniques for fiber composites</li>\\n<li>Prepreg processing and autoclave curing for textiles</li>\\n<li>Quality control methods in textile industry</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Sustainability &amp; Material Lifecycle</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Environmental impact of composites</li>\\n<li>Understanding life cycle assessment (LCA) analysis</li>\\n<li>Advantages and disadvantages of LAC analysis</li>\\n<li>Methods for designing sustainable composites</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Decarbonization &amp; Net Zero Goal</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding the concept of decarbonization</li>\\n<li>Role composites in decarbonization process</li>\\n<li>Identifying the meaning of net zero carbon emission</li>\\n<li>Strategies to achieve net zero carbon emission</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Composites in Greenhouse</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Identifying function and principles of greenhouse</li>\\n<li>Utilizing of composites in greenhouse applications</li>\\n<li>Advantages of using composites in greenhouse</li>\\n<li>Suitability considerations for composites utilization in greenhouses</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Composite Braiding &amp; Decarbonization</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understand the meaning of composite braiding</li>\\n<li>Techniques of composite braiding</li>\\n<li>Understand the role of composite braiding in decarbonization</li>\\n<li>Methods to develop composites to attain decarbonization</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>SDGs for Advanced Materials</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Identifying of SDGs for advanced materials</li>\\n<li>Strategies to implement sustainable composite materials</li>\\n<li>Utilizing biomass materials for sustainable future</li>\\n<li>Waste management for sustainable future</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>The Future of Fiber Composite Materials&nbsp;</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Exploring advancements and developments in fiber composites</li>\\n<li>Discovering new applications and industries of composite materials</li>\\n<li>Applying lesson learned</li>\\n<li>Review course materials</li>\\n<li>Course Evaluation</li>\\n</ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 45,
                'online' => 0,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:52:41',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:52:41',
            ),
            145 => 
            array (
                'id' => 1989,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Mastering Telecommunication and Electronic Systems: A Convergence of Technology and Business Leadership',
                'description' => '<p>LPC is proud to present a cutting-edge, five-day course meticulously designed for professionals aiming to excel in the dynamic field of telecommunications. This comprehensive program is a confluence of the latest technical competencies and essential business insights, tailored to empower participants with a holistic understanding of the telecommunications sector.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Our curriculum, curated by industry experts, integrates fundamental concepts, advanced technological skills, and strategic business knowledge through an immersive and interactive learning experience. With a blend of lectures, hands-on labs, workshops, and guest speaker sessions, participants will gain invaluable insights and practical skills that are immediately applicable in the workplace.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Whether you are looking to advance your career, pivot to a telecommunications role, or enhance your organization\'s capabilities, this course offers the knowledge, skills, and networking opportunities to propel you towards your goals. Join us at LPC to bridge the gap between traditional education and industry demands, fostering a new generation of telecommunications professionals equipped to navigate and lead in this ever-evolving industry.</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
                'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Introduction to Telecommunications and Networking</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Overview of Telecommunications: Introduction to the field, its history, and its role in the modern world.</li>\\n<li>Networking Fundamentals: Basic concepts, network types, and architectures.</li>\\n<li>Wireless Communications: Introduction to wireless technologies, standards, and infrastructure.</li>\\n<li>Computer Networking: Key protocols, model layers, and network configuration.</li>\\n<li>Networking Lab Session: Practical exercises in setting up and troubleshooting a network.</li>\\n<li>Industry Applications: Discussion on how telecommunications is used across different sectors.</li>\\n<li>Guest Lecture: An industry professional shares insights and experiences in telecommunications.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Core Technical Skills</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Cybersecurity Foundations: Understanding threats, vulnerabilities, and protections in telecommunications.</li>\\n<li>Linux System Administration: Basic commands, file systems, and network configuration in Linux.</li>\\n<li>Server Virtualization: Concepts, benefits, and common tools for virtualization.</li>\\n<li>Algorithms and Data Structures: Introduction to essential algorithms and their applications in telecommunications.</li>\\n<li>Technical Workshop: Hands-on session on cybersecurity or Linux administration.</li>\\n<li>Data Mining and Machine Learning: Overview and applications in telecommunications.</li>\\n<li>Case Study: Analyzing a real-world telecommunications challenge and discussing solutions.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Business Acumen in Telecommunications</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Economics of Telecommunications: Understanding market dynamics and economic principles.</li>\\n<li>Marketing in Telecommunications: Strategies and practices specific to the tech industry.</li>\\n<li>Management and Organizational Behavior: Essentials for leading teams and projects.</li>\\n<li>Finance for Telecommunications: Financial fundamentals and industry-specific financial analysis.</li>\\n<li>Entrepreneurship Workshop: Developing a business plan for a telecommunications startup.</li>\\n<li>Project Management: Principles and tools for effective project management in tech.</li>\\n<li>Panel Discussion: Telecommunications professionals discuss the business side of the industry.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Advanced Technical Topics</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Emerging Technologies in Telecommunications: Exploration of new technologies and trends.</li>\\n<li>Advanced Networking: Deep dive into complex network architectures and protocols.</li>\\n<li>Cloud Computing in Telecommunications: Usage, services, and impact on the industry.</li>\\n<li>Advanced Cybersecurity: Latest tools and strategies for securing telecommunications networks.</li>\\n<li>Simulation Lab: Advanced networking or cybersecurity simulation exercises.</li>\\n<li>Research and Development in Telecommunications: Discussing the role of R&amp;D and innovation.</li>\\n<li>Expert Talk: A leading researcher or innovator shares insights on future technologies.</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Integration and Application</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Project Integration: Applying learned concepts to a comprehensive project.</li>\\n<li>Collaborative Problem-Solving: Teamwork on a telecommunications challenge.</li>\\n<li>Business Strategy Simulation: Role-play exercise in telecommunications business decision-making.</li>\\n<li>Industry Compliance and Standards: Understanding and applying industry regulations.</li>\\n<li>Technology Forecasting: Predicting and preparing for future trends in telecommunications.</li>\\n<li>Leadership in Telecommunications: Developing leadership skills specific to tech environments.</li>\\n<li>Closing Seminar: Recap of key learnings and discussion on continuous learning and development in the field.</li>\\n</ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
