            155 => 
            array (
                'id' => 1999,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Data Visualization',
                'description' => '<p>Welcome to the exciting world of &ldquo;Data Visualization&rdquo;! At LPC, we are thrilled to invite you to embark on a transformative journey into the world of data visualization. In era of digitalization, the ability to effectively communicate ideas through visual storytelling has become a critical skill across various industries.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Data visualization is the art and science of transforming raw data into compelling visuals that can be easily understood by a wide audience. LPC\'s &ldquo;Data Visualization&rdquo; course empowers you with the essential skills and knowledge to harness the full potential of data visualization. It allows you to seamlessly transform data into compelling and impactful narratives, enabling you to unlock invaluable insights.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Throughout this LPC course, you&rsquo;ll embark on a journey to master the foundational principles of data visualization, explore advanced techniques, and harness the power of cutting-edge tools like D3.js, Tableau, and Power BI. Led by industry experts, you will learn to craft compelling visual narratives, design impactful dashboards, and navigate ethical considerations in data representation.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Let us embark on a voyage of discovery through the realm of data visualization, guided by LPC every step of the way.</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Foundation of Data Visualization</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Defining data visualization</li>\\n<li>Determining the importance of visualizing data</li>\\n<li>Understanding human perception and cognition in data visualization</li>\\n<li>Data visualization principles (Alignment, Hierarchy, Contrast, Repetition, Proximity, Balance, Color, Space)</li>\\n<li>Explore common chart types and their functions</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Building Data Visualization</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Types of data visualization:</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: square;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Exploratory Data Visualization</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Data Storytelling</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Data Exploration</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Data Communication<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Utilizing data visualization tools and libraries:<strong><br /><br /></strong></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: square;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;D3.js</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Tableau</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Power BI<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Importing data to visualization tool</li>\\n<li>Selecting the best chart based on design principles for visualization</li>\\n<li>Applications of data visualization</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Advanced Data Visualization Techniques&nbsp;</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Network Visualization technique</li>\\n<li>Text Visualization technique</li>\\n<li>Hierarchy &amp; tree visualization techniques</li>\\n<li>Multivariate visualization technique&nbsp;</li>\\n<li>Geospatial data visualization technique</li>\\n<li>Time series visualization technique</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Visuals for Dashboard Design and Reporting</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Dashboard design principles</li>\\n<li>Utilizing visualization tools for designing dashboards</li>\\n<li>Utilizing storytelling techniques to report data through visualizations</li>\\n<li>Role of usability testing and user feedback for improvement</li>\\n<li>Real-world examples of designed dashboards</li>\\n</ul>","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p><strong>Put it All Together</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Ethical consideration in data visualization</li>\\n<li>Data visualization best practices</li>\\n<li>Data visualization challenges</li>\\n<li>Course review and answering questions</li>\\n<li>&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->Project presentation&nbsp;</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"]',
