            157 => 
            array (
                'id' => 2001,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'KPI Dashboard Implementation',
                'description' => '<p>Mastering performance measurement is within your reach with LPC\'s &ldquo;KPI Dashboard Implementation&rdquo; course. This program, designed by LPC experts, equips you with the tools and knowledge to transform data into actionable insights through KPI dashboards.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>The course delves into the world of KPIs, providing a comprehensive understanding of their role in measuring success. You\'ll explore the benefits of utilizing KPI dashboards and discover how they can facilitate communication and decision-making within your organization.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Over the next 5-days, LPC instructors will guide you through the process of designing impactful KPI dashboards. From selecting the right KPIs to utilizing powerful visualization tools, you\'ll acquire the expertise to design dashboards that connect with your audience and effectively monitor progress towards your goals.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>By the course\'s conclusion, you\'ll be empowered to confidently implement KPI dashboards within your organization. Join LPC\'s &ldquo;KPI Dashboard Implementation&rdquo; course and unlock the power of data-driven performance measurement!</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong>KPIs Overview</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Defining Key Performance Indicators (KPIs)&nbsp;</li>\\n<li>The benefits of KPI framework</li>\\n<li>Understanding KPI dashboard and its key related terms</li>\\n<li>The founder of KPI dashboards: Peter Drucker</li>\\n<li>Differentiating between KPIs and metrics</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Pre-Designing KPI Dashboard</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Utilize SMART criteria when building KPIs</li>\\n<li>Understanding KPIs lifecycle</li>\\n<li>Selecting the right KPIs for each goal</li>\\n<li>Discussing KPIs with stakeholders</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>KPI Dashboard</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>The importance of implementing KPI dashboard</li>\\n<li>KPI dashboard vs. KPI report</li>\\n<li>KPI dashboard vs. scorecard</li>\\n<li>Types of Dashboard:<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: square;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; Operational Dashboard</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; Strategic Dashboard</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; Analytical Dashboard<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Examples of dashboards</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Designing KPI Dashboard Steps<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Characteristics of a well-designed KPI dashboard</li>\\n<li>Selecting the best KPIs and metrics to track performance</li>\\n<li>Data sources selection and methods to collect data</li>\\n<li>Determining target audience and their interests</li>\\n<li>Utilizing graphs and charts on dashboard</li>\\n<li>Communicating dashboard</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>KPI Dashboard Software &amp; Templets</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: square;\\">\\n<li>Strategies to select the right KPI dashboard software</li>\\n<li>Examples of KPI dashboard software:<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: square;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; Google Data Studio</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; Klipfolio</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; Tableau<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Tips for designing KPI dashboard templates</li>\\n<li>Course recap and Q&amp;A</li>\\n<li>Project presentation: KPI dashboard project, and feedback</li>\\n</ul>"]',
