e of communicating KPIs across different departments</li>\\n<li>Methods to communicate KPIs</li>\\n<li>Simplifying KPIs for effective communication</li>\\n<li>Course recap and Q&amp;A</li>\\n<li>Project presentation: Reporting KPI</li>\\n</ul>"]',
