                'description' => '<p>Welcome to the "Sustainability Essentials for Business" course offered by LPC! The rapid change in today&rsquo;s world and what effects it has on different aspects on our life made sustainability a critical concern that businesses need to embrace. This 5-day comprehensive course meticulously designed by LPC to provide you with the essential knowledge and tools to integrate sustainability into your organization.</p>
