            'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Introduction to Sustainability</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Demystifying sustainability and its pillars (Environment Society, &amp; Economy)</li>\\n<li>Benefits of implementing sustainability in business</li>\\n<li>Role of Integrated Management System (IMS) in managing sustainability</li>\\n<li>The importance of making business case for sustainability</li>\\n<li>Discussing global sustainability landscape and business challenges</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Environmental Sustainability</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Determining the impact of business on environment</li>\\n<li>Understanding ISO 14001 Environmental Management System (EMS)</li>\\n<li>Utilizing life cycle assessment to assess environmental impact</li>\\n<li>Integrating circular economy model into business for sustainability</li>\\n<li>Group discussion: methods to reduce environmental footprint and achieve sustainability</li>\\n</ul>","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p><strong>Social Responsibility</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Defining social responsibility concept and its importance for businesses</li>\\n<li>Introducing ISO 26000 social responsibility standard</li>\\n<li>Supply chain management for sustainability</li>\\n<li>Strategies for enhancing diversity, inclusion and equality within organizations</li>\\n<li>Identifying stakeholders and their expectations on social responsibility</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","<p><strong>Designing &amp; Implementing a Sustainable Business Strategy</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Integrating sustainability into business core values and objectives</li>\\n<li>Identifying risks and opportunities of adopting sustainability</li>\\n<li>Developing a sustainable plan, including goals, responsibilities and KPIs</li>\\n<li>Implementing sustainable finance practices</li>\\n<li>Communicating sustainability efforts with stakeholders</li>\\n</ul>","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p><strong>Continuous Improvement &amp; Future of Sustainability</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Role of auditing and management review in ensuring continuous improvement&nbsp;</li>\\n<li>The importance of developing a long-term sustainable strategy</li>\\n<li>Exploring trends and challenges in the field of sustainability</li>\\n<li>Practical exercise: Developing an action plan to integrate sustainability within your company</li>\\n<li>Course recap and Q&amp;A</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"]',
