<p>Training in Oil &amp; Gas&rdquo; course! As we are living in a world centered around energy,</p>
<p>LPC has taken the initiative to provide a com prehensive program focusing on the</p>
<p>oil and gas industry. This course is designed carefully to equip you with the skills</p>
<p>and knowledge necessary to navigate this com plex field.</p>
<p>In this course, spanning five days, we\' ll explore the structure and significance of</p>
<p>the oil and gas industry, tracing the lifecycle of petroleum from its geological</p>
<p>origins to its end uses. You&rsquo;ll learn about oil and gas industry sectors, including</p>
<p>upstream, m idstream and downstream . Moving forward, you&rsquo;ll m aster project</p>
<p>m anagem ent techniques as well as evaluating the technical and financial feasibility</p>
<p>of oil and gas projects. Besides, you&rsquo;ll learn how to develop strategies for risk</p>
<p>management and ensuring safety while working in the field on oil and gas.</p>
<p>By the end of this course , you\' ll gain a solid foundation in the oil and gas sector,</p>
<p>em powering you to m ake standing decisions, pursue exciting career paths, and</p>
<p>contribute m eaningfully to the ever-evolving world of energy.</p>
<p>Join LPC and get ready to dem ystify the oil and gas industry!</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Foundations &amp; Fundamentals<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Gaining a comprehensive overview of the oil and gas industry, and its importance</li>\\n<li>Understanding the life cycle of petroleum</li>\\n<li>Defining hydrocarbons and its classifications:<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: square;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; Alkanes</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; Alkenes</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; Alkynes</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; Arenes<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Identifying value chain of oil and gas and its stages:<br /><strong><br /></strong></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: square;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; Decision Making</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; The legal and regulatory framework</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; Licensing and contracting</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; Acquisition and exploration</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; Production process</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; Refining</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; Distribution<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Discovering oil and gas industry segments:<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: square;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; Upstream</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; Midstream</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; Downstream&nbsp;</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Upstream &amp; Downstream: Exploration &amp; Production<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding the basics of petroleum geology and its role in exploration</li>\\n<li>Exploring how seismic surveys map potential oil and gas reserves</li>\\n<li>Learning how to evaluate and develop promising discoveries</li>\\n<li>Understanding the process of drilling wells and bringing petroleum to the surface</li>\\n<li>Techniques for well completion and reserve estimation</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Midstream: Transportation &amp; Logistics<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Exploring the role of storage tanks and tank farms in the midstream segment</li>\\n<li>Methods to transport oil, gas and LNG</li>\\n<li>Learning how oil and gas are transported across vast distances using pipelines</li>\\n<li>Exploring the dynamics of global petroleum trading</li>\\n<li>Differentiating between different crudes based on their unique characteristics:<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: square;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp;Light crude oil</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp;Medium crude oil</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp;Heavy crude oil</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp;Extra heavy crude oil&nbsp;</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Project Management &amp; Economics</strong><br /><br /></p>\\n<p>Identifying oil and gas project lifecycle and its stages:<br /><br /></p>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: square;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; Exploration</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; Appraisal</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; Development</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; Production</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; Decommissioning<br /><br /><br /></li>\\n<li>Exploring the role of project management office (PMO) in project execution</li>\\n<li>Utilizing responsibility matrices and accountability in projects</li>\\n<li>Utilizing revenue streams, net present value (NPV), and project timelines to ensure project</li>\\n<li>success</li>\\n<li>Analyzing the financial viability of projects using payback period (PP) and cost of capital</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Risk Management &amp; Navigating Challenges</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Identifying and prioritizing risks inherent in the oil and gas industry</li>\\n<li>Utilizing probability matrices to assess risk impact</li>\\n<li>Understanding health, safety and environmental (HSE) issues in oil and gas operations</li>\\n<li>Discovering the potential barriers to cultural shifts towards safety focus</li>\\n<li>Discussing the challenges and opportunities facing the oil and gas industry</li>\\n</ul>"]',
