U operations&nbsp;</li>\\n<li>Discussing how to implement risk assessment and mitigation strategies for FSRU operations&nbsp;</li>\\n<li>Emergency response planning and crisis management protocols&nbsp;</li>\\n<li>Discussing the importance of training for emergency response procedures&nbsp;</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Continuous Improvement &amp; Best Practices&nbsp;<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Determining the importance of involving stakeholders in FSRU operations&nbsp;</li>\\n<li>Techniques to develop effective communication channels between technical and legal departments&nbsp;</li>\\n<li>Discussing the importance of monitoring performance of FSRU operations for improvements&nbsp;</li>\\n<li>Discussing the current situation of SFRU projects&nbsp;</li>\\n<li>Group discussion and Q&amp;A</li>\\n</ul>"]',
