                'id' => 2032,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Employee Performance Management',
                'description' => '<p>This intensive 5-day program is designed to equip managers and HR professionals with the skills, knowledge, and tools required to effectively manage and enhance employee performance. Through a mix of lectures, interactive sessions, case studies, and practical exercises, participants will learn the best practices and latest strategies for performance management.</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
