                'description' => '<p>The Digital Transformation in Aviation program is designed to equip aviation professionals with the knowledge, skills, and strategies needed to navigate the rapidly evolving landscape of digital technology in the aviation industry. In today\'s digital age, harnessing the power of technology is essential for enhancing operational efficiency, improving passenger experience, and staying competitive in the global aviation market.</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<ul>\\n<li>Introduction to Digital Transformation in Aviation</li>\\n<li>Overview of Digital Trends in the Aviation Industry</li>\\n<li>The Impact of Digital Disruption on Aviation Business Models</li>\\n<li>Key Technologies Shaping the Future of Aviation</li>\\n<li>Aviation Industry Requirements</li>\\n<li>Architecture</li>\\n</ul>","<ul>\\n<li>Python- Digital Transformation</li>\\n<li>Digital Strategy Development for Airlines and Airports</li>\\n<li>Data-driven Decision Making in Aviation Operations</li>\\n<li>Enhancing Passenger Experience through Digital Innovation</li>\\n<li>Digital Marketing and Customer Engagement Strategies for Airlines</li>\\n<li>Cybersecurity Challenges and Solutions in Aviation</li>\\n</ul>","<ul>\\n<li>Cloud Computing and Big Data Analytics in Aviation</li>\\n<li>Internet of Things (IoT) Applications in Aviation Maintenance</li>\\n<li>Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning in Air Traffic Management</li>\\n<li>Blockchain Technology for Aviation Supply Chain Management</li>\\n<li>Augmented Reality and Virtual Reality in Pilot Training and Simulation</li>\\n<li>Digital Twin Technology for Aircraft Design and Maintenance</li>\\n</ul>","<ul>\\n<li>Aviation Regulatory Frameworks in the Digital Age</li>\\n<li>Case Studies: Successful Digital Transformation Initiatives in Aviation</li>\\n<li>Challenges and Opportunities of Implementing Digital Solutions in Aviation</li>\\n<li>Strategies for Overcoming Resistance to Change in Aviation Organizations</li>\\n<li>Building a Culture of Innovation and Continuous Improvement</li>\\n<li>pg. 3 Dr A. Rayatchi</li>\\n<li>Collaboration and Partnerships in Driving Digital Innovation in Aviation</li>\\n</ul>","<ul>\\n<li>Leadership and Change Management in Digital Transformation Projects</li>\\n<li>Developing Digital Skills and Talent in the Aviation Workforce</li>\\n<li>Ethical and Legal Implications of Digital Transformation in Aviation</li>\\n<li>Future Trends and Predictions for Digital Aviation</li>\\n</ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 50,
                'online' => 0,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:52:55',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:52:55',
            ),
            195 => 
            array (
                'id' => 2039,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Facility Management - Decommissioning and Demolition Training',
                'description' => '<p>We welcome you to the 5-day comprehensive Facility Management Decommissioning and Demolition Course that provided by LPC. This course has been designed to targeted the FM professionals and to give them the ability to deconstruct both onshore and offshore facilities in a safe and efficient way.&nbsp;</p>
<p>With LPC&rsquo;s high skilled FM trainers, the participants will gain in-depth understanding of all aspects of this process starting from initial planning through final site remediation through theoretical knowledge blended with practical exercises. Our experienced trainers will walk you through every stage ensuring that you are ready for industry standards as well as meeting legal obligations.</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
                'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Introduction and Overview of Decommissioning Phases</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Course Introduction and Objectives</li>\\n<li>Overview of Decommissioning Phases:</li>\\n<li>Introduction to decommissioning</li>\\n<li>Key phases: Planning, execution, and post-decommissioning</li>\\n<li>Differences between offshore and onshore decommissioning</li>\\n<li>Project Team Roles and Responsibilities:</li>\\n<li>Key roles in a decommissioning project</li>\\n<li>Responsibilities and coordination among team members</li>\\n<li>Case Study: Successful Decommissioning Projects</li>\\n<li>Interactive Session: Role-playing Different Team Members</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Planning and Preparation</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Mobilization/Demobilization Plan:</li>\\n<li>Planning and logistics</li>\\n<li>Resource allocation</li>\\n<li>Environmental and Safety Risk Management:</li>\\n<li>Identifying and mitigating risks</li>\\n<li>Safety protocols and procedures</li>\\n<li>Socio-economic Impacts and Regulatory Aspects:</li>\\n<li>Community and stakeholder engagement</li>\\n<li>Regulatory compliance and documentation</li>\\n<li>Interactive Workshop: Creating a Mobilization Plan</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Making Facilities Safe for Demolition</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Preparing Facilities for Demolition:</li>\\n<li>Ensuring zero energy state</li>\\n<li>Flushing, pigging, and cleaning techniques</li>\\n<li>Offshore Demolition Techniques:</li>\\n<li>Demolishing mooring towers, pipelines, and underwater structures</li>\\n<li>Handling FSO vessel storage and platforms</li>\\n<li>Onshore Demolition Techniques:</li>\\n<li>Dismantling equipment, tanks, and piping systems</li>\\n<li>Deconstructing electrical systems, structures, and buildings</li>\\n<li>Interactive Session: Facility Safety Exercise</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","<p><strong>Specialized Decommissioning Techniques</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Well Plug and Abandonment:</li>\\n<li>Techniques for well decommissioning</li>\\n<li>Safety and environmental considerations</li>\\n<li>Waste Management in Decommissioning:</li>\\n<li>Types of waste</li>\\n<li>Disposal and recycling methods</li>\\n<li>Transporting Demolished Materials:</li>\\n<li>Logistics of transporting demolition debris</li>\\n<li>Equipment and machinery needed</li>\\n<li>Interactive Workshop: Designing a Transport Plan</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Post-Decommissioning Activities and Cost Management</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Site Remediation and Restoration:</li>\\n<li>Techniques for land reclamation and revegetation</li>\\n<li>Monitoring and maintaining restored sites</li>\\n<li>Post-Decommissioning Monitoring:</li>\\n<li>Long-term monitoring strategies</li>\\n<li>Environmental and structural monitoring</li>\\n<li>Cost Estimation and Scheduling:</li>\\n<li>Estimating costs for decommissioning projects</li>\\n<li>Developing a project schedule</li>\\n<li>Final Review and Q&amp;A Session:</li>\\n<li>Recap of key learning points</li>\\n<li>Open floor for questions and discussions</li>\\n<li>Assessment and Certification:</li>\\n<li>Final assessment of participants</li>\\n<li>Course certification ceremony</li>\\n</ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 11,
                'online' => 1,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:52:56',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:52:56',
            ),
