            'name' => 'Disciplined Agile Scrum Master (DASM) Certification',
            'description' => '<p>LPC welcomes you to the &ldquo;Preparation Course Disciplined Agile Scrum Master (DASM) Certification&rdquo;. This interesting 5-days program is carefully designed by LPC to equip you with knowledge and skills to master Disciplined Agile (DA) as well as prepare you for the PMI-SP certification exam.<br /><br /></p>
<p>With LPC, you&rsquo;ll dive deep into the fundamental principles of Agile methodologies and DA practices. You&rsquo;ll gain a strong foundation on Agile, Lean and DA through exploring their terminologies, principles, and methodologies. You&rsquo;ll learn how to select your team and their way of working (WoW) for organizational success. Besides, you&rsquo;ll master the DA lifecycles and phases as well as tailoring these phases to fit WoW.<br /><br /></p>
<p>Join LPC for this interesting journey and elevate your professional capabilities in Disciplined Agile Scrum. This course will only prepare you to study for the PMI-SP.</p>',
