ng the process of developing portfolio strategic objectives&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding risk appetite in portfolio management&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring the steps of creating a portfolio charter and roadmap</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the criteria of evaluating and selecting portfolio key components&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Strategies for optimizing portfolio and managing the strategic alignment </span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Portfolio Governance and Capacity Management&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Introduction to portfolio governance: Concepts, principles and roles&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Recognizing the impact of portfolio governance on programs and projects&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing factors of effective portfolio governance design&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Describing the capacity planning process&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing supply and demand management and optimization strategies&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Tools and techniques to assess and develop capacity&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Methods for analyzing and reporting capacity performance</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Best practices for balancing capacity and organizational capabilities </span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Portfolio Stakeholder Engagement and Value Management&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Techniques for defining, identifying and analyzing portfolio stakeholders</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discovering ways to plan for stakeholder engagement&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing and identifying communication management approaches&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Strategies for effective management of portfolio communication&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Defining value management and its main components&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring negotiation techniques of expected value&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing value management strategies:</span></li></ul><p><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\"><span class=\\"ql-cursor\\">﻿</span></span></p><ul><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Value maximization strategies</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Value assurance strategies</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Value realization strategies</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Value measurement and reporting strategies</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Portfolio Risk Management&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the guiding principles of risk management&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing portfolio risk management strategies&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring the Portfolio Risk Management Framework&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Describing the main components of a risk management plan</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Lessons learned and best practices</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Final Q&amp;A and course wrap-up</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Simulated exam</span></li></ul>"]',
