<p>In these 5 days, the course unfolds the essential skills and knowledge required to excel as a business analyst. Starting with the fundamentals, we lay a strong foundation, gradually progressing to more complex concepts and practical applications. Participants will engage in interactive sessions, case studies, and group activities, ensuring a blend of theoretical understanding and practical experience.</p>
