fe cycle</li>\\n<li>Exploring different adaptive frameworks:<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: square;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Lean</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Scrum</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Kanban</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Extreme programming</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;FDD, DSDM, and Crystal<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Discussing techniques to measure performance</li>\\n<li>Defining uncertainty in project management</li>\\n<li>Understanding how to tracking and managing risk in adaptive approaches</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Business Analysis</strong> <br /><br /></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Determining the significance of business analysis</li>\\n<li>Roles and responsibilities of business analyst</li>\\n<li>Understanding how to gather requirements for business analysis</li>\\n<li>The importance of engaging stockholders in business analysis</li>\\n<li>Determining the impact of project approach on business analysis</li>\\n<li>Exploring the business analysis domains:<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: square;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Needs assessment</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Business analysis planning</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Requirements elicitation and analysis</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Traceability and monitoring</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Solution evaluation</li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Discussing the tailoring process of projects &nbsp;</li>\\n<li>Lessons Learned and Best Practices</li>\\n<li>Final Q&amp;A and Course Wrap-Up</li>\\n</ul>"]',
