finition and Delivery Phases&rsquo; Activities<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Program integration management and infrastructure development</li>\\n<li>Program formulation phases and activities</li>\\n<li>Program change management</li>\\n<li>Program communication management</li>\\n<li>Program financial management</li>\\n<li>Program information management</li>\\n<li>Program procurement management</li>\\n<li>Program quality management</li>\\n<li>Program resources management</li>\\n<li>Program scope management</li>\\n<li>Program schedule management</li>\\n<li>Program risk management</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Program Closure Phase&rsquo;s Activities<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Program financial closer</li>\\n<li>Program information archiving and transition</li>\\n<li>Program procurement closure</li>\\n<li>Program resource transition</li>\\n<li>Program risk management transition</li>\\n<li>Lessons learned and best practices</li>\\n<li>Final Q&amp;A and course wrap-up</li>\\n<li>Simulated exam</li>\\n</ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
