ul><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring different types of hybrid and combined project life cycles and their characteristics&nbsp;</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ul><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Combined Agile and predictive approaches&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Predominantly predictive approach with some Agile components&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">A largely Agile approach with a predictive component&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Hybrid life cycles at fit-for-purpose</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Hybrid life cycles as a transition strategy&nbsp;</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the selection of an appropriate project life cycle&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discovering methods for mixing Agile approaches&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Analyzing project factors impacting the tailoring of project attributes </span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Implementing Agile: Creating an Agile Environment&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Introduction to the process of creating an Agile environment&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Recognizing the role of the Agile mindset in building an Agile environment&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Identifying the benefits of servant leadership in Empowering Agile team&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring the Responsibility and role of servant Leaders and project managers in an Agile environment&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Describing team composition and structure&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Determining the characteristics of Agile teams </span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Implementing Agile: Delivering in an Agile Environment&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the process of charting the project and the team&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discovering common Agile practices:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ul><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Retrospectives&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Backlog preparation&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Backlog refinement&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Daily standups&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Demonstration/ Reviews&nbsp;</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the planning process for iteration-based Agile&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring execution practices helps teams deliver value&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Identifying the role of interaction and increments in delivering work product&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing troubleshooting strategies for Agile project challenges</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring measurement techniques in Agile projects </span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Organizational Considerations for Project Agility&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing change management drivers and methods for managing changes&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Strategies for assessing and building organizational culture&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Best practices for managing procurement and contracts&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing business practices for organizational agility&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding multiteam coordination and dependencies in projects&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the interaction between Agile and the project management office (PMO)&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Identifying the characteristics of organizational structure&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Lessons Learned and Best Practices</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Final Q&amp;A and Course Wrap-Up</span></li></ul>"]',
