            221 => 
            array (
                'id' => 2065,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
            'name' => 'PMI Risk Management Professional (PMI-RMP)',
            'description' => '<p>Welcome to &ldquo;Preparation Course for PMI Risk Management Professional (PMI-RMP)&rdquo;! This comprehensive 5-day program is carefully designed by LPC to equip you with the essential skills and knowledge required to excel in risk management whether in the context of portfolio, program or project management.<br /><br /></p>
<p>Risk management is a vital component of project management and program management as well as portfolio management, as it enables organizations and business to predict potential risks and opportunities which increase the likelihood of success. Throughout this course, you&rsquo;ll dive deep into the fundamentals of risk management, including terminology, principles, and practical aspects of effective program management as described in the PMI Guide to Risk Professional Management. With LPC, you&rsquo;ll master the phases of risk management cycle: risk planning, risk identification, risk analysis, risk response, and risk monitoring. By integrating practical exercises, case studies and exam-focused study materials, you&rsquo;ll be well-prepared to pass the PMI-RMP certification exam on your first attempt.<br /><br /></p>
<p>Join LPC today on this exciting journey to achieve your PMI-RMP certification as well as mastering risk management strategies in your projects, portfolio, or program. Your pathway to becoming a proficient risk management professional starts here. This course will only prepare you to study for the PMI-RMP.</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Introduction to Risk Management<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>PMI Risk Management Professional (PMI-RMP) &reg; examination content outline</li>\\n<li>Introduction to PMI and PMI-RMP certification</li>\\n<li>Principles of risk management</li>\\n<li>Defining risk management and key related terms</li>\\n<li>Understanding the importance of risk management in organizations</li>\\n<li>Roles and responsibilities of a risk manager</li>\\n<li>Exploring domains of risk management:<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: square;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Enterprise</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Portfolio</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Program</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Project<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Identifying success factors of risk management</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Fundamentals of Risk Management<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Introduction to business context of risk management in portfolio, program, and project management</li>\\n<li>Understanding the organizational framework and organizational context</li>\\n<li>Discussing strategic and organizational planning</li>\\n<li>Exploring scope of accountability, responsibility and authority at enterprise, portfolio, program, project levels</li>\\n<li>Understanding general approaches to risk management</li>\\n<li>Factors for evaluating risk</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Risk Management Life Cycle<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Plan risk management</li>\\n<li>Identify risks</li>\\n<li>Perform qualitative risk analysis</li>\\n<li>Perform quantitative risk analysis</li>\\n<li>Plan risk responses</li>\\n<li>Implement risk responses</li>\\n<li>Monitor risks</li>\\n</ul>","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p><strong>Portfolio &amp; Program Risk Management</strong> <br /><br /></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Discovering portfolio risk management life cycle</li>\\n<li>Tools and techniques of risk management in portfolio</li>\\n<li>Integrating risk management into portfolio management performance domains</li>\\n<li>Discovering program risk management life cycle</li>\\n<li>Tools and techniques of risk management in program</li>\\n<li>Integrating risk management into program management performance domains</li>\\n<li>Case studies about portfolio and program risk management</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","<p><strong>Project Risk Management<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Discovering project risk management life cycle</li>\\n<li>Tools and techniques of risk management in project</li>\\n<li>Integrating risk management into project management performance domains</li>\\n<li>Case studies about project and program risk management</li>\\n<li>Lessons learned and best practices</li>\\n<li>Final Q&amp;A and course wrap-up</li>\\n<li>Simulated exam</li>\\n</ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
