on of Governance Programs<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding the meaning of impact evaluation</li>\\n<li>Exploring the designs of impact evaluation</li>\\n<li>Utilizing impact evaluation to assess the governance impact on society and citizens</li>\\n<li>Utilizing impact evaluation to assess the effectiveness of governance policies and programs</li>\\n<li>Understanding how to evaluate transparency and accountability in governance programs</li>\\n<li>Techniques for evaluating anti-corruption in governance programs</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Reporting and Utilizing of M&amp;E findings &amp; Participatory M&amp;E<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Exploring tools and techniques for reporting monitoring and evaluation findings &bull; The importance of communicating and publishing evaluation results</li>\\n<li>Disusing how to use monitoring and evaluation finding for policy adjustment and improvement</li>\\n<li>Understanding the meaning of participatory and its significance in monitoring and evaluation</li>\\n<li>Tools and techniques for participatory monitoring and evaluation</li>\\n<li>Utilizing participatory monitoring and evaluation to build ownership and accountability</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Best Practices &amp; Future Trends<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Discussing best practices on monitoring and evaluation for governance</li>\\n<li>Exploring recent trends and interesting practices</li>\\n<li>The significance of strategic alliances and harmonized approaches for governance monitoring and</li>\\n<li>evaluation</li>\\n<li>Discussing data demand and use in governance programs</li>\\n<li>Project: develop monitoring and evaluation plan for governance programs</li>\\n<li>Lesson learned and course evaluation</li>\\n</ul>"]',
