            227 => 
            array (
                'id' => 2073,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Materials Management & Planning',
                'description' => '<p><span lang="EN-IN">Greetings and a warm welcome to the " Materials Management &amp; Planning" course! Empower your material management skills through a transformative 5-day learning journey meticulously designed by LPC to equip you with tools and knowledge to deal with the flow of materials.<br /><br /></span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-IN">Over the next 5 days with LPC, we\'ll gain a comprehensive understanding of materials management and planning, including key concepts, processes, and challenges. We&rsquo;ll start with building a strong foundation through understanding the role of materials management within the operating environment and supply chain, as well as&nbsp;</span>the process of manufacturing resource planning and product planning systems. As we progress, we&rsquo;ll get down to the nuts and bolts of materials management such as the main tools of materials management, techniques to manage capacity and develop materials plan. Then, we&rsquo;ll together explore techniques to handle challenges associated with materials management, control work orders and reporting materials. Moving forward, we&rsquo;ll investigate on integration of materials management with other supply chain functions such as purchasing, procurement, and forecasting. We&rsquo;ll warp up this course by discovering key metrics and control systems in materials management.<br /><br /></p>
<p><span lang="EN-IN">By the end of this course, you\'ll be equipped to play a vital role in materials management within any organization. You\'ll possess the necessary knowledge and skills to ensure a smooth and efficient flow of materials through the supply chain.<br /><br /></span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-IN">Join LPC in this immersive learning experience, as we elevate materials management to new heights!</span></p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\"><strong>Introduction to Materials Management<br /><br /></strong></span></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Introducing materials management and its key concepts</li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Understanding the operating environment of operations management </span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Determining the role of materials managers within the organization </span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Grasping supply chain concepts and metrics </span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Discussing the process of manufacturing resource planning </span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Exploring production planning systems </span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Case studies of materials management in actions</span></li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Elements of Materials Management<br /><br /></span></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Understanding the function of bills of materials and its structure </span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Exploring materials requirement planning (MRP) techniques </span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Recognizing the steps of developing a master production schedule </span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Understanding how to manage capacity:<br /><br /></span></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: square;\\">\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Capacity planning </span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Capacity available </span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Capacity required<br /><br /></span></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Understanding the process of capacity requirement planning and its role in load management </span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Discussing the overall process of developing materials plan</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Case studies on materials management elements</span></li>\\n</ul>","<p><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\"><strong>Handling Challenges in Materials Management<br /><br /></strong></span></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Exploring techniques for scheduling and preparing production orders</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Understanding load levelling and how to build load profile </span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Grasping the meaning of scheduling bottlenecks and the principles of bottlenecks</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Understanding the theory of Constraints and Drum-Buffer-Rope</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Discussing how to implement and control work orders</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Exploring how to generate production reports and its elements</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Case study that addresses challenges in materials management</span></li>\\n</ul>","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p><strong><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Integrating Materials Management with other Supply Chain Functions<br /><br /></span></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Understanding the integration between materials management and purchasing/ procurement department</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Discussing the process and requirements for establishing specifications for materials </span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Exploring how to select the right suppliers that align with materials planning</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Determining the impact of material requirement planning on purchasing</span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Discussing the characteristics of demand, and how to forecast and manage it </span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Exploring different models and methods for forecasting demand </span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Case study on integrated materials management</span></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p><strong><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Materials Management Metrics &amp; Controls<br /><br /></span></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Understanding aggregate inventory management and its elements </span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Understanding what is economic-order quantity (EOQ) and its formula </span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Understanding what is periodic-order quantity (POQ) and its formula </span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Discussing how to determine safety stock </span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Recognizing how materials management can support just-in-time (JIT) and Lean production </span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Determining the importance of implementing quality control in materials planning system </span></li>\\n<li><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\">Case study about materials control and metrics</span></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"]',
