            235 => 
            array (
                'id' => 2081,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Nuclear Receipt Inspection',
                'description' => '<p>Welcome to the " Nuclear Receipt Inspection" Bootcamp! LPC meticulously crafted this course for professionals dedicated to maintaining the highest standards of safety and compliance in nuclear industry. Throughout this course, you&rsquo;ll gain valuable insight into the critical aspects of nuclear receipt inspection, equipping you with the expertise and knowledge needed to excel in this field. Over the next 5 days, you\'ll embark on a hands-on learning journey guided by LPC instructors to understand the significance of nuclear receipt inspection in ensuring safety and regulatory compliance. You&rsquo;ll master the process of commercial grade dedication, and you&rsquo;ll learn advanced inspection techniques. With LPC, you&rsquo;ll apply statistical and sampling techniques to read-world examples, and gain practical knowledge of both mechanical and electrical CGIs. By enrolling in this LPC course, you\'ll enhance your expertise in nuclear receipt inspections, and you&rsquo;ll be well-prepared to contribute to the safety and reliability of nuclear operations. Ready to take your inspection skills to the next level and make a significant impact in the nuclear industry? Join LPC\'s &ldquo;Nuclear Receipt Inspection&rdquo; course today!</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Introduction to Nuclear Receipt Inspection<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding the purpose and significance of Nuclear Receipt Inspection in ensuring safety and compliance</li>\\n<li>Overview of nuclear receipt inspection process</li>\\n<li>Discussing key regulatory standards for nuclear receipt inspection:<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: square;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; NRC 10CFR50</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ASME nQ-1</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ANSI N45.2.6</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; EPRI 5652 CGD<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Discussing the importance of compliance in maintaining safety and regulatory adherence</li>\\n<li>Identifying regulatory requirements applicable to a sample nuclear receipt scenario</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Commercial Grenade Dedication (CGD)<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding the meaning of commercial grade item (CGI) and the purpose of commercial</li>\\n<li>grenade dedication</li>\\n<li>Discussing various acceptance methods used in CGD</li>\\n<li>Understanding how to execute CGD in receipt inspection</li>\\n<li>Methods for selecting critical characteristics for CGD</li>\\n<li>The importance of dedication acknowledgement</li>\\n<li>Discussing real-world examples of CGD process</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Inspection Techniques<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Techniques for interpreting acceptance method requirements and confirming specifications</li>\\n<li>The importance of calibration and accuracy of measurement and test equipment in receipt</li>\\n<li>inspections</li>\\n<li>Techniques for reporting non-conformity and taking corrective actions</li>\\n<li>Best practices for maintaining records and reporting receipt inspection process</li>\\n<li>Activity: perform a mock inspection and report findings</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Practical Applications &amp; Sampling Techniques<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Discovering statistical and sampling techniques used in nuclear receipt inspections</li>\\n<li>Understanding the process of inspecting mechanical CGIs</li>\\n<li>Understanding the process of inspecting electrical CGIs</li>\\n<li>Activity: Conduct sampling and statistical analysis for a ser of nuclear materials</li>\\n<li>Activity: Conduct receipt inspection with focus on mechanical and electrical CGIs</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Quality Assurance &amp; Continuous Improvement<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding the importance of quality assurance in nuclear receipt inspections</li>\\n<li>Principles of quality assurance in nuclear receipt inspections to ensure continuous improvements</li>\\n<li>Discussing best practices in nuclear receipt inspections</li>\\n<li>Lesson learned and discussions</li>\\n<li>Course recap</li>\\n<li>Course evaluation&nbsp;</li>\\n</ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 15,
                'online' => 1,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:53:21',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:53:21',
            ),
