            245 => 
            array (
                'id' => 2091,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Introduction to Product Management',
                'description' => '<p>Welcome to " Introduction to Product Management&rdquo; course! This 5-day course is crafted with care by LPC to immerse you in the world of products and their management.<br /><br /></p>
<p>Over the span of five days, you\'ll embark on a hands-on learning journey guided by LPC instructors. You&rsquo;ll learn everything about product management from the basics of defining a product to the intricacies of market strategy and design principles. Moreover, you&rsquo;ll explore the roles, responsibilities and skills of a product manager including technical, strategic, and growth areas. You&rsquo;ll also master product development methodologies and communication strategies that are crucial for successful product management.<br /><br /></p>
<p>By the conclusion of this course, you\'ll be equipped with the skills and confidence to manage your product during its whole life cycle.<br /><br /></p>
<p>Join LPC for this enlightening journey and become proficient in field of product management.</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Product &amp; Product Management<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Defining product, product management and other related terms</li>\\n<li>Differentiating between product, project, and program management</li>\\n<li>Understanding the product triangle:<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Product Design</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Product Development</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Product Marketing</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Product Management<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Identifying the objective and significance of product management</li>\\n<li>Understanding Product Development Life Cycle<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Finding and Planning</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Designing</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Building</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Sharing</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Assessing</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Who is Product Manager?<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding the significance of a product manager</li>\\n<li>Identifying roles and responsibilities of the project manager</li>\\n<li>Exploring the types of product manager<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Technical Product Manager</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Strategic Product Manager</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Growth Product Manager<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Exploring aspects of product manager<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Core competencies</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Emotional Intelligence</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Company Fit<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Case study: a story about successful product managers</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Market Research &amp; Product Finding &amp; Planning<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding the concepts of Technology Adoptive Curve and Crossing the Chasm</li>\\n<li>Defining the steps to cross the chasm:<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Starting with niche market</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Solving customer problem</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Segmenting the market</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Expanding your market<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Discovering marketing challenges and common marketing mistakes</li>\\n<li>Utilizing techniques to understand company&rsquo;s current situation and create product strategy<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Golden circle</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; The 5C analysis<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Implementing the scientific method and build hypotheses to develop a product</li>\\n<li>Utilizing product requirements documents (PRD) for documenting product/ market fit</li>\\n<li>Understanding product validation and its tools</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Product Design<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Familiarizing with basic approaches to design a product and user experience design</li>\\n<li>Understanding the steps of design process<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; User research</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Information architecture</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Interaction design</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Prototyping</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Visual design</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Content strategy<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Utilizing Prototypes for designing a product</li>\\n<li>The principles of a good design of a product</li>\\n<li>Techniques to measure designs:<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; A/B testing&nbsp;</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Qualitative research</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Product Development &amp; Communication<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Developing metrics and KPIs align with product objectives</li>\\n<li>Tips to communicate in product management:<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Internal communication</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Communication with designers</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Communication with engineers</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Communication with stakeholders</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Communication with customers<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding the importance of creating product roadmap</li>\\n<li>Understanding development methodology for building a product<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Waterfall software development</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Agile development</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Scrum</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Kanban<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul>\\n<li>The role of collecting insights and feedback from team and customers to assess the product</li>\\n</ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 52,
                'online' => 1,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:53:24',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:53:24',
            ),
