            247 => 
            array (
                'id' => 2093,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Product Strategy and Vision',
                'description' => '<p>LPC invites you to join " Product Strategy &amp; Vision&rdquo; comprehensive course!<br /><br /></p>
<p>Are you looking to master the skill of developing product strategy and vision? You&rsquo;re on the right place!<br /><br /></p>
<p>Over the span of 5 days with LPC, you&rsquo;ll be able to differentiate between product strategy and company strategy, ensuring alignment with business objectives for its competitive edge in the market. You also will dive deep into product strategy fundamentals, mastering product pyramid and the elements of the strategy. Moving forward, you&rsquo;ll learn effective techniques to craft your product vision which guide your company&rsquo;s direction with clarity and purpose. Then, you&rsquo;ll use your vision and other tools to develop your strategy. Finally, you&rsquo;ll understand the role of communicating your strategy and vision and how to communicate them effectively, inspiring teams and stakeholders alike.<br /><br /></p>
<p>What you are waiting for? Enroll now and elevate your strategic prowess and drive success with LPC.</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Product Strategy vs. Company Strategy<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Differentiating between product strategy and company strategy</li>\\n<li>Understanding the direction between company strategy and product strategy<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Aligning product development with business objectives</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Ensuring competitive advantage and market positioning<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Identifying the role of understanding target customers and market segmentation in product strategy</li>\\n<li>Understanding competitive positioning and analyzing the competitive environment</li>\\n<li>Creating value proposition that shows the unique benefits of a product</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Product Strategy Fundamentals</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Identifying product strategy process:<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Timeboxed strategizing</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Continuous strategizing<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding product strategy pyramid</li>\\n<li>Identifying the types of product&rsquo;s innovation<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Core innovations</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Adjacent innovations</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Disruptive innovations<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding product life cycle model and how it influences product strategy<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Development</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Introduction</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Growth</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Maturity</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Decline<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding the elements of product strategy<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Clear objectives and key results (OKRs)</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Understanding target customers and market dynamics</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Risk assessment and mitigation</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Crafting Product Vision<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>What is product vision?</li>\\n<li>Understanding the role of product vision on guiding company&rsquo;s direction and ensuring alignment with business goals and values</li>\\n<li>Identifying the components of a product vision:<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Long-term perspective</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Alignment with company mission</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Customer and market focus<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding the characteristics of a good vision that motives and guides people</li>\\n<li>Exercise: craft your own product vision&nbsp;</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Developing Product Strategy Techniques<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Utilizing product vision to design the product strategy</li>\\n<li>Identifying target market and user personas</li>\\n<li>Identifying the features of the product stands out in a competitive advantage</li>\\n<li>Building a product roadmap that aligns with the strategy</li>\\n<li>Exercise: develop your own product strategy</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Communicating Strategy &amp; Vision<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Determining the importance of communicating product strategy and vision with stakeholders</li>\\n<li>Techniques to collaborate with stakeholders while developing product strategy and vision</li>\\n<li>Understanding how vision can inspire and guide the team</li>\\n<li>Utilizing customers and team feedback to adopt the strategy</li>\\n<li>Tips to measure the strategy for continuous improvements</li>\\n<li>Course Review</li>\\n</ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 52,
                'online' => 1,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:53:25',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:53:25',
            ),
