            253 => 
            array (
                'id' => 2099,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Mastering Oil Trading Concepts',
                'description' => '<p>Are you looking to dive deep into the world of oil trading? Welcome to LPC&rsquo;s immersive " Mastering Oil Trading Concepts" course! This exciting journey is meticulously crafted to elevate your comprehension of the complex realm of oil trading and empower you to cultivate advanced skills essentials to master trading skills.<br /><br /></p>
<p>Your journey with LPC will last for 5 days. It&rsquo;ll begin by understanding the basics of refining crude oil, including crude evaluation, refinery process optimization, the economics of product bending. From there, we\'ll discover the oil pricing techniques and the effect of oil logistics on the price. Then, we&rsquo;ll discuss hedging principles and strategies for risk management. Also, we&rsquo;ll go through the world of crude oil markets as we&rsquo;ll discover the structure of these markets, forward curves and financial models for price behavior. Finally, you&rsquo;ll learn advanced trading strategies as well as trading ethics and compliance in oil markets.<br /><br /></p>
<p>Join LPC in this enriching journey and transform your understanding of oil refining and trading. Sign up today and take control of your future in the oil industry!</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong>The Basics of Refining Essentials</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Discussing techniques to evaluate different crude oil:</li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle;\\">\\n<li>Linear programming (LP) models</li>\\n<li>Netback calculations</li>\\n<li>Marginal value</li>\\n<li>Transportation and other logistic considerations</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Analyzing factors affect crude oil quality and the grade of crude differentials</li>\\n<li>Discussing the yields of crude oil for different refinery configurations<br /><br /></li>\\n<li>Understanding how to optimize refinery processes by understanding:</li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle;\\">\\n<li>Feedstock impact</li>\\n<li>Unit configuration</li>\\n<li>Operating conditions</li>\\n<li>Discussing the economics of product blending:</li>\\n<li>Quality and valuation of different blendstocks</li>\\n<li>Product value evaluation</li>\\n<li>Linear/ non-linear blending calculations</li>\\n<li>Quality giveaway minimization</li>\\n<li>Biofuels blending implications</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding the meaning of arbitrage trading and analyze its opportunities</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Oil Pricing Methods &amp; Logistics</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Exploring different methods and formulas to price spot and term contracts:</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle;\\">\\n<li>OSPs and tenders</li>\\n<li>Discounts, premiums and quality escalators</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Identifying price information sources:</li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle;\\">\\n<li>Key information sources in different markets</li>\\n<li>Reporting techniques (Platts e-window process)</li>\\n<li>Illiquid market assessment (Dated Brent)</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Strategies to assess illiquid markets</li>\\n<li>Understanding freight costs, shipping economics, and chartering considerations</li>\\n<li>Identifying key areas of delay and its effect</li>\\n<li>Exploring types of storage, including contract terms, costs, and implications of holding inventory</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Hedging Principles &amp; Risk Management</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding the purpose of short-term and strategic hedges and how to hedging for future</li>\\n<li>Identifying price exposure and timing critical hedging decisions</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Exploring techniques to manage basis risks:</li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle;\\">\\n<li>Swaps</li>\\n<li>EFPs</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding Delta hedging technique</li>\\n<li>Understanding the significance of hedging the refinery and how to set its objectives, choices and plan</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Exploring techniques to measure and control trading exposure:</li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle;\\">\\n<li>Value at risk (VAR)</li>\\n<li>Credit control</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Crude Oil Markets</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding crude forward markets and its implications</li>\\n<li>Understanding OTC derivative markets, including their instruments, indices, and settlement rules</li>\\n<li>Identifying the meaning of contango and backwardation and their causes</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Discussing the effect of contango and backwardation on trading behavior:</li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle;\\">\\n<li>Inventory management</li>\\n<li>Hedging</li>\\n<li>Storage play opportunities</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Exploring different types of financial modelling of oil price behavior</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Advanced Trading Strategies &amp; Regulations</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding future exchange and trading platforms</li>\\n<li>Discussing contract and transaction rules in future trading<br /><br /></li>\\n<li>Discussing advanced oil trading techniques:</li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle;\\">\\n<li>Monetization of physical flexibility</li>\\n<li>Dealing and origination</li>\\n<li>Algorithmics and high-frequency trading</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Recognizing constraints on trading activities:</li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle;\\">\\n<li>Government regulations</li>\\n<li>Corporate policies</li>\\n<li>Position and market risk limits</li>\\n<li>Credit and counterparty constraints</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Discussing the key ethical behaviors in oil trading</li>\\n<li>Understanding how to maintain regulation compliance of oil trading</li>\\n</ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 17,
                'online' => 1,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:53:26',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:53:26',
            ),
