            261 => 
            array (
                'id' => 2107,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Benchmarking: Comparing Your Performance with the Best',
                'description' => '<p>In a competitive market landscape, benchmarking is an important tool for measuring and comparing business practices with other competitors.&nbsp; With benchmarking, businesses will be able to adapt, grow, and gain a competitive edge. Businesses use benchmarking methodology to understand when and how they should implement changes to their practices in order to improve and enhance performance.<br /><br /></p>
<p>This comprehensive 5-days learning journey is crafted by LPC to equip you with skills and knowledge to adopt and implement benchmarking practices at your organization.<br /><br /></p>
<p>Throughout this course, you&rsquo;ll understand the importance of measuring performance and benchmarking in improving practices and activities. You&rsquo;ll also explore various types of benchmarking, including performance, strategic, and process benchmarking, and distinguish between internal and external benchmarking. Moreover, you&rsquo;ll learn how to conduct, implement, and manage benchmarking projects. This course also equips you with tools and techniques to collect and analyze benchmarking data, as well as strategies for ensuring continuous improvement.</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Performance Measurement</strong> <br /><br /></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Defining performance measurement</li>\\n<li>Identifying the need for performance measurement</li>\\n<li>The application of performance measurement within organizations</li>\\n<li>Discussing the historical evolution of measurement</li>\\n<li>Understanding Key Performance indicators (KPIs) and their role in measurement</li>\\n<li>Discussing how to measure the right things</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Benchmarking Process<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Defining benchmarking and its key related terms</li>\\n<li>Explaining the history of benchmarking</li>\\n<li>Types of benchmarking:<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Strategic benchmarking</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Performance benchmarking</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Process benchmarking<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Distinguishing between internal and external benchmarking</li>\\n<li>Exploring benchmarking approaches and selecting the best</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Benchmarking Project<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Discussing how to select a suitable benchmarking project</li>\\n<li>Strategies for executing a successful benchmarking project</li>\\n<li>Exploring the stages of benchmarking</li>\\n<li>Techniques for selecting and identifying metrics and partners</li>\\n<li>Methods for managing benchmarking project</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Data &amp; Analysis Tools<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding how to use data constructively</li>\\n<li>Overview of statistical terms and techniques</li>\\n<li>Exploring the importance of standard deviation and variance for benchmarking</li>\\n<li>Analysis techniques:<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; The CATWODE technique</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; RCA technique</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 5-Whys technique</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Cause &amp; Effect technique<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Methods for collecting and analyzing benchmarking information</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Benchmarking Continuous Improvement Tools<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Discussing the importance of continuous improvement in benchmarking</li>\\n<li>Understanding Kaizen elements for continuous improvement</li>\\n<li>Exploring Six Sigma methodology for improving processes, focusing on DMAIC strategy</li>\\n<li>Utilizing Poka-Yoke approaches to prevent errors</li>\\n<li>Discussing ethical and legal considerations in benchmarking</li>\\n<li>Open door discussion</li>\\n<li>Course review and recap</li>\\n<li>Course evaluation and feedback</li>\\n</ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 9,
                'online' => 1,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:53:29',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:53:29',
            ),
