</li>\\n<li>Techniques for leading people using OKRs</li>\\n<li>Discussing how company OKRs are used and adopted by different departments</li>\\n<li>Discussing how to OKRs and SCRUM can be combined in job environment</li>\\n<li>Exploring the role of OKRs in managing performance</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>OKRs Tools &amp; Measurement<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Techniques for measuring OKRs</li>\\n<li>Understanding how and when to update OKRs</li>\\n<li>Exploring common mistakes in writing OKRs:<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;OKRs is not BAU</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;OKRs vs. KPIs</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Sandbagging<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Exploring OKRs tools and software</li>\\n<li>Discussing the implementation of OKRs in daily tasks</li>\\n<li>Final project: develop final draft of OKRs</li>\\n<li>Presentation and feedback</li>\\n<li>Recap and course evaluation&nbsp;</li>\\n</ul>"]',
