                'id' => 2115,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Stakeholder Management & Relationship Building',
                'description' => '<p>Either internal or external, stakeholders keep the business running. They influence the direction of a company and its results negatively or positively. Like any relationship, companies must frequently interact with their customers to listen to their concerns and understand them better in order to improve their performance. Nonetheless, managing a network of stakeholders needs strategic implementation as well as certain skills for bettering these relationships.<br /><br /></p>
<p>Firstly, you need to recognize what your stakeholders need and expect so that you can manage them properly. Then, determine how best to maintain good communication channels with them without compromising the quality of output. For this purpose, it is important to possess some knowledge and skills which will be covered in an interesting 5-day course.<br /><br /></p>
<p>Over the stakeholder management &amp; relationship building course, we shall study stakeholder engagement basics &amp; effective stakeholder management strategies in depth; hence learning more about tactics for nurturing a positive relationship with your publics. This course will develop your negotiation, influencing, communication abilities, emotional intelligence as well as time management skills.</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
                'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Fundamentals of Stakeholder Engagement<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Defining stakeholder engagement</li>\\n<li>Discussing the importance of stakeholder management</li>\\n<li>Exploring skills and competencies required for stakeholder management</li>\\n<li>Discussing the importance of collaboration and teamwork for stakeholder management</li>\\n<li>Methods for recognizing and evaluating stakeholder requirements.</li>\\n<li>Tips for handling challenging and difficult stakeholders</li>\\n<li>Understanding stakeholder prioritization</li>\\n<li>Discussing how to manage stakeholder expectations</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Relationships Building<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Identifying the role of strong stakeholders&rsquo; relations for success</li>\\n<li>Discussing techniques for building and managing key relationships within stakeholder group</li>\\n<li>Techniques for qualifying and managing key influencers</li>\\n<li>Defining relationship matrix and discussing how to create it</li>\\n<li>Approaches for developing new contacts</li>\\n<li>The importance of developing an advocate at each client site</li>\\n<li>Case studies about successful relationship building strategies</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Influencing Strategy<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Overview of influence principles</li>\\n<li>Techniques for aligning business approach with stakeholder needs and expectation</li>\\n<li>Strategies for communication with C-level stakeholders</li>\\n<li>Discussing how to identify and develop opportunities within groups</li>\\n<li>Techniques for personalizing value messages</li>\\n<li>Discovering influencing tools and methods</li>\\n<li>Role play: implementing influencing techniques to persuading others</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Emotional Intelligence for Communication &amp; Negotiation<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Identifying the importance of emotional intelligence for effective communication with stakeholders</li>\\n<li>Discussing how to utilize emotional intelligence skills to manage emotions and relationships</li>\\n<li>Discussing how to integrate emotional intelligence into persuading and influencing strategies</li>\\n<li>Utilizing collaborative and coordinated skills to achieve commitment and consistency</li>\\n<li>Discovering how to find a middle point between compromise and concession</li>\\n<li>Understanding the outcomes of negotiation:<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Wine to win</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Wine to lose<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding how to build a rapport with stakeholders</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Teamwork &amp; Time Management for Relationship Building~<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>The importance of collaboration with internal and external stakeholders</li>\\n<li>Techniques for effective virtual team management</li>\\n<li>Time management strategies</li>\\n<li>Discussing how to set clear objectives and goals for stakeholder relationship building</li>\\n<li>Exploring the difficulties of overseeing stakeholders and establishing connections</li>\\n<li>Exploring best practices of stakeholder management and relationship building</li>\\n<li>Review and recap</li>\\n<li>Q&amp;A session</li>\\n<li>Course evaluation</li>\\n</ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 41,
                'online' => 1,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:53:31',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:53:31',
