 /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Discussing the elements and characteristics of large-scale organizational transformation<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle;\\">\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Assumptions</li>\\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Management in uncertain and volatile conditions<br /><br /></li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Analyzing the opportunities and challenges of organizational transformation</li>\\n<li>Understanding the meaning of positive politics and its significance in growth and change programs</li>\\n<li>Discussing how to assess political prospects</li>\\n<li>Exploring real world examples of organizational transformation</li>\\n</ul>","<p><strong>Network &amp; Strategy<br /><br /></strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understanding how modern strategy operates within network ecosystems</li>\\n<li>Understanding complementary relationships and its significance in creating values</li>\\n<li>Discussing the effects of network and its limitation</li>\\n<li>Exploring the two sides of markets</li>\\n<li>Identifying the role of platform strategies in combining the two sides of a market</li>\\n<li>Differentiating between product business and platforms in term of interactions control</li>\\n<li>Discussing the impact of digital revolution on competition and value positioning</li>\\n<li>Discovering how to build a digital strategy for businesses</li>\\n<li>Lesson learnt and course review</li>\\n</ul>"]',
