                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong style=\\"color: black;\\">Introduction to High Impact Leadership </strong></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">&nbsp;</span></p><ul><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Introduction to High Impact Leadership: definition and significance </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring the key characteristics and behavior of High Impact Leaders</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Comparing between traditional and impact leadership </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing the roles and responsibilities of leaders in driving organizational success </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring leadership styles and their characteristics </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding leadership theories </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exercise: self-evaluation of leadership style and setting leadership goals&nbsp;</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: black;\\">Leading with Vision</strong></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">&nbsp;</span></p><ul><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understand the nature and characteristics of a high-performance organization </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Strategies for developing organizational vision and setting goals </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Strategies for aligning team’s goals with organizational vision </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understand strategic thinking skills and its significance in decision making </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring decision-making frameworks and tools</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Strategies for managing risk and uncertainty </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Developing leadership plan to achieve strategic goals&nbsp;</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: black;\\">Building High-Performance Team </strong></p><p><strong style=\\"color: black;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring the characteristics of a high-performance team </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Strategies for building a high-performance team for a high-performance organization </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing the importance of a positive culture within organizations and how create such one </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Techniques for ensuring diversity and inclusivity in workplace </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Techniques for managing, motiving and evaluating teams</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing conflicts in workplace and strategies for managing them&nbsp;</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: black;\\">High Impact Leaders Skills</strong></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">&nbsp;</span></p><ul><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Overview of High Impact Leadership set of skills </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring effective communication techniques and styles </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">The impact of empathy and effective communication in motiving others </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Techniques for handling difficult conversation </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing the role of emotional intelligence skills in high impact leadership </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Techniques for building personal brand to influence others</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring influencing methods and strategies </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Techniques for effective negotiation and persuasion</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: black;\\">Change Management &amp; Ethical Leadership</strong></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">&nbsp;</span></p><ul><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Defining change management&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Strategies for leading and managing changes in the organization</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing the importance of overcoming resistance to change </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding the importance of ethics and ethical behaviors in leadership </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing the future of leadership </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring High Impact Leadership best practices </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Lesson learned and discussions</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Course evaluation&nbsp;</span></li></ul>"]',
