            279 => 
            array (
                'id' => 2125,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'The Path to Photography',
            'description' => '<p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">These days, thousands of photos are taken every day, and photography is becoming an essential part of our lives. Photos are used to tell stories, document special moments, and communicate ideas and emotions. Recognizing the power of visual elements, we have prepared an interesting course on Photography to provide participants with tools and skills to master visual storytelling and cultivate exceptional visual aesthetics.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">Photographers should possess a set of skills alongside creativity to capture unique, exceptional, and memorable photos. Their photography journey began with understanding the camera\'s functions and learning to control it. Then, they focus on the aesthetic aspect of photography to show creativity and beauty. Utilizing software tools such as Adobe Photoshop will help photographers edit, retouch, and enhance photos. This course will cover all these aspects and give you the chance to practice different types of photography and present them for feedback.</span></p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong style=\\"color: black;\\">Introduction to Photography</strong></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">&nbsp;</span></p><ul><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Defining photography and its significance in today’s world </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discovering the historical evaluation of photography</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring types of photography:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Portrait photography</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Product photography</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Photo journalism </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Landscape photography</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring of camera basic settings and controls </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Activity: watching various photo types and analyzing them</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: black;\\">Photography Technical Setting</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li>Understanding Image size: High resolution vs. low resolution</li><li>Discussing the function of aperture, shutter speed and ISO</li><li>Exploring exposure compensation</li><li>Understanding the function of flash</li><li>Exploring focus, framing and position techniques</li><li>Comparing between natural and artificial lighting</li><li>Activity: practicing using camera</li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: black;\\">Photography Aesthetic Principles</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li>Understanding composition and framing</li><li>Composition techniques:</li></ul><p>﻿</p><ol><li>Leading lines</li><li>Rule of thirds</li><li>Symmetry</li><li>Juxtaposition</li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li>Exploring lighting techniques</li><li>Discussing how to ensure contrast in images</li><li>&nbsp;Understanding the Gestalt theory principles&nbsp;</li><li>Understand the golden ration</li><li>Activity: practicing taking photos based on aesthetic principles&nbsp;</li></ul><p><br></p>","<p><strong style=\\"color: black;\\">Adobe Photoshop</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li>Discussing the functions of Adobe Photoshop</li><li>Navigating Adobe Photoshop interface</li><li>Utilizing Adobe Photoshop to edit and retouching photos</li><li>Utilizing Adobe Photoshop to correct and enhance colors</li><li>Exploring how to manipulate and composite images in Adobe Photoshop</li><li>Discovering filters and effects in Adobe Photoshop</li><li>Understanding how to use selection and masks functions</li><li>Activity: editing photos using Adobe Photoshop</li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: black;\\">Photography Best Practices&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li>Discussing common mistakes in photography</li><li>Exploring the characteristics of a sound photo</li><li>Discussing how to use photography for storytelling</li><li>Techniques for photo session planning</li><li>Exploring how to select the best camera and lenses</li><li>Final Project on telling stories through photography</li><li>Lesson learned and recap</li><li>Course evaluation</li></ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 14,
                'online' => 1,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:53:34',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:53:34',
            ),
