                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Professional Certificate in Ship Sale & Purchase',
            'description' => '<p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">The Certificate in Ship Sale &amp; Purchase Training Course offers a comprehensive and intensive 10-day programme, designed to impart a thorough understanding of the ship sale and purchase process. Participants will acquire essential skills and knowledge to navigate the complexities of buying and selling ships, ensuring seamless transactions.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">The course covers critical areas such as ship types, maritime geography, financial and organisational processes, market analysis, negotiation techniques, valuation methods, financing options, insurance, and legal aspects.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">It also delves into tax implications, certification requirements, and the role of resale certificates in ship transactions. By learning from industry experts, participants will enhance their proficiency in ship sales, develop networking opportunities with international shipping peers, and gain the ability to anticipate and manage potential challenges.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">This maritime training course equips maritime professionals with the practical skills and strategic insights needed to optimise the ship sale and purchase process, ensuring effective management and operational excellence.</span></p>',
                'duration' => '10',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Fundamentals of Ship Sale and Purchase</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Overview of the maritime industry and its key stakeholders</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Significance of ship sales and purchases within the maritime sector</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Tax considerations and exemption certificates in ship transactions</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\\">Ship Types and Classification Systems</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Characteristics of various ship types</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Role and Importance of Classification Societies</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\\">Market Trends and Key Stakeholders</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Current market trends in ship sales</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Identifying key players and intermediaries in ship transactions</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\\">Legal Contracts and Agreements</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">International regulations and conventions governing ship sales</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Essential contracts such as the Memorandum of Agreement and Sale and Purchase Agreement</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Tax implications and the significance of resale certificates</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\\">Ship Valuation Techniques</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Approaches to ship valuation and influencing factors</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Determining purchase prices in ship sales</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\\">Comprehensive Due Diligence</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Importance of due diligence in ship transactions</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Technical and legal aspects of the due diligence process</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Required documentation and investigation procedures</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\\">Financing and Insurance Options</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Options for financing ship acquisitions</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Managing risks through marine insurance</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Tax considerations in ship financing and insurance</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\\">Effective Negotiation and Documentation</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Strategies for successful negotiation in ship sales</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Preparing and reviewing essential documentation</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Detailed exploration of ship sale agreements</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\\">Ownership Transfer and Registration</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Procedures for transferring ship ownership and registration</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Considerations for flagging and the importance of the certificate of registry</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\\">Resolving Disputes in Ship Sales</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Methods for resolving disputes in ship transactions</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Role of arbitration and other legal processes</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Tax implications during dispute resolution</span></li></ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 53,
                'online' => 1,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:53:36',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:53:36',
            ),
