                'name' => 'AI in Insurance: Predicting Customer Churn',
            'description' => '<p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">AI in Insurance holds profound importance in revolutionising industry practices, elevating operational efficiencies, and refining customer interactions. By leveraging AI, insurers gain unprecedented capabilities to predict and manage customer behaviours such as churn. This predictive power enables proactive retention strategies, ensuring customer satisfaction and loyalty.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">AI in Insurance: Predicting Customer Churn training course designed to equip insurance professionals with essential AI tools and strategies. This course focuses on leveraging AI to predict and mitigate customer churn, a critical factor in enhancing business sustainability and customer retention.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">Participants will gain insights into the application of AI technologies such as machine learning and deep learning specifically tailored for insurance operations. Practical sessions include data handling, exploratory data analysis (EDA), and building predictive models to effectively manage churn risk. By the course\'s end, participants will possess practical skills to implement AI-driven solutions that drive operational efficiency and improve customer satisfaction in insurance contexts.</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>',
                'duration' => '5',
