            295 => 
            array (
                'id' => 2141,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'OECD: Economic and Legal Structure',
            'description' => '<p>The Organization for Economic Co-operation and Development (OECD) has been dedicated to improving lives by refining and enhancing policies for many decades. The OECD\'s unique strategy to influence countries\' policies involves analyzing data, gathering evidence, and coming up with effective solutions that impact economic, social, and environmental situations across many countries.</p><p><br></p><p>As the OECD plays a critical role in shaping global economics and social policies, LPC has designed this course to provide you with a thorough understanding of OECD policies and frameworks through interactive discussions and real-world case studies.</p><p><br></p><p>Over 5 days with LPC, you’ll explore the purpose, historical evolution, structure, and functions of the OECD. Then, you’ll dive deeper into economic and social policy areas covered by the OECD, discussing the role of the OECD in reforming policies and the impact of its recommendations. As we progress, you’ll gain a better understanding of OECD legal instruments, standards, and frameworks. Lastly, we’ll go through the challenges of implementing OECD legal standards and discuss methods to overcome these challenges.&nbsp;</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
                'days_content' => '["<p><strong>Introduction to OECD</strong></p><p><strong>﻿</strong></p><ul><li>What is OECD?</li><li>Discussing the historical evolution of OECD</li><li>Understanding the objectives of OEDC</li><li>Exploring the structure of OECD</li><li>Discussing the functions of OECD</li><li>Overview of OECD’s legal framework and its importance&nbsp;</li></ul>","<p><strong>Economic Policy Area</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li>Discussing the role of OECD in reforming economic policy</li><li>Exploring key areas of work in economic policy</li><li>Discussing OECD analysis and recommendations on fiscal policy</li><li>Discussing OECD analysis and recommendations on monetary policy</li><li>Understanding the legal aspects of economic policies and regulations</li><li>Discovering contracts and policies related to economic policy</li><li>Overview of OECD key publications and indicators</li><li>Case Study: the impact of OECD recommendation on member countries’ legal systems&nbsp;</li></ul>","<p><strong>Social Policy Area</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li>Discussing the role of OECD in reforming social policy</li><li>Exploring key areas of work in social policy</li><li>Discovering OECD social policy initiatives</li><li>Overview of OECD key social indicators</li><li>Understanding the legal aspects of social policies and regulations</li><li>Discovering contracts and policies related to social policy</li><li>Discussing OECD methodology in analyzing social policies</li><li>Case Study: the impact of OECD recommendation on member countries’ legal systems</li></ul>","<p><strong>OECD Legal Frameworks</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li>Exploring the legal structure of OECD</li><li>Exploring types of OECD legal instruments</li><li>Discussing the OECD-standard-setting process</li><li>Understanding OECD anti-bribery convention</li><li>Exploring the key points of OECD conventional on mutual administrative assistance in tax matters</li><li>Discussing the OECD data privacy framework</li><li>Exploring OECD frameworks for international trade law</li><li>Case study: OECD legal standards</li></ul>","<p><strong>Challenges &amp; Opportunities</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li>The challenges of implementing OECD legal standards at national levels</li><li>Strategies for improving the implementation of OECD legal standards</li><li>Discussing the future role of OECD in addressing and solving emerging challenges</li><li>Case study: successful and unsuccessful implementation of OECD legal standards</li><li>Course review and recap</li><li>Q&amp;A and open discussion&nbsp;</li></ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 18,
                'online' => 1,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:53:39',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:53:39',
            ),
            296 => 
