sing the OECD data privacy framework</li><li>Exploring OECD frameworks for international trade law</li><li>Case study: OECD legal standards</li></ul>","<p><strong>Challenges &amp; Opportunities</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li>The challenges of implementing OECD legal standards at national levels</li><li>Strategies for improving the implementation of OECD legal standards</li><li>Discussing the future role of OECD in addressing and solving emerging challenges</li><li>Case study: successful and unsuccessful implementation of OECD legal standards</li><li>Course review and recap</li><li>Q&amp;A and open discussion&nbsp;</li></ul>"]',
