            298 => 
            array (
                'id' => 2144,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Social Security and Risk Management',
            'description' => '<p class="ql-align-justify"><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">Social security systems are crucial for providing a safety net that supports individuals and families, especially during times of crisis. According to the World Bank, comprehensive social protection systems help poor and vulnerable populations cope with crises, secure jobs, invest in health and education, and support the aging population, playing a significant role in reducing poverty and promoting economic stability.&nbsp;</span></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><br></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">Effective risk management is crucial for maintaining the stability and reliability of social security systems. Proper risk management ensures that these systems can withstand financial pressures, demographic changes, and other uncertainties, protecting both beneficiaries and the overall economic environment. This advanced course will equip you with the knowledge and skills to manage complex social security systems and effectively mitigate associated risks.</span></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><br></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">Throughout this course, you will explore the evolution, standards, and impacts of social security, gain insights into barriers and challenges, and learn strategies for extending coverage and financing these systems. Additionally, the course covers risk management techniques, effective management practices, and the role of actuarial reports in identifying and mitigating risks.</span></p>',
                'duration' => '10',
            'days_content' => '["<p class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Introduction to Social Security</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Introduction to the concept of social security and its significance&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the evolution of social security&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring types of social security benefits:</span></li></ul><p class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><br></p><ul><li class=\\"ql-align-justify ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\"> Retirement benefits</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Disability benefits&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Spousal benefits&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Survivor benefits</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Medical benefits</span></li></ul><p class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><br></p><ul><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Eligibility requirements for social security benefits&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Case study: Analyzing examples of social security systems and highlighting its main features and challenges</span></li></ul>","<p class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Standards and Regulations for Social Security&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring international social security standards and regulations&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Analyzing international social security laws&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the best practices in social security&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Analyzing social security data from different counties to measure their performance against international standards&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the impact of global trends on social protection</span></li></ul>","<p class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">The Impact of Social Security</strong></p><p class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><br></p><ul><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the impact of different social securities programs on individual, household, and society levels</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Differentiating between short-term impact and long-term impact&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Case studies about the impact of social security&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Methods for assessing the impact of social security programs&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing alternatives to social security</span></li></ul>","<p class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Barriers to Social Security&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Identifying the impact of social security absence&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing challenges of current pension systems&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the universal health coverage and barriers to achieve it&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing how targeting in social programs is challenging&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Assessing methods used for targeting</span></li></ul>","<p class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Extension of Social Security Coverage&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the significance of extending social security coverage</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the challenges of extending social securities to the information sector&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Strategies for the extension of coverage&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Steps for developing an evidence-based extension coverage strategy&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the importance of stakeholder engagement in formulating coverage strategy&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Case studies about successful strategies for extension social security coverage</span></li></ul>","<p class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Financing Social Security</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing how social security system is funded:</span></li></ul><p class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><br></p><ul><li class=\\"ql-align-justify ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Taxation</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Trust funds</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Trust fund investments</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Pay-as-you-go financing&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Daily funding operations&nbsp;</span></li></ul><p class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><br></p><ul><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the parameters of financing systems</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding fiscal space and its significance in financing social security</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring methods for identifying and analyzing fiscal space&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Utilizing actuarial planning to assess and manage financial risks</span></li></ul>","<p class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Risk Management in Social Security</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Risk categories in social security systems:</span></li></ul><p class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><br></p><ul><li class=\\"ql-align-justify ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Financial risks</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Insurance and demographic risks</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Strategic risk</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Operational risks</span></li></ul><p class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><br></p><ul><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the enterprise risk management (ERM) approach and its role in managing social security systems risk</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring the process of risk management:</span></li></ul><p class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><br></p><ul><li class=\\"ql-align-justify ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Strategic planning&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Risk identification and analysis</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Risk measurement&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Risk control &amp; treatment&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Risk monitoring &amp; reporting&nbsp;</span></li></ul><p class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><br></p><ul><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding how to strategically plan for risk management</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing how to identify risk in social security systems</span></li></ul>","<p class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Effective Management of Social Security&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the management structure in social security institutes&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring good governance practices for social security&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Developing communication and coordination strategies for effective management&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Monitoring and evaluation process for measuring the performance social programs&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Strategies for capacity development&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Case studies about effective social security management</span></li></ul>","<p class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Actuarial Reports in Social Security</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Defining actuarial report and understanding its purpose&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring the elements of actuarial report&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the significance of actuarial reports in identifying social security risks&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the statistical methods used for actuarial reporting&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing challenges in using actuarial reports&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-align-justify\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Activity: Develop an actuarial report</span></li></ul>","<p><strong>Continuous Improvement</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li>Understanding the political acceptability of social security&nbsp;</li><li>Identifying the benefits of political acceptability&nbsp;</li><li>The importance of social dialogue for social security reforms and policies&nbsp;</li><li>Discussing the influence of political economy in social security&nbsp;</li><li>Lesson learned and best practices</li><li>Course evaluation and feedback</li></ul>"]',
