hnologies.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">IT solutions aimed at boosting port safety and efficiency.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Approaches to implementing sustainable and automated terminal solutions.</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Advanced Terminal Management</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Management tactics for running a successful container terminal.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Examination of commercial and financial aspects crucial to terminal operations.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Financial analysis workshop focusing on evaluating terminal profitability.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Simulation exercise on negotiating terminal services contracts.</span></li></ul>"]',
