enue maximization and cost minimization.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Hands-on budgeting and financial planning exercises.</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Maritime Legal Aspects</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Overview of the legal environment in the maritime industry.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Examination of bills of lading, charter parties, and maritime regulations.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Insights into maritime insurance and claims handling.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Legal negotiation and dispute resolution simulations.</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Ports and Logistics Management</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Operational strategies for managing container ports.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Challenges and opportunities in port development.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Marketing and economic strategies for ports.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Integration of modern technologies in port management.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Simulation exercises focused on port operations and logistics management.</span></li></ul>"]',
