            319 => 
            array (
                'id' => 2165,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'ESG Fundamentals Certification',
            'description' => '<p>As the corporate world increasingly prioritizes sustainability, mastering environmental, social, and governance (ESG) principles is becoming crucial for businesses aiming to achieve long-term success. The "ESG Fundamentals Certification" course provides a thorough foundation in ESG concepts, offering participants the skills and knowledge to incorporate ESG factors into their business and investment strategies.</p><p><br></p><p>Over five comprehensive days, this course will cover the key aspects of ESG investing, from understanding its significance to exploring the environmental, social, and governance factors that drive it. Participants will engage in interactive sessions, case studies, and practical exercises designed to enhance their ability to analyze, manage, and report on ESG risks and opportunities. The course will also examine the growing ESG market, different types of ESG investing, and the integration of ESG into traditional financial and investment analysis.</p><p><br></p><p>By the end of the course, attendees will be well-equipped to enhance their organization\'s ESG practices, contributing to sustainable and responsible business operations.</p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong>ESG Factors</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(32, 37, 41);\\">Understanding the meaning of ESG investing and its significance in today’s investment landscape</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(32, 37, 41);\\">Exploring key environmental factors, and how business activities impact these factors</span></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ol><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(32, 37, 41);\\"> Climate change</span>44</li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(32, 37, 41);\\"> Air and water pollution</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(32, 37, 41);\\"> Biodiversity</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(32, 37, 41);\\"> Deforestation</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(32, 37, 41);\\"> Energy efficiency</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(32, 37, 41);\\"> Waste management</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(32, 37, 41);\\"> Water scarcity</span></li></ol><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(32, 37, 41);\\">Exploring key social factors, and how business activities impact these factors</span></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ol><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(32, 37, 41);\\"> Customer satisfaction</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(32, 37, 41);\\"> Data protection and privacy</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(32, 37, 41);\\"> Gender and diversity</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(32, 37, 41);\\"> Employee engagement</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(32, 37, 41);\\"> Community relations</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(32, 37, 41);\\"> Human rights</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(32, 37, 41);\\"> Labor standards</span></li></ol><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(32, 37, 41);\\">Exploring key governance factors, and how they affect business decisions</span></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ol><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(32, 37, 41);\\"> Board composition</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(32, 37, 41);\\"> Audit committee structure</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(32, 37, 41);\\"> Bribery and corruption</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(32, 37, 41);\\"> Executive compensation</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(32, 37, 41);\\"> Lobbying</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(32, 37, 41);\\"> Political contributions</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(32, 37, 41);\\"> Whistleblower schemes</span></li></ol><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(32, 37, 41);\\"> </span></p><ul><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(32, 37, 41);\\">Examining the potential risks and consequences for businesses that fail to address ESC issues</span></li></ul>","<p><strong>ESG Market &amp; Engagement</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li>Analyzing the current size and rapid growth of the ESG market</li><li>Discussing what drives increasing interest in ESG investing</li><li>Assessing the impact of ESG investment on industry and company performance</li><li>Identifying challenges associated with conducting ESG analysis across different regions and cultural contexts</li><li>Differentiating between different types of ESG investing:</li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Exclusion-based investing</li><li>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Integration-based investing</li><li>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Engagement-based investing</li><li>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Impact-based investing</li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li>Understanding the importance of stewardship and engagement to the investment community</li></ul>","<p><strong>ESG Analysis &amp; Validation</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li>Comparing traditional investment analysis methods with ESG-focused approaches</li><li>Determining the relationship between ESG analysis and investment decision making</li><li>Methods for integrating ESG analysis into financial analysis</li><li>Comprehending the significance and challenges of identifying and evaluating ESG factors</li><li>Utilizing materiality maps and ESG scorecards to assess ESG issues materials</li><li>Understanding how ESG enha</li></ul>","<p><strong>Integrating ESG into Investment Analysis</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li>Discussing the purpose of integrating ESG into investment analysis</li><li>Methods of integrating ESG into investment analysis</li><li>Applying ESG analysis and integration into a range of asset classes</li><li>Discussing the role of rating agencies in supporting ESG analysis for fixed-income investments</li><li>Challenges of integrating ESG into investment analysis</li></ul>","<p><strong>Integrating ESG into Portfolio Management</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li>The process of integrating ESG into portfolio management</li><li>Understanding ESG screening and its impact on investment selection</li><li>Understanding passive ESG approaches and green bonds principles</li><li>Discussing factors that influence the selection of ESG investing strategy and what features clients are seeking</li><li>Clarifying the significance of mandate construction for successful ESG integration</li><li>Discussing maj</li></ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
