n decision-making processes</li></ul>","<p><strong>&nbsp;ESG Reporting &amp; Communication</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li>Understanding the importance of transparency and disclosure in reporting ESG initiatives</li><li>Discussing the best practices for clear and honest reporting on ESG initiatives</li><li>Discussing regulatory requirements for ESG disclosure</li><li>Techniques for communicating ESG efforts and achievements with stakeholders</li><li>Case studies of successful and unsuccessful ESG integration</li><li>Presentation of ESG plans and feedback</li><li>Lesson learned and course evaluation</li></ul>"]',
