            324 => 
            array (
                'id' => 2170,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Cultivating Social Intelligence',
            'description' => '<p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">Social intelligence is a vital soft skill that is employed daily across various interpersonal contexts. It enhances our capacity to discern and interpret the complex signals within our social environments and to respond to them appropriately and effectively. This nuanced skill impacts personal interactions and plays a crucial role in professional settings, influencing negotiation, leadership, and team dynamics.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">The "Cultivating Social Intelligence" course is structured to explore social intelligence in-depth, focusing on its theoretical underpinnings and practical applications. Participants will begin by understanding the fundamental aspects of social intelligence, distinguishing it from other types of intelligence, and examining its critical role in enhancing interpersonal relationships and professional success. The course offers a comprehensive look at how social intelligence operates within various spheres of life, including its significance in the workplace and its influence on one\'s social navigational abilities.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">By the end of the course, attendees will have a richer understanding of how social intelligence shapes interactions and decisions and will be better prepared to apply these insights to benefit both their personal and professional lives.</span></p><p><br></p>',
                'duration' => '5',
