: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Techniques for improving active listening</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Discussing how to ask effective questions</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Understanding the role of empathy in communication</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Discussing how to build empathy</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Relationships Building &amp; Conflict Resolution</strong></p><p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\"><span class=\\"ql-cursor\\">﻿</span></strong></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Exploring the key principles of relationship-building</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Techniques for building rapport with others</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Discussing how to maintain a sustainable relationship</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Discussing how to identify the sources of conflict</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Strategies for conflict resolution</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Identifying the benefits of networking in personal and professional</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Exploring strategies for effective networking</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Practical exercise: implementing relationship building and conflict resolution strategies</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Influence &amp; Social Intelligence in the Workplace</strong></p><p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\"><span class=\\"ql-cursor\\">﻿</span></strong></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Understanding the principles of influence and persuasion</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Exploring influencing and persuasion techniques</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Discussing the ethical considerations of influence</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Techniques for improving collaboration and teamwork in the workplace</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Strategies for managing diverse teams using social intelligence</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Role play: utilizing influencing strategies to convince others</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Lesson learned and open discussions</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Course evaluation and feedback</span></li></ul>"]',
