lor: transparent;\\">Exploring the key elements of response plan&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">The importance of communicating response plan with stakeholders and team members</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Case study: Analyzing various environmental emergency response plan</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Activity: Conducting environmental risk assessment and developing a response plan </span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Environmental Emergencies Response Strategy</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Defining incident command system and its component&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring the roles and responsibility in emergency response:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Emergency control centers (ECC)</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Emergency response teams (ERT)</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Crisis Management teams (CRT)&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Forward incident control (FIC)</span></li></ol><p><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\"><span class=\\"ql-cursor\\">﻿</span></span></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring types of personal protective equipment (PPE) used for emergency response&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Methods for training team members for emergency response&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Techniques for assessing environmental damage after an emergency&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring recovery and restoration strategies</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Activity: Practicing response strategies and communication&nbsp;</span></li></ul>"]',
