n style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring data collection and sampling techniques&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding documentation and chain of custody in environmental investigation&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Strategies for risk assessment and data analysis&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Components of environmental investigation report&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Case Study: Successful stories about conducting environmental investigation</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Regulations and Best Practices&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Identifying the role of Environmental Agency (EA) in enforcing environmental legislation&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding key environmental laws and regulations&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Overview of international environmental agreements&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing ethical considerations of environmental investigation&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">The importance of stakeholder engagement and collaboration with other agencies&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Best practices for environmental investigation&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Recap and lesson learned</span></li></ul>"]',
