            332 => 
            array (
                'id' => 2178,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
            'name' => 'Product Manager Certification (PMC)™ Training Course',
            'description' => '<p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">Product management is a cross-functional discipline that exists between business, technology, and UX design. It is concerned with launching unique products to meet market needs and deliver value to customers by guiding teams through the product lifecycle. Therefore, product managers must be strategic and have skills enabling them to manage each process tactfully.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">With LPC, you can enter the world of product management, master the art of building unique products, and successfully launch them into markets. This course is designed to provide participants with the skills and tools needed to conduct market research, ensure strategic alignment, design products, and develop a go-to-market strategy.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">The course involves numerous exercises and activities that allow participants to practice what they\'ve learned and gain practical experience.</span></p><p><br></p>',
                'duration' => '5',
