: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">          </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Customer interviews</span></li></ol>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Product Design and Requirements</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding product requirements and its components</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring the elements of the Product Requirements Document (PDR)</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Defining Minimum Viable Product (MVP)</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing how to create and develop MVP</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Utilizing Figma to create user experience</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring the elements of the product roadmap</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">The process of designing and sketching a product</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding product design patterns:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">          MVC</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">          </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Designing APIs</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Real-world examples of effective product design processes</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Go-to-Market Plan</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Defining Go-To-Market (GTM) strategy</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing the purpose and benefits of GTM</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Steps for creating a GTM strategy</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Best practices for implementing GTM strategy and launching products</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing strategies for marketing a product across different channels</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Best practices for creating compelling messages</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Case studies about the implementation of GTM strategy</span></li></ul>"]',
