            339 => 
            array (
                'id' => 2185,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'AI in e-commerce: Mastering Dynamic Pricing and Market Analysis',
            'description' => '<p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">Artificial intelligence (AI) is fundamentally reshaping the landscape of e-commerce by enabling businesses to employ dynamic pricing strategies and conduct in-depth market analysis. These advancements allow companies to leverage machine learning models for predicting consumer behaviour and optimizing sales processes. AI enhances the ability to personalize marketing efforts and improve customer engagement through data-driven insights.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">The AI in e-commerce training course delves into these transformative technologies, providing participants with a robust understanding of AI tools and their applications in the online retail sector. Over five days, participants will engage with Python for data handling, explore predictive analytics, and develop skills in machine learning and deep learning.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">The curriculum emphasizes practical experience with AI solutions, covering topics such as recommendation systems and sentiment analysis through Natural Language Processing (NLP). Participants will learn strategies for deploying AI in e-commerce environments, addressing both opportunities and challenges and ensuring the ethical use of AI technologies. This course equips attendees with the expertise to navigate and lead AI innovations in the digital marketplace.</span></p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Introduction to AI in eCommerce</strong></p><p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Overview of AI\'s impact and capabilities in eCommerce.</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Exploration of AI applications for dynamic pricing and consumer analytics.</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Introduction to AI tools and technologies relevant to eCommerce.</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Discussion on challenges and opportunities in AI adoption for online retailers.</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Review of case studies showcasing successful AI implementations in eCommerce.</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Data Handling &amp; Predictive Analytics</strong></p><p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Basics of Python for manipulating and analyzing eCommerce data.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Techniques for exploratory data analysis (EDA) tailored to eCommerce.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Hands-on workshop using Python libraries like Pandas and NumPy.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Addressing challenges in data collection and data quality.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Best practices for maintaining data integrity and privacy.</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Machine Learning Models for eCommerce</strong></p><p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Overview of machine learning models relevant to pricing and sales forecasts.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Developing predictive models for customer behavior and sales trends.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Workshop on building and tuning regression models for price optimization.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Techniques for validating and testing model accuracy and effectiveness.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Interactive Q&amp;A on applying machine learning to real-world eCommerce problems.</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Advanced Analytics and Personalization Techniques&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Introduction to deep learning for enhancing recommendation systems.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Using NLP for customer sentiment analysis and feedback interpretation.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Workshop on creating personalized marketing campaigns using AI.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Case studies on advanced AI-driven personalization and its impact on sales.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussion on integrating AI into existing e-commerce platforms.</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Deployment &amp; Future Trends in AI for eCommerce</strong></p><p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Strategies for deploying AI solutions in eCommerce environments.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Ensuring compliance with legal standards and ethical considerations in AI use.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussion on emerging AI technologies and their potential future impact.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Presentations by participants on their projects and AI implementation plans.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Recap of key course concepts and feedback session for continuous improvement.</span></li></ul>"]',
