                'name' => 'AI in e-commerce: Mastering Dynamic Pricing and Market Analysis',
            'description' => '<p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">Artificial intelligence (AI) is fundamentally reshaping the landscape of e-commerce by enabling businesses to employ dynamic pricing strategies and conduct in-depth market analysis. These advancements allow companies to leverage machine learning models for predicting consumer behaviour and optimizing sales processes. AI enhances the ability to personalize marketing efforts and improve customer engagement through data-driven insights.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">The AI in e-commerce training course delves into these transformative technologies, providing participants with a robust understanding of AI tools and their applications in the online retail sector. Over five days, participants will engage with Python for data handling, explore predictive analytics, and develop skills in machine learning and deep learning.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">The curriculum emphasizes practical experience with AI solutions, covering topics such as recommendation systems and sentiment analysis through Natural Language Processing (NLP). Participants will learn strategies for deploying AI in e-commerce environments, addressing both opportunities and challenges and ensuring the ethical use of AI technologies. This course equips attendees with the expertise to navigate and lead AI innovations in the digital marketplace.</span></p>',
