/strong></p><p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Overview of machine learning models relevant to pricing and sales forecasts.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Developing predictive models for customer behavior and sales trends.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Workshop on building and tuning regression models for price optimization.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Techniques for validating and testing model accuracy and effectiveness.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Interactive Q&amp;A on applying machine learning to real-world eCommerce problems.</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Advanced Analytics and Personalization Techniques&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Introduction to deep learning for enhancing recommendation systems.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Using NLP for customer sentiment analysis and feedback interpretation.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Workshop on creating personalized marketing campaigns using AI.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Case studies on advanced AI-driven personalization and its impact on sales.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussion on integrating AI into existing e-commerce platforms.</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Deployment &amp; Future Trends in AI for eCommerce</strong></p><p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Strategies for deploying AI solutions in eCommerce environments.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Ensuring compliance with legal standards and ethical considerations in AI use.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussion on emerging AI technologies and their potential future impact.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Presentations by participants on their projects and AI implementation plans.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Recap of key course concepts and feedback session for continuous improvement.</span></li></ul>"]',
