style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Identifying the impact and role of AI and IoT in enhancing guest experience and facilitating hospitality operations </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring IoT applications in hospitality:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">        Energy management </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">        Water management </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">        Enhance guest experience </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">        Maintenance management </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">        Increase profitability</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Best practices for developing a secure IoT system with a hospitality establishment </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring AI applications in hospitality:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">        Chatbots and vertical assistants </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">        Personalized recommendations </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">        Predictive analytics for demand forecasting </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">        AI algorithms for resource allocation </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">        Automating operations</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Best practices for integrating AI into hospitality operations&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Case Study: Examining various application of AI and IoT in hospitality </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Activity: Identifying potential opportunities for integrating AI and IoT in your organization&nbsp;</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: black;\\">Data Protection and IT Issues</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Identifying the significance of safeguard guest information </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discovering types of guest data and reasons behind selecting them </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding major data protection regulations and considerations </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Techniques for developing data protection policies </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Best Practices for managing data risks </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring the process of data breach management</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing main issues and problems in IT implementation </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">The role of problem-solving techniques in solving IT problems </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Best practices for solving IT issues and minimizing guest impact </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Activity: Develop data policy and data breach response </span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Course evaluation and recap</span></li></ul>"]',
