                'id' => 2192,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Building AI Financial Chatbot',
            'description' => '<p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">AI chatbots are rapidly transforming the financial industry by providing efficient and personalized customer service, streamlining operations, and enhancing user engagement. These intelligent systems leverage natural language processing (NLP) and machine learning algorithms to understand and respond to customer inquiries, offering tailored financial advice and performing secure transactions. As the adoption of AI chatbots in finance grows, the demand for skilled professionals who can design and implement these systems is increasing.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">The Building AI Financial Chatbot training course equips participants with the skills and knowledge needed to develop advanced AI chatbots for the financial sector. Over five days, the course covers the fundamentals of AI chatbot architecture, including key tools and technologies, infrastructure requirements, and ethical considerations. Participants will gain hands-on experience in Python programming and machine learning, learn to design basic and advanced chatbots using frameworks like LangChain, and understand the intricacies of deploying chatbots in financial environments.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">Through interactive workshops and practical projects, attendees will acquire the expertise to create robust AI chatbots that comply with financial regulations and provide exceptional user experiences.</span></p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Introduction to AI Chatbots in Finance</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Overview of AI Chatbots: Discuss the role and growing importance of chatbots in the financial industry.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Key Tools &amp; Technologies: Introduction to Key Tools &amp; Technologies</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Infrastructure Requirements: Overview of the technical setup needed for developing AI chatbots.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Ethical and Regulatory Considerations: Understanding compliance with financial regulations and ethical AI usage.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Case Studies: Review of successful implementations of AI chatbots in finance.</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Python &amp; ML Basics</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Introduction to Python for Finance: Basics of Python programming focused on financial applications.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA): Techniques using Python to visualize and analyze financial datasets.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Python Libraries for Financial Analysis: Introduction to libraries like Pandas, NumPy, and Matplotlib.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Machine Learning: Understanding Basic ML Concepts</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussion: Best practices for data handling and analysis in finance.</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Designing a Basic Chatbot</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Components of AI Chatbots: Introduction to the Fundamentals of Chatbots</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Building Blocks of Financial Chatbots: Detailed discussion on the architecture of AI chatbots, including NLP, dialogue management, and user interaction.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG): Explaining how RAG works to enhance chatbot responses with contextual accuracy.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Workshop: Setting up the basic framework for a financial chatbot</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Advanced Chatbot Development with LangChain</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Introduction to LangChain:&nbsp; Understanding Langchain Framework to Work with LLM\'s.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">LLMs Fine-Tuning: Exploring different open-source LLM\'s like LAMA3, Falcon, and Mistral for finetuning.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Advanced Features in Chatbot Design: Adding capabilities such as sentiment analysis, personalized financial advice, and secure transactions.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Hands-On Lab: Integrating LangChain into their chatbot projects to improve conversational abilities and handle complex queries.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussion: Tackling challenges such as understanding user intent and maintaining conversational context.</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Deploying &amp; Managing Financial AI Chatbots</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Testing and Validation: Best practices for testing and validating chatbot functionalities to ensure reliability and accuracy.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Deployment Strategies: Approaches for deploying chatbots in financial environments, including scalability and security considerations.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Ethical and Compliance Considerations: Ensuring that chatbots adhere to ethical AI principles and comply with financial regulations.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Final Project Presentation: Participants present their chatbot projects, sharing insights and outcomes.</span></li></ul>"]',
