                'id' => 2198,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'AI Transformations in HR Operations',
            'description' => '<p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">The integration of artificial intelligence in human resources is reshaping how organizations approach talent management, recruitment, and employee engagement. By utilizing AI, HR professionals can automate repetitive tasks, gain deeper insights into workforce dynamics, and enhance decision-making processes. This transformation allows for a more strategic focus on developing a productive and satisfied workforce.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">The AI Transformations in HR Operations training course provides an in-depth exploration of these emerging technologies and their practical applications in HR. Over five days, participants will learn how AI can streamline recruitment processes through automated screening and assessment, improve employee development with personalized learning paths, and ensure compliance with ethical and legal standards.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">Through hands-on workshops and case studies, attendees will gain practical experience in implementing AI tools and strategies, preparing them to effectively lead digital transformations in HR operations and drive organizational success.</span></p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Introduction to AI in HR</strong></p><p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Overview of AI technologies in human resources.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Key applications of AI in recruitment, employee development, and retention.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Introduction to relevant AI tools and technologies for HR.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Challenges and opportunities in adopting AI in HR practices.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Case studies of successful AI integration in HR processes.</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Data Handling &amp; Machine Learning in HR</strong></p><p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\"><span class=\\"ql-cursor\\">﻿</span></strong></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Python programming basics for HR data analysis.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploratory data analysis techniques for HR datasets.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Hands-on workshop on using machine learning for candidate screening.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Addressing data collection and privacy challenges in HR.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing best practices for data security and ethical use.</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">AI-Driven Recruitment Processes</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Detailed overview of machine learning models for resume filtering and candidate ranking.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Building and applying natural language processing models to interpret candidate data.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Workshop on automating the screening process using AI tools.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Validation methods for ensuring the accuracy and fairness of AI recruitment tools.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Interactive Q&amp;A on overcoming practical challenges in AI-driven recruitment.</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Enhancing Candidate Assessment with AI</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Using AI for designing and implementing mock interview systems.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Advanced techniques for evaluating candidates\' responses using AI.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Workshop on setting up and using AI-driven interview platforms.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Case study discussion on the effectiveness of AI in candidate assessments.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Review of ethical considerations and bias mitigation in AI-driven assessments.</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Deployment, Compliance, and Innovations in AI for HR</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Best practices for integrating AI into existing HR systems and workflows.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Regulatory compliance and ethical considerations in deploying AI in HR.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploration of future trends and innovations in AI for HR.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Final project presentations on AI solutions developed by participants.</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Course recap and feedback session to discuss learnings and potential implementations.</span></li></ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 54,
                'online' => 0,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:54:08',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:54:08',
            ),
            353 => 
            array (
                'id' => 2199,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
            'name' => 'Environmental, Social & Governance (ESG) Expert Training',
            'description' => '<p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">As global awareness of sustainability and ethical business practices grows, Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) considerations have become crucial for organizations aiming to achieve long-term success and societal impact. Understanding and integrating ESG principles into business strategies is essential for navigating today’s complex environmental challenges, addressing social responsibilities, and ensuring robust governance frameworks.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">The Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) Expert Training course provides a comprehensive exploration of ESG fundamentals and their application in business contexts. Over five days, participants will delve into the intricacies of ESG pillars, sustainability reporting, and taxation strategies. The course offers insights into regulatory standards, including the EU taxonomy for sustainable activities, and explores the impact of taxation on sustainability efforts.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">Participants will learn to develop and implement ESG strategies, focusing on stakeholder engagement, risk management, and business transformation. Through case studies and practical exercises, attendees will gain the expertise needed to lead ESG initiatives that align with regulatory compliance and drive organizational change toward sustainability.</span></p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">The Fundamentals of ESG</strong></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">&nbsp;</span></p><ul><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding ESG and its three pillars: environment, social, and governance</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the impact, risk, and opportunities of ESG</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">The role of stakeholders in corporate ESG performance</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding climate neutrality and net zero</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the concept of Just Transition and its significance within the ESG context</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Identifying GHG disclosure regulations and standards</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring the EU taxonomy for sustainable activities</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Sustainability Reporting Strategy</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discovering global reporting regulations and standards</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the Corporate Sustainability Reporting Directive (CSRD)</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the European Sustainability Reporting Standards (ESRS)</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the requirements of the sustainability report</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the regulations and standards of disclosure</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">The process and components of the sustainability reports</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Utilizing the reporting process to identify potential opportunities</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">ESG in Taxation</strong></p><p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">﻿</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the importance of taxation in sustainability and ESG</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">The impact of green taxes and tax incentives on decarbonization, net zero journeys, and supply chain</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">The impact of the Cross-Border Adjustment Mechanism (CBAM) and the Emissions Trading System (ETS)</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the effect of main taxes on people and businesses while designing rewards and incentives</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing how to integrate tax into the ESG strategy</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">ESG Strategy &amp; Business Transformation</strong></p><p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">﻿</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">The importance of engaging stakeholders in business transformation</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the material themes of sectors and organizations</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Techniques for integrating ESG factors into business strategy</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Developing institutional ESG framework and implementing ESG strategies</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing techniques for implementing the circular economy into business operations</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Strategies for improving supply chain sustainability</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">The importance of enhancing workforce skills</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Case study about designing a roadmap for ESG strategy</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">ESG Risk Management</strong></p><p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">﻿</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Techniques for prioritizing ESG risks</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding how to conduct ESG auditing</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Steps for data collection</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing how to establish repeatable workflows</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing best practices in ESG compliance</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Recap and Q&amp;A sessions</span></li></ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 34,
                'online' => 1,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:54:08',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:54:08',
            ),
