ransparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Techniques for integrating ESG factors into business strategy</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Developing institutional ESG framework and implementing ESG strategies</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing techniques for implementing the circular economy into business operations</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Strategies for improving supply chain sustainability</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">The importance of enhancing workforce skills</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Case study about designing a roadmap for ESG strategy</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">ESG Risk Management</strong></p><p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\"><span class=\\"ql-cursor\\">﻿</span></strong></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Techniques for prioritizing ESG risks</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding how to conduct ESG auditing</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Steps for data collection</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing how to establish repeatable workflows</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing best practices in ESG compliance</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Recap and Q&amp;A sessions</span></li></ul>"]',
