            'description' => '<p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">Incorporating Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) factors into business operations is increasingly vital for companies committed to sustainable growth and ethical accountability. ESG data plays a crucial role in this transformation, providing insights that help organizations understand their impact, measure performance, and improve transparency. As businesses face increasing demands for accountability from stakeholders, effective management and analysis of ESG data become essential tools for informed decision-making and strategic planning.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">The ESG Data &amp; Accountability training course offers participants a detailed exploration of the role of data in driving ESG initiatives. Over five days, attendees will examine various types of ESG data, learn how to collect and manage this data, and understand its application in business strategies and reporting.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">This course also covers key aspects of data privacy, security, and the use of advanced technologies like AI and machine learning to enhance data management. Through practical sessions and real-world examples, participants will acquire the skills necessary to leverage ESG data for sustainable business practices and robust accountability frameworks.</span></p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Introduction to ESG Data</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Overview of ESG factors and principles</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring the types of ESG data:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">         Environmental data</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">         </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Social data</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">         </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Governance data</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">         </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Financial data</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discovering the sources of ESG data</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Characteristics of quality data</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Recognizing the impact of ESG big data on businesses</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">ESG Data Implementation</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Overview of how ESD data is used</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing the importance of ESG data in business</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding how to apply ESG data in business strategies</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing how ESG data is used in ESG rating and analyst scoring</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Utilizing ESG data in ESG reports</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">ESG Data Management</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding the process and importance of ESG data management</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring methods for collecting ESG data</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Techniques for ESG data quality assurance</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Utilizing taxonomy to structure ESG data</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">ESG data analysis methods:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">          </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Descriptive analytics</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">          </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Predictive analytics</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">          Prescriptive analytics</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Developing metrics to evaluate ESG performance</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding how to report and visualize ESG data</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Accountability, Privacy &amp; Security</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Examining the role of corporate governance in ensuring accountability</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring techniques for ensuring data privacy and security</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discovering data privacy and security international standards and frameworks</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring measures for controlling data security and privacy</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">The importance of engaging stakeholders to maintain transparency</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">ESG Data &amp; Technology</strong></p><p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\"><span class=\\"ql-cursor\\">﻿</span></strong></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing the benefits of using AI and ML for ESG data management</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding how AI and ML can improve data security and privacy</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing the benefits and challenges of using cloud computing</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring various ESG data management software</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Tools for visualizing ESG data</span></li></ul>"]',
