loring the process of conducting a materiality assessment</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Defining double materiality and understanding its benefits</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Techniques for collecting and managing ESG data</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding how to align data with ESG criteria</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Tips for ensuring accurate, reliable, and reflective ESG data&nbsp; </span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Crafting a Compelling ESG Report</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring the main components of ESG reports:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">              </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Environmental factors</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">              </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Social factors</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">              </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Governance factors</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">              </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Goals and performance</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">              </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">ESG reporting framework</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">              </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Stakeholder engagement</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">          