            'days_content' => '["<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Introduction to ESG &amp; Sustainability</strong></p><p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Defining ESG, sustainability, and key-related terms</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discovering international policy responses to global sustainability issues:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">            </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">UN sustainable development goals</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">            </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Paris Climate Agreement</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">            European green deal</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing key environmental, social, and governance issues</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding the role of stakeholders in sustainability</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Analyzing business case for sustainability</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Sustainability Strategy Development&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">The purpose and benefits of sustainability strategy</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Overview of the sustainability strategy development process</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Frameworks of sustainability strategy</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Techniques for setting sustainable goals</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Role of stakeholders in identifying ESG issues</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Utilizing materiality analysis to assess ESG issues</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Aligning sustainability to the UN suitability goals</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Sustainability Metrics &amp; Targets&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding the meaning of science-based targets</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing the characteristics of good targets:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">            Meaningful</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">            </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Material</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">            </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Complete</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">            </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Consistent</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">            </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Ambitious</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Differentiating between quantitative and qualitative targets</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing whether to be ambitious when setting targets or not</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Setting targets that align with science-based targets</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding the characteristics of good KPIs:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">            </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Accessible</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">            </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Relevant</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">            </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Responsive</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">            </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Comparable</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Steps to select suitable metrics and KPIs</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Prioritizing Initiatives &amp; ESG Reporting</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding carbon footprinting, and the scope of carbon emissions</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding the meaning of carbon offsetting</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing how to prioritize sustainability initiatives based on their impact</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring ESG reporting standards and regulations</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing sustainability and ESG tools for businesses and supply chains</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Executing Sustainability Strategy</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Techniques for developing a strategy action plan</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Techniques to engage stakeholders with the strategy</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding how senior management can be involved in implementing a sustainability strategy</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Benefits of external collaboration and partnership for sustainability strategy</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing effective sustainable leadership practices</span></li></ul>"]',
