            array (
                'id' => 2213,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Climate Change Agriculture',
            'description' => '<p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">Climate change presents one of the greatest challenges to modern agriculture, affecting food security, biodiversity, and livelihoods worldwide. Understanding its complexities and implications is essential for developing sustainable solutions. The Climate Change Agriculture training course delves into the scientific and practical aspects of how climate change impacts agriculture and explores strategies to build resilience in farming systems.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">Participants will gain a comprehensive understanding of climate change fundamentals, including the greenhouse effect and global warming, as well as their influence on agricultural ecosystems. The course will cover the principles of climate-resilient agriculture, offering insights into sustainable practices and technologies that enhance crop resilience and productivity.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">Through examining case studies and engaging in hands-on activities, attendees will learn to assess climate vulnerability, develop risk management strategies, and integrate innovative technologies into agricultural practices. Additionally, the course will explore the role of policy and urban planning in supporting sustainable agriculture, providing participants with the tools needed to design and implement adaptive strategies that mitigate climate impacts.</span></p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Introduction to Climate Change</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Definition of climate change</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Identifying the causes and impact of climate change</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding greenhouse effect (GHE) and global warming</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Trends and fluctuations of major climatic parameters</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring the impact of climate change in agriculture</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing interdisciplinary approaches to climate change</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Case studies on the impact of climate change on different agriculture regions&nbsp;</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Climate Resilient Agriculture</strong></p><p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">﻿</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Definition climate resilient agriculture (CRA) and its significance</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Principles of sustainable agriculture</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Describing the historical evolution of CRA</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Strategies for climate change adoption and mitigation in agriculture</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Techniques for assessing climate vulnerability to identify possible adoption options</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the synergies of climate change adoption and mitigation</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Challenges and barriers to climate change adoption and mitigation</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Case studies of successful implementation of CRA in different countries</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Infrastructure and Technology for Climate Resilient Agriculture</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Principles of designing resilient agriculture infrastructure</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">The role of civil engineers in constructing resilient agriculture facilities</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring engineering solutions for climate resilient agriculture:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Water management</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Irrigation systems</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Sustainable land management</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Transportation and storage facilities</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Definition and benefits of climate-smart agriculture</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Strategies for integrating climate-smart practices into agriculture systems</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Identifying the role of cross-sector collaboration in infrastructure projects</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Case study on the implementation of climate-smart agriculture practices</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Activity: Developing a resilient infrastructure plan for a given scenario</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Risk Management, Urban Planning, and Disaster Preparedness</strong></p><p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">The importance of risk management in agriculture and infrastructure</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Tools and techniques for identifying and assessing climate-related risks</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Definition and significance of urban planning</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Strategies for integrating agriculture into urban planning</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Techniques for disaster preparedness and response in agricultural contexts</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Activity: Developing risk assessment and disaster preparedness plan</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Policies and Future Trends</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Overview of international and national climate policies affecting agriculture</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Identifying the role of policies in enhancing climate resilient agriculture</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the role and applications of emerging technologies in mitigating climate change impacts</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Best practices for designing and implementing green infrastructure for sustainable agriculture</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing future trends in climate change agriculture and infrastructure</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Group Discussion: How to prepare for future challenges in climate change agriculture</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Case study on the role of emerging technology in agriculture</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Final presentation on climate resilient plan</span></li></ul>"]',
