 style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Strategies for integrating climate-smart practices into agriculture systems</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Identifying the role of cross-sector collaboration in infrastructure projects</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Case study on the implementation of climate-smart agriculture practices</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Activity: Developing a resilient infrastructure plan for a given scenario</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Risk Management, Urban Planning, and Disaster Preparedness</strong></p><p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">The importance of risk management in agriculture and infrastructure</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Tools and techniques for identifying and assessing climate-related risks</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Definition and significance of urban planning</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Strategies for integrating agriculture into urban planning</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Techniques for disaster preparedness and response in agricultural contexts</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Activity: Developing risk assessment and disaster preparedness plan</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Policies and Future Trends</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Overview of international and national climate policies affecting agriculture</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Identifying the role of policies in enhancing climate resilient agriculture</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing the role and applications of emerging technologies in mitigating climate change impacts</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Best practices for designing and implementing green infrastructure for sustainable agriculture</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing future trends in climate change agriculture and infrastructure</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Group Discussion: How to prepare for future challenges in climate change agriculture</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Case study on the role of emerging technology in agriculture</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Final presentation on climate resilient plan</span></li></ul>"]',
