le=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the principles of innovation for the Bottom of the Pyramid (BOP) </span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Global Product Development Deployment Strategy</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Overview of deploying global product development strategy</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the outsourcing process approach and its stages:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Outsourcing simple tasks&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Outsourcing complex and integrated tasks&nbsp;</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the component outsourcing approach and its stages:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Designing simple components&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Designing integrated components&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Developing complete product modules&nbsp;</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the captive design center approach and its stages:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Outsourcing simple tasks or components&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Outsourcing complex and integrated tasks and components&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Completing modules/subsystems&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Developing derivative products</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Developing new global products</span></li></ol><p><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\"><span class=\\"ql-cursor\\">﻿</span></span></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the success factors for deploying global products</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Best Practices &amp; Future Trends</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discovering the ground rules for global products:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Think global</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understand and select the global market</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Select the competitive battleground&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Global product strategy&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Upfront planning&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Prescriptive approach</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Clear and common terminology&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Architectures and models&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Digital products and digital manufacturing</span></li></ol><p><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\"><span class=\\"ql-cursor\\">﻿</span></span></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the opportunities and challenges associated with global products&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing different techniques and approaches used to improve the performance of business with global products&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing future trends of global product management and its influence&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Course recap and Q&amp;A&nbsp; </span></li></ul><p><br></p>"]',
