olor: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Utilizing historical research and documentation for urban planning</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding documentation standards and regulations</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Preservation and Conservation Planning</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Definition of urban heritage conservation</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Overview of global conventions related to preservation and conservation</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Describing conservation strategies:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">        Preservation</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">        </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Restoration</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">        </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Rehabilitation</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">        </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Adaptive reuse</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Steps of creating conservation plans</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Tools and methods for assessing urban heritage sites</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discovering restoration strategies for urban heritage</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Adaptive reuse strategies of heritage building</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Urban Heritage Design and Development</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Overview of urban heritage design and development</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Principles of urban heritage design and development</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Best practices for designing sensitive interventions and alterations to heritage buildings</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Key considerations for designing and developing urban heritage:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">         Resect the original architecture character</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">         </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Harmony with the existing build environment</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Principles of sustainable design</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Best practices for integrating sustainable design into heritage structures</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Urban Heritage Management</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Definition and significance of urban heritage management</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Best practices for managing urban heritage</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discovering advocacy strategies for urban heritage conservation</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">The importance of engaging communities in urban heritage projects</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Methods for funding urban heritage projects</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Course evaluation and feedback </span></li></ul>"]',
