            377 => 
            array (
                'id' => 2223,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Cross-Functional Teams Collaboration',
            'description' => '<p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">Navigating the intricacies of collaboration among diverse groups is a challenge faced by many organizations striving for innovation and efficiency. Cross-functional teams, composed of members from various departments and expertise, are pivotal in driving organizational success by leveraging diverse perspectives and skills. The Cross-Functional Teams Collaboration training course is designed to equip participants with the tools and strategies necessary to build and maintain effective cross-functional teams.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">Participants will explore the fundamental principles of cross-functional collaboration, focusing on overcoming common obstacles such as communication barriers, competing priorities, and resistance to change. The course offers insights into fostering clear and concise communication, employing conflict resolution techniques, and harnessing the power of diversity to drive innovation. Furthermore, participants will learn how to cultivate a culture of teamwork by creating shared goals and recognizing collaborative achievements.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">Through practical exercises and real-world examples, this course empowers individuals to enhance their ability to work within and lead cross-functional teams, ultimately improving organizational cohesion and performance.</span></p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Building the Foundation&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the meaning of cross-functional teams&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Determining the importance of cross-functional teams in maintaining collaboration, alignment, and engagement across different functional areas&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring common challenges associated with cross-functional teams:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Solid thinking&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Lack of communication&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Competing priorities&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Resistance to change</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Territorial behavior&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Conflicting objectives&nbsp;</span></li></ol><p><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">﻿</span></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing examples of collaboration obstacles&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring strategies for building a collaborative environment with a cross-functional team </span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Communication is the Key</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discovering techniques for clear, concise, and transparent communication across disciplines&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding how active listening and empathy help in understanding different perspectives&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding how to select the right communication channels based on the nature of information, urgency, and the needs of the audience&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the role of utilizing technology for sharing information&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discovering brainstorming techniques for effective communication and idea generation:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Mind mapping&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Free Association&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Nominal Group </span></li></ol>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Conflict Resolution Techniques&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing sources and causes of conflicts in cross-functional teams&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring strategies to address and resolve conflicts effectively&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Identifying the types of negotiation and its significance in resolving conflicts:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Principled negotiation&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Integrative bargaining&nbsp;</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing how to use problem-solving techniques to address conflicts</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Problem-solving cycle&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">SWOT analysis&nbsp;</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the importance of having analytics thinking skills to solve complex issues&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Techniques to evaluate the potential solutions:</span></li></ul><p><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\"><span class=\\"ql-cursor\\">﻿</span></span></p><ol><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Cost-benefit analysis&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Decision matrixes </span></li></ol>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Diversity for Innovation&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Identifying the importance of adopting diverse perspectives in cross-functional teams to drive innovation&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing ways to build inclusive environments in workplaces</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the benefits of encouraging diverse thinking in cross-functional teams&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring techniques for integrating different perspectives for better results:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Consensus building&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Compromise&nbsp;</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Real-life examples of leveraging diverse perspectives </span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Teamwork Culture&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the importance of having effective teamwork within the organization&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing effective strategies for building a teamwork culture&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Determining the significance of creating shared goals and vision that unites team members&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the importance of recognizing and rewarding collaborative achievements&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Case study: Walt Disney &amp; IBM strategy for fostering teamwork and collaboration&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Course recap and Q&amp;A</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Course Evaluation </span></li></ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 52,
                'online' => 1,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:54:16',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:54:16',
            ),
