            'description' => '<p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">Consider a scenario where a tech company, aiming to capture a significant market share decides to implement a data collection strategy that invades user privacy to enhance its product’s features. This decision, while potentially lucrative, raises critical ethical concerns about user consent, data protection, and long-term societal impact.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">In this course, we will explore the ethical dimensions of product management through real-world examples, analyzing the consequences of ethical and unethical decisions alike. The curriculum is designed to provide a thorough understanding of ethical principles and frameworks essential for guiding product development and management.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">Participants will delve into the meaning of ethics in product management, discussing the importance of moral responsibility and how to navigate ethical dilemmas that arise in real-world scenarios. The course covers key topics such as user privacy, bias avoidance, and accessibility, while also integrating sustainable practices into product design. By examining ethical theories and frameworks like consequentialism and deontology, attendees will learn how to make well-informed decisions that balance business objectives with ethical considerations.</span></p>',
                'duration' => '3',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Ethical Product Mindset</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the meaning of morality, and ethics in product management&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the meaning and the importance of ethical responsibility</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the ethical dilemmas and challenges faced by the product team&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the impact of making unethical decisions on users and society&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the importance of adopting ethical products and management&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Real-world examples of the implications of ethical failures </span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Ethical Principles &amp; Frameworks&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the difference between ethical principles among industries&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring key ethical principles for product development&nbsp;</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">User privacy and data protection&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Avoiding bias and discrimination&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Accessibility and inclusivity&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Integrating ethical frameworks</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">User-centric ethical design&nbsp;</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring ethical theories and frameworks that help in address ethical issues and dilemmas:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Consequentialism&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Deontology&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Ethics of Care&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Virtue Ethics&nbsp;</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the steps for making ethical decisions:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Access the situation&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Alternatives&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Analysis&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Application&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Action</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring ways to integrate sustainability in product development&nbsp;</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ul><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Lifecycle assessment&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Material selection&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Energy Efficiency&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Minimalist Design&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Packaging Considerations</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Maintaining Ethical Products</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the significance of conducting ethical assessments&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing how ethics can be measured in product management:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Labour standards metrics</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Environmental impact metrics</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Transparency metrics</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Social impact metrics</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Human rights metrics</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Product safety metrics</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discovering techniques to integrate ethics in product management:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Leadership commitment&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Culture integration&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Continuous learning&nbsp;</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring strategies to foster ethical culture:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Ethical Guidelines and Governance&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Training programs for product teams&nbsp;</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Overview of implementing ethics in product marketing:</span></li></ul><p><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\"><span class=\\"ql-cursor\\">﻿</span></span></p><ol><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Representing products truthfully and transparently</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Avoiding misleading marketing practices&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Responsible customer data usage </span></li></ol>"]',
