            'name' => 'EFFAS Certified ESG Analyst® (CESGA)',
            'description' => '<p class="ql-align-justify"><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">As global markets increasingly recognize the importance of sustainability and ethical practices, the integration of environmental, social, and governance (ESG) factors into investment strategies has become crucial. Unlike traditional financial analysis that focuses solely on profitability and risk, ESG analysis encompasses a broader evaluation of how companies perform in areas such as environmental stewardship, social responsibility, and governance practices.</span></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><br></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">The EFFAS Certified ESG Analyst® (CESGA) training course provides a comprehensive exploration of ESG principles, regulations, and integration techniques essential for modern investment decision-making. Participants will gain a deep understanding of how ESG considerations are reshaping investment landscapes, including the historical evolution of ESG, current regulatory frameworks, and practical strategies for incorporating ESG factors into investment processes.&nbsp;</span></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><br></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">By addressing the latest developments and challenges in ESG integration, the course equips professionals with the skills needed to enhance their investment strategies and ensure compliance with emerging standards.</span></p>',
