            387 => 
            array (
                'id' => 2233,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Materials Planning and Forecasting for Spare Parts Management',
            'description' => '<p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">Accurate materials planning and forecasting are critical components in the management of spare parts, directly influencing the efficiency and reliability of industrial operations. Inadequate planning can lead to costly downtimes, excess inventory, or critical shortages, which can disrupt production processes and impact overall business performance.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">This course explores the technical and methodological aspects of materials planning, focusing on the application of demand forecasting models, inventory control practices, and materials requirements planning (MRP) within the context of spare parts management. Participants will engage with practical scenarios and case studies to deepen their understanding of how to address the challenges of variability in demand and the complexities of managing spare parts inventory in dynamic industrial environments.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">Through this course, attendees will gain the expertise needed to align materials planning with organizational goals, optimize inventory levels, and implement strategies that ensure the availability of essential spare parts, thereby enhancing operational resilience and cost-effectiveness.</span></p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Introduction Material Planning and Forecasting</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Definition and significance of material planning and forecasting</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Overview of spare parts management: Definition, benefits and impact</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Roles and responsibilities of material managers within the organization</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Fundamentals of demand forecasting and its applications in spare parts management</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Challenges and pitfalls in spare parts planning and forecasting</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Real-world examples of material planning and forecasting for spare parts management</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Demand Forecasting for Spare Parts</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Describing demand forecasting types</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Analyzing factors affecting the demand for spare parts</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring demand forecasting models for spare parts:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">          </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Time series analysis</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">          </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Casual models</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">          Regression analysis</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Techniques for integrating inventory control practices with demand forecasting</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Best practices to optimize the accuracy of demand forecasting</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Practical exercise: Create and evaluate demand forecasts</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Materials Requirements Planning (MRP)</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Introduction to materials requirements planning (MRP): Definition, objectives, and functions</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Steps in material requirement planning (MRP):</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">         Quantity requirements identification</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">         </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">MRP calculation</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">         </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Orders completion</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Steps of developing bill of material (BOM) for spare parts</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Steps for developing master production schedule (MPS) for spare parts</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding the MRP process: Explosion, Netting, Offsetting, and Lot sizing</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Best practices for creating MRP for spare parts inventory management</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Case study on the implementation of MRP in real-world scenarios</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Spare Parts Inventory Management</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Identifying the significance of spare parts inventory management</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Best practices for managing spare parts inventory</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Formulas for calculating safety stocks</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Methodology of classifying spare parts: ABC analysis</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Best practices for selecting and managing suppliers</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Practical exercise: Analyzing spare parts inventory management reports</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Best Practices for Optimizing Spare Parts Management</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Importance of aligning planning and forecasting with organizational strategy</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Strategies for evaluating and optimizing inventory levels</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Techniques for identifying and evaluating risks in spare parts management</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discovering metrics and KPIs to measure the performance of optimization practices</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing the usage of emerging technologies in material planning and forecasting</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Case study on spare parts management leaders</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Final presentation on material planning and forecasting</span></li></ul>"]',
