 transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Discussing the role of timing in cultural project management</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Methods for time planning and management in cultural projects:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">        Charts</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">        </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Scenarios/ scripts</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">        </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Network planning</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">The application of Gantt Chart in project planning</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Identifying the importance of marketing cultural projects</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Key components of a marketing plan</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Techniques for developing a communication plan with stakeholders</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Cultural Project Management Leading Stories</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Analyzing successful case studies in cultural project management</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Overview of the challenges facing cultural project management</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Exploring best practices in cultural project management</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Developing a cultural project plan</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Presentations and feedback</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Course evaluation </span></li></ul>"]',
