br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Fundamentals of grant and fund management</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">&nbsp;Exploring funding sources in NGOs:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ul><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Grants</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Donations</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Corporate sponsorships</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Earned income</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Describing fundraising and diversification strategies</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discovering the donor cycle</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Process of proposal development</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Characteristics of a compiling grant proposal</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Best practices for managing donor funds and compliance</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Governance, Partnership and Collaboration in NGO Projects</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the impact of different governance structures on NGOs</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Importance of partnership and collaboration in NGO projects</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Strategies for cooperation with other NGOs and government agencies</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Techniques for empowering and engaging local communities in projects</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Best practices for managing project staff and volunteers</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Describing the significance of managing communication with partners and stakeholders</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Risk Management, Monitoring and Evolution for NGOs</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Techniques for identifying and assessing risks in NGO operations</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Best practices for managing risk and ensuring safety</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Strategies for crisis management and business continuity planning</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Steps of developing monitoring and evaluation plans for NGO projects</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Importance of data collection and analysis in improving projects</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Best practices for reporting results to donors and stakeholders</span></li></ul>"]',
