            395 => 
            array (
                'id' => 2241,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
            'name' => 'Certified Communication Executive (Preparation Course)',
            'description' => '<p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">In today’s rapidly evolving and interconnected world, communication is the lifeblood of any successful organization. It’s not just about sharing information; it’s about creating connections, fostering understanding, and driving meaningful action. The Certified Communication Executive course is thoughtfully designed to provide you with the essential skills and strategic insights needed to master the art and science of communication in a complex business landscape.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">This course goes beyond the basics, diving into the core principles of effective communication. You’ll explore why communication strategies work, not just how to implement them. Whether it’s aligning your communication efforts with your organization’s goals, managing your brand’s reputation, or engaging stakeholders in a way that builds trust and loyalty, this course covers it all.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">You’ll also learn the practical side of communication—how to create strategies that are not only effective but also measurable and adaptable. Through real-world examples and case studies, you’ll gain insights into how to refine your communication approaches to meet the ever-changing needs of your audience and your organization.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">By the end of this course, you won’t just be someone who communicates well—you’ll be a strategic communication leader who can influence, inspire, and drive real change within your organization and beyond.</span></p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Commutation Fundamentals</strong></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">&nbsp;</span></p><ul><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Introduction to communication: definition, purpose, and nature</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing communication theories and principles&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Describing various communication types</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Identifying the objectives of a leader’s communication</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring various communication channels and their features</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Overview of communication tools and platforms used for communication management</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Strategic Communication Planning</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Steps of creating a communication strategy aligned with the organization’s objectives</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Identifying the role of communication in supporting business strategy</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Techniques for setting measurable communication goals</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Characteristics of communication messages</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Identifying the role and impact of storytelling in communication</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Methods for executing successful communication initiatives</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Brand Management</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Definition and importance of brand management</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Strategies for building and protecting an organization’s reputation</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring brand positioning techniques</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Best practices for communicating a brand across channels</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Methods for managing brand perception internally and externally</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Definition of brand equity and exploring ways for measuring it</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Process of developing a crisis communication plan</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Stakeholder Engagement</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding the importance of stakeholder engagement</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Techniques for identifying, mapping, and analyzing stakeholders</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Strategies for effective stakeholder engagement</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Techniques for building positive relationships with stakeholders</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Best practices to represent an organization during various events</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Identifying the importance of stakeholder feedback</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Performance Measurement</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding the importance of communication performance measurement</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring main KPIs used to measure the effectiveness of communication activities</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Techniques for conducting communication audits</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Identifying the importance of data and analytics in improving communication strategy</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Describing reporting and presentation techniques for result communication</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing communication barriers and suggesting overcoming solutions&nbsp; </span></li></ul>"]',
