            399 => 
            array (
                'id' => 2245,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Hospitality Concept Strategy',
            'description' => '<p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">The hospitality industry is one of the most dynamic and rapidly evolving sectors, driven by changing consumer preferences, technological advancements, and the increasing importance of sustainability. Understanding and crafting a compelling hospitality concept is essential for businesses that aim to stand out in a competitive market and deliver exceptional customer experiences. The Hospitality Concept Strategy course is designed to provide participants with a comprehensive understanding of the key elements that contribute to the success of a hospitality-concept, from staying current with industry trends to creating a customer-centric approach.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">Throughout this course, participants will explore the historical evolution of hospitality and examine the latest trends that are shaping the industry today. They will delve into the significance of creativity and storytelling in building a memorable brand, and learn how to develop strategies that resonate with target audiences. The course also emphasizes the importance of assembling a strong team and cultivating effective partnerships to support the overall business strategy.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">By the end of the course, participants will have gained valuable insights and practical tools to develop, refine, and implement successful hospitality concepts that align with their business goals and respond to the demands of a diverse and ever-changing marketplace.</span></p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Hospitality Trends and Evolution</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Definition of hospitality concept and its importance</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring key emerging trends in the hospitality industry</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing historical evolution of hospitality</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Assessing the impact of globalization in hospitality across different regions</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Identifying the role of technology advancements in the development of hospitality concepts</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the importance of sustainability in modern hospitality concepts</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Creativity and Storytelling for Hospitality</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding the Framing approach in hospitality branding</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing the impact of creativity and innovation in hospitality</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Identifying the power of storytelling and its influence</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Steps of building brand narratives tailored to target audience</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Methods of using visuals and emotional elements in storytelling</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Analyzing real-world examples of storytelling techniques in hospitality</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Customer-Centric Strategy</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Definition and purpose of customer-centric strategy</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">The mythology of developing customer-centric strategy</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Techniques for identifying customers needs and pinpoints</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Strategies for developing unique value propositions</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Steps of conducting competitor analysis to understand their offerings</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Identifying the importance of continuous improvement in products and services offerings</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Building a Winning Team&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding the role of teams in the successful implementation of hospitality strategy</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Steps of developing a winning team in hospitality businesses</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Strategies for establishing core beliefs and shared values in business culture</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Methods for developing team standards and expectations for alignment with hospitality goals</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Ways of encouraging collaboration and communication within teams</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Best practices for enhancing team skills and productivity</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Partnership Management</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding the partnership ecosystem</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Describing stakeholder management strategies in the concept development process</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Best practices for developing and building partnerships to grow the brand</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Communication techniques for successful management of partnership</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Identifying the importance of negotiation techniques during partnership agreements</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Methods for evaluating the performance of partnership </span></li></ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
