 communication within teams</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Best practices for enhancing team skills and productivity</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Partnership Management</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding the partnership ecosystem</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Describing stakeholder management strategies in the concept development process</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Best practices for developing and building partnerships to grow the brand</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Communication techniques for successful management of partnership</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Identifying the importance of negotiation techniques during partnership agreements</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Methods for evaluating the performance of partnership </span></li></ul>"]',
