annels and marketing channels</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Quality and Supply Chain Performance Management</strong></p><p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Identifying the impact of organizational structure on logistics performance</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Determining the relationship between logistics structure and productivity</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Methods for increasing productivity in supply chain management and logistics:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">         </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">E-commerce</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">         </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">E-logistics</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Techniques for reducing trucking costs</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing the reform of the Jones Act</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Principles of quality management in the supply chain:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">         </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Statistical process control</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">         Total quality management</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Key supply chain performance measures </span></li></ul>"]',
