yle=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Methods for automating decision making process</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring machine learning algorithms used for decision making&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Approaches for AI decision making:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Searching&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Adversarial searching&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Constraint satisfaction problems</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Bid data&nbsp;</span></li></ol><p><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\"><span class=\\"ql-cursor\\">﻿</span></span></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the role of deep learning in automating decision making </span></li></ul>","<p><strong>AI for Resource Management&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li>Understanding the role of AI tools in optimizing human and material resource management</li><li>Reviewing AI-driven methods used for resource allocation</li><li>Exploring machine learning techniques for resource needs prediction</li><li>Ways of automating resource scheduling and time management</li><li>&nbsp;Discussing the applications of AI techniques in analyzing team performance and skillsets</li><li>Case studies highlighting the applications of AI technologies in resource management</li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Natural Language Processing in PMO</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Defining natural language processing (NLP)</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the impact of NLP in PMO functions&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: 