            421 => 
            array (
                'id' => 2268,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Revenue Management Strategies in Hospitality',
            'description' => '<p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">In an increasingly competitive and dynamic hospitality industry, effective revenue management is a critical component for achieving both profitability and sustainable growth. This course, Revenue Management Strategies in Hospitality, is designed to provide a comprehensive understanding of the principles, tools, and techniques essential for optimizing revenue across hospitality operations.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">The course begins by exploring the foundational concepts of revenue management, delving into its evolution, key terminologies, and strategic importance in the context of hospitality. Through a systematic examination of market analysis, segmentation, forecasting, and pricing, participants will gain the necessary skills to interpret market trends, anticipate customer demand, and implement data-driven pricing strategies that enhance financial performance.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">By the end of the course, participants will be equipped with the knowledge and tools to develop robust revenue management strategies, optimize pricing, and leverage distribution channels effectively to drive revenue growth and operational efficiency in the hospitality sector. This course is ideal for hospitality professionals seeking to deepen their expertise in revenue management and enhance their ability to deliver competitive advantage in an ever-evolving market.</span></p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Introduction to Revenue Management</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Definition of revenue management and its related key terms</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the evolution of revenue management in hospitality</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Identifying benefits and purpose of revenue management</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Describing the organizational structure of revenue management</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Overview of revenue management strategies and tactics in the hospitality industry</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Steps for developing KPIs and metrics to measure the effectiveness of revenue management</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Challenges and issues in revenue management in the hospitality industry</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Market Analysis and Segmentation</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding customers in the hospitality industry:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">          Customer Journey</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">          </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Customer choices</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Techniques for monitoring and measuring competitor marketplace</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Definition and purpose of market segmentation</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Identifying the role of market segmentation in revenue management</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring various hospitality market segments</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Distinguishing between channel and segment</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing the usage of segmentation in improving results</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Activity: Practicing market analysis and segmentation</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Forecasting</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Identifying the role of forecasting in revenue management</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring forecasting types and their objectives</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Determining the key elements of an accurate forecast</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring types of information needed for forecasting</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Process and steps of forecasting</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Distinguishing between unconstrained and constrained demand</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Revenue and Pricing Strategy</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Definition and purpose of revenue strategy</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Key components of revenue strategy</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Determining the role of revenue strategy in managing daily operations</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing the impact of inventory in sales</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Definition and components of pricing strategy</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring different pricing strategies and methods</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Describing factors influencing pricing strategy</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discovering technologies and tools for monitoring and managing pricing</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Activity: Developing revenue and pricing strategy for a given scenario</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Distribution Channel Management</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Definition and types of distribution channels</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing the impact of distribution channels on revenue</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Identifying factors influencing the cost of sale</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing the role of rate parity in distribution</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Strategies for effective distribution channel management</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Steps for implementing distribution strategy</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">The role of technology in distribution and the basics of digital distribution</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Case Study: Best practices in distribution channel management</span></li></ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
