: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Key components of revenue strategy</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Determining the role of revenue strategy in managing daily operations</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing the impact of inventory in sales</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Definition and components of pricing strategy</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring different pricing strategies and methods</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Describing factors influencing pricing strategy</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discovering technologies and tools for monitoring and managing pricing</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Activity: Developing revenue and pricing strategy for a given scenario</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Distribution Channel Management</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Definition and types of distribution channels</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing the impact of distribution channels on revenue</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Identifying factors influencing the cost of sale</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing the role of rate parity in distribution</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Strategies for effective distribution channel management</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Steps 