eir applications across the performance domain</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring commonly used artefacts and their applications across the performance domain</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring the interaction between performance domains for project success</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Lessons Learned and Best Practices</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Final Q&amp;A and Course Wrap-Up</span></li></ul>"]',
