            431 => 
            array (
                'id' => 2280,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'IT in Hospitality Operations',
            'description' => '<p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">The IT in Hospitality Operations course provides a comprehensive understanding of the role of information technology in the modern hospitality industry. As technology becomes more integral to enhancing guest experiences and streamlining operational efficiency, this course delves into the specific tools and systems that are reshaping hospitality management. From front-desk operations to back-office systems, participants will explore how technology such as property management systems (PMS), in-room automation, keyless entry, and customer relationship management (CRM) software can drive better guest satisfaction and operational control.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">The course also covers critical aspects of system selection, integration, and maintenance, ensuring that participants are well-equipped to implement and manage these technologies within their organizations. Additionally, emerging technologies such as AI, machine learning, and virtual reality will be discussed, highlighting their growing influence in the hospitality sector. By the end of this course, attendees will be able to navigate the complex intersection of IT and hospitality, using technology to address challenges, improve service, and support the operational needs of the industry.</span></p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Introduction to Hospitality Operations and IT&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Overview of hospitality industry segments</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Evolution of the hospitality industry over time</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Definition of hospitality operations and its types</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing challenges and pitfalls faced by the hospitality sector</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Definition of information system and information technology</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Identifying the significance and role of IT in hospitality operations</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the evolution of information technology in the hospitality industry</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Group Discussion: Common operational challenges and solutions for them</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">IT for Enhanced Guest Experience&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Definition of guest experience in hospitality&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Characteristics of a good guest experience in hospitality</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring In-room and smart control technologies</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Describing the application of keyless entry technology</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discovering the usage of mobile technologies for enhanced customer experience</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">The application of customer relationship management (CRM) systems in hospitality</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Technologies for collecting guest feedback and managing reviews</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">IT in Front-Desk Operations&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Overview of back-desk operations</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing key features and functions of PMS</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Describing the interface of PMS:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">        </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Point of sale system (POS)</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">        </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Telephone call account systems</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">        </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Electronic locking systems</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">        </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Energy management systems</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">        Auxiliary guest service devices</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding the significance and types of PMS integration</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Describing the components and function of the hotel reservation system</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Case study: Analyzing outcomes of PMS implementation</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">IT in Back-Desk Operations</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Overview of front-desk operations</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring housekeeping management systems</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring maintenance management systems</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Describing technologies used in food and beverage operations</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Technologies for labour management and financial reporting</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing security concerns in hospitality</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Best practices for ensuring security procedures</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">System Selection and Maintenance&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Benefits of computerization and integrating technology into hospitality operations</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Process of selecting IT systems and their suppliers</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Best practices for maintaining hospitality systems</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing the applications of Internet in hospitality</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Steps for developing IT strategy in hospitality</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Identifying the impact of emerging technologies in hospitality:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">       AI and machine learning</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">       </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Virtual and augmented reality</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">       </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Blockchain</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Recap and Course Evaluation</span></li></ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 49,
                'online' => 1,
