on</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Describing the components and function of the hotel reservation system</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Case study: Analyzing outcomes of PMS implementation</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">IT in Back-Desk Operations</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Overview of front-desk operations</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring housekeeping management systems</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring maintenance management systems</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Describing technologies used in food and beverage operations</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Technologies for labour management and financial reporting</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing security concerns in hospitality</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Best practices for ensuring security procedures</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">System Selection and Maintenance&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Benefits of computerization and integrating technology into hospitality operations</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Process of selecting IT systems and their suppliers</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Best practices for maintaining hospitality systems</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37