e IoT Systems&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Determining the significance of IoT security</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring key components of a secure IoT network</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Common challenges and issues in IoT security</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Methods and strategies to protect IoT systems</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Best practices for securing IoT systems</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Case Study: Analyzing the impact of risks and vulnerabilities in IoT systems</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Future Trends and Ethical Considerations</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing main issues and problems in implementing IoT solutions in hospitality</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding IoT security standards and regulations</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Ethical and legal considerations for IoT in hospitality</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Determining the significance of communicating IoT strategy with stakeholders and terms</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing emerging technologies and their impact on hospitality</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Recap and Course Evaluation</span></li></ul>"]',
