            439 => 
            array (
                'id' => 2288,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
            'name' => 'Artificial Intelligence (AI) and Automation in Hospitality',
            'description' => '<p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">The Artificial Intelligence (AI) and Automation in Hospitality course provides a thorough introduction to the growing role of AI in transforming hospitality operations and customer experiences. As AI continues to reshape various industries, this course focuses on the specific applications of AI within hospitality, including how it can enhance customer service, streamline operations, and improve decision-making processes. Participants will explore key AI technologies such as machine learning, natural language processing (NLP), and automation, as well as the tools and platforms that enable these innovations.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">Throughout the course, attendees will learn how to implement AI solutions in areas such as customer service, resource allocation, and operations management, while also addressing the challenges of data management, privacy, and security. The course will conclude with a discussion on future AI trends and ethical considerations, equipping participants with the knowledge needed to integrate AI strategies into their hospitality businesses.</span></p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Introduction to AI and Hospitality&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Definition of AI and its related concepts&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the historical evaluation of AI in hospitality&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Overview of AI applications in hospitality</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring AI technologies:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\"> </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Machine Learning</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\"> </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Deep Learning</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\"> </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Natural Language Processing (NLP)</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\"> </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Neural Networks</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\"> Algorithms</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Overview of AI tools and platforms</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Group Discussion: Opportunities and challenges of AI in hospitality</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">AI in Customer Experience&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Overview of the applications and usage of AI in customer experience</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Utilizing chatbots and virtual assistants to answer customer inquiries</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Utilizing AI for personalized recommendations and services</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring the applications of augmented and virtual reality in hospitality</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Case Study: Implementation of AI in customer experience</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Activity: Examining chatbots of a hotel or other establishment</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">AI in Operations Management&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Overview of the applications and usage of AI in operations and management</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Identify the impact of AI on operational efficiency</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">How to use predictive analytics for demand forecasting?</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Utilizing AI algorithms for resource allocation and scheduling</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring the applications of automation and robotics in hospitality</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Case Study: Analyzing the role of AI in various hospitality operations</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Data Management and Security</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Determining the significance of data in decision-making and AI applications</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring types and sources of data in hospitality</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Methods for collecting and analyzing guest data</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Techniques for data management in hospitality</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Best practices for maintaining data quality in</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Activity: Draft a data management plan for AI applications in hospitality</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Future Trends and Ethical Considerations&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing main issues and problems in AI models</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding the significance of data privacy and security</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Ethical and legal regulations in data collection and AI deployment</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Determining the significance of communicating AI strategy with stakeholders and terms</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Describing long-term strategies for integrating AI into hospitality</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing emerging technologies and their impact on hospitality</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Recap and Course Evaluation</span></li></ul>"]',
