            443 => 
            array (
                'id' => 2292,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'ChatGPT: Performance Monitoring and Optimization',
            'description' => '<p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">Monitoring and maintaining the performance of AI systems is critical to ensuring they function correctly and efficiently over time. This course focuses on the real-time performance tracking and optimization of ChatGPT deployments, providing a deep dive into the metrics and tools necessary for monitoring AI systems. Participants will explore techniques for identifying issues, analyzing logs, and creating custom dashboards to visualize system performance. The course will also cover troubleshooting common performance problems and error handling strategies, ensuring participants are well-equipped to manage and resolve AI-related issues in live environments.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">Throughout the five-day course, attendees will gain hands-on experience in implementing real-time monitoring frameworks, optimizing prompt engineering, and scaling AI deployments to handle increased loads. This course is designed to offer practical knowledge that participants can immediately apply in their AI projects, helping them maintain optimal performance and continuously improve their AI systems over time.</span></p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Introduction to Performance Monitoring in AI Systems&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the importance of monitoring AI systems in real-time</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring key metrics for ChatGPT performance</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Overview of tools for monitoring AI performance:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\"> OpenAI API dashboard</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\"> </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Custom solutions</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Analyzing real-world examples of AI performance monitoring</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Steps of setting up basic monitoring for a ChatGPT deployment</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Real-Time Performance Tracking and Analysis</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Steps of implementing real-time performance tracking for ChatGPT</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Techniques for analyze logs for insights into performance and user interactions</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Process of creating custom dashboards for visualizing performance metrics</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Techniques to build and configure a real-time monitoring dashboard</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing best practices for maintaining continuous monitoring</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Troubleshooting and Error Handling</strong></p><p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Identifying common performance issues in ChatGPT deployments</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Strategies for error handling: Retries, fallbacks, and user notifications</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Steps of conducting root cause analysis using logs and performance data</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Simulating errors and practicing troubleshooting techniques</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Reviewing case studies on resolving AI performance issues</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Optimization Strategies for ChatGPT</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Ways of optimizing prompt engineering to improve response quality</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring fine-tune models that enhance performance</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Steps of scaling ChatGPT deployments to handle increased load</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Best practices for Implementing optimization strategies in a live deployment</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing long-term strategies for maintaining AI performance</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Continuous Monitoring and Improvement&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Identifying the importance of continuous monitoring and improvement</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Methods for developing a framework for continuous performance monitoring</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Ways of automating monitoring processes with tools and scripts</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Reviewing case studies and industry best practices</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Designing and deploying a comprehensive monitoring framework</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Final presentation and feedback</span></li></ul>"]',
