            447 => 
            array (
                'id' => 2296,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'ChatGPT Basics: Foundational Skills for Effective Use',
            'description' => '<p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">As AI continues to shape the future of business, education, and creative industries, understanding how to use tools like ChatGPT effectively is becoming increasingly essential. This course introduces participants to the foundational skills required to use ChatGPT and other Large Language Models (LLMs) in a practical and impactful way. Over five days, attendees will learn about the evolution of ChatGPT, the principles of prompt engineering, and how to integrate these tools into various workflows. With a focus on real-world applications, the course covers the fundamentals of natural language processing (NLP), experimenting with different LLM models, and utilising advanced features like LangChain Agents to optimise AI performance.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">Through hands-on exercises and projects, participants will develop the ability to craft effective prompts, experiment with various LLM models, and troubleshoot common issues. This course is designed to give both technical and non-technical professionals the confidence to implement AI-powered solutions in their respective fields, while also exploring future trends in AI technology.</span></p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Introduction to ChatGPT and Its Evolution&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding ChatGPT: History, capabilities, and impact across industries</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">Introduction to Natural Language Processing (NLP) and conversational AI</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\\">Real-world examples of ChatGPT’s application in various sectors</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\\">Introduction to Generative AI and transformation architecture</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\\">Overview of multi models functions and applications</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Basics of Prompt Engineering</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Definition and importance of prompt engineering</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Exploring different prompt engineering techniques and their impact on AI responses</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Understanding few-shot and zero-shot learning techniques</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Practical exercise on creating effective prompts using the ChatGPT interface</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Strategies for designing prompts that drive desired outcomes</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Experimenting with Different LLM Models&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Exploring various Large LLM models and their features:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">         ChatGPT</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">         </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Google Gemini</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">         </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Lama3</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Comparison between ChatGPT and open-source models</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Understanding fine-tuning techniques</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Experimenting with different LLM models</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Ways for evaluating the performance of different LLM models</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">OpenAI Assistance and LangChain Agents&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Discussing the features of OpenAI, focusing on custom function calls</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Understanding the purpose and features of LangChain</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Identifying the role of LangChain Agents and its automation and optimization functions</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Understanding LangChiain’s line graph feature and its usage</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Practical exercise on integrating Open AI assistance and LangChain tools into workflow</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Advanced Techniques and Best Practices</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Exploring advanced techniques for optimizing prompts and improving responses quality</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Overview of troubleshooting and debugging techniques</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Discussing future trends in AI and ChatGPT technology</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Exercises and projects to create and test prompts and assistants</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Peer review and feedback on the exercises</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Recap of key concepts and takeaways</span></li></ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
