            451 => 
            array (
                'id' => 2300,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'ChatGPT Advanced: Mastering Automation and Workflow Optimization',
            'description' => '<p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">As AI continues to shape the way businesses operate, having a strong understanding of advanced AI techniques and how to apply them effectively is essential. This course offers a clear, hands-on approach to using ChatGPT and other large language models (LLMs) for business applications. Over five days, participants will learn how to improve workflows through prompt engineering, fine-tune models for specific tasks, and integrate AI into real-world operations. The course also explores LangChain and its role in building more complex, automated processes.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(24, 3, 44);">By the end of the course, attendees will have gained practical skills in designing AI-driven solutions and managing automated workflows that can be applied directly to their professional environments. Through case studies and hands-on projects, participants will understand how to approach AI in a way that enhances business efficiency without unnecessary complexity.</span></p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Introduction to Advanced Applications and Techniques&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Recognizing the role of advanced AI techniques in transforming industries</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Understanding natural language processing (NLP) and transformer models</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Real-world examples of ChatGPT’s application in various sectors</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\\">Introduction to multimodel functions and applications</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent;\\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Understanding large language models (LLMs) like ChatGPT, Google Gemini, and others.</span></p>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Advanced Prompt Engineering and Workflow Automation&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Reviewing the principles and functions of prompt engineering</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Techniques for crafting prompts that handle complex business scenarios</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Utilizing ChatGPT’s custom function calls to automate and streamline business processes</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Detailed case studies showcasing automation in different industries</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Activity: Designing and implementing automated workflows using advanced prompt engineering and custom function calls</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Fine-Tuning and Optimizing LLMs for Business Needs</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding fine-tuning, its significance, and techniques</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Techniques to customize LLM models for specific tasks&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Analyzing the performance of different MML models</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Methods for optimizing models to meet specific business objectives</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Experimenting with vision models for image and video analysis</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Workflow Automation with LangChain and AI Agents</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Introduction to LangChain and its role in supporting complex AI applications</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Ways of implementing LangChain agents for real-time task automation and management</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing how to leverage LangChain line graphs to visualize and manage intricate workflows</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Activity: Building and deploying an AI-driven workflow automation system using LangChain and custom function calls</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussion: Best practices for deploying and managing AI-driven automation in a business context</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Integrating AI into Business Operations and Hands-On Exercises</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Methods and best practices for integrating AI-driven automation into existing business systems and workflows</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Strategies for monitoring, managing and improving AI flows</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exercises for applying advanced concepts learned throughout the courses</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Final project and feedback</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Recap of key concepts and takeaways</span></li></ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 54,
                'online' => 1,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:54:51',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:54:51',
