aging AI-driven automation in a business context</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Integrating AI into Business Operations and Hands-On Exercises</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Methods and best practices for integrating AI-driven automation into existing business systems and workflows</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Strategies for monitoring, managing and improving AI flows</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exercises for applying advanced concepts learned throughout the courses</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Final project and feedback</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Recap of key concepts and takeaways</span></li></ul>"]',
