                'name' => 'Production and sharing Contracts Training Course',
            'description' => '<p><span style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">In the oil and gas industry, Production Sharing Contracts (PSCs) represent a widely used contractual model, particularly in resource-rich countries. These agreements define the relationship between the state and private oil companies, ensuring that risks and rewards are shared in the development and production of petroleum resources. PSCs are critical for managing large-scale exploration and production projects, providing legal and operational frameworks that protect both the state\'s interests and the investment of private contractors. Understanding the intricacies of production-sharing contracts is vital for professionals involved in contract negotiation, project management, and legal advisory within the energy sector.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">The Production Sharing Contracts Training Course offers a comprehensive understanding of the legal, financial, and operational dimensions of PSCs. Through this course, participants will explore the structure of PSC agreements, the roles and obligations of involved parties, and the mechanisms of managing and renegotiating contracts. By comparing PSCs to other contractual models, the course provides insight into their unique characteristics and advantages, ensuring participants can effectively navigate and manage PSC agreements in different jurisdictions.</span></p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Introduction to Production Sharing Contracts</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Definition of production sharing contracts and their importance in the oil and gas industry</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing the origin of PSCs contracts and their historical development</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Analyzing the legal framework governing PSCs in different jurisdictions</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Distinguishing between PSCs and other contractual models</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Identifying countries using PSCs and exploring their applications</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Characteristics and Structure of Production-Sharing Contracts</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Defining the subject and scope of PSCs</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding the role of the state as part of a PSC</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Identifying investor obligations related to exploration activities, conducted at their own expense and risk</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding the ownership of production produced under a PSC and its transition during the contract life cycle</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing the procedures and mechanism of product sharing under a PSC</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Key Clauses and Provisions in PSCs</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Analyzing a sample of PSC that outlines typical content and format</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing the impact of the bargaining power of parties in the terms of PSCs</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Reviewing key clauses in PSC and their impact on risk, cost, recovery and profitability</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing regulatory provisions for conducting petroleum operations under PCSs</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring financial and taxation provisions in PSCs</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding production disposition and disposal rights</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Management of Production and Sharing Contracts</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding the organizational and contractual relationship between contractor and state party</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Techniques for controlling and managing PSCs for compliance with contractual terms</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding the importance of declaring commercial discovery and its steps</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Analyzing contractor’s obligations related to providing guarantees</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing the acquisition of ownership and produced resources by the state party</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Renegotiation and Dispute Resolution</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing options for considering the contract’s terms for renegotiation</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Recognizing the importance of dispute resolution and its role in preventing costly litigation</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Exploring different approaches for dispute resolution:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\"> &nbsp; Litigation</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\"> &nbsp; Arbitration</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\"> &nbsp; Mediation</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Discussing the criteria for selecting the rules of arbitration and mediation</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\\">Understanding the importance of incorporating dispute resolution clauses in PSCs</span></li></ul>"]',
