\"background-color: transparent;\\">Explaining the dynamics of editorial teams&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring different editorial resources and the purpose of using them&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Techniques for productive communication with editorial team members </span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Structural Editing Standards&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Definition and purpose of structural editing&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Techniques for developing organized and well-structured materials&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing content issues and related standards&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the principles of plain language&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Best practices for applying plain language principes in structural editing </span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Stylistic Editing Standards</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Definition and purpose of structural editing&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Techniques for enhancing clarity, coherence and follow&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Methods for Improving Content Language&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Determining the significance of using conscious language&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding the stylistic editing approach of narratives&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the application of plain language principles in stylistic editing </span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Copy Editing and Proofreading Standards~</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Definition and purpose of copy editing&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Describing the standards of copy editing:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ul><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Correctness&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Consistency&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Accuracy&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Completeness&nbsp;</span></li></ul><p><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\"><span class=\\"ql-cursor\\">﻿</span></span></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing techniques for ensuring compliance with copy editing standards&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Definition and purpose of proofreading&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Analyzing different proofreading strategies and practices&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discovering error correction techniques&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discovering sources for continual learning and ongoing professional development&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Recap and lesson learned </span></li></ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 14,
                'online' => 0,
