            485 => 
            array (
                'id' => 2337,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
                'name' => 'Comprehensive Energy and Procurement Management: Strategies, Contracts, and Future Trends',
                'description' => '<p><span style="background-color: transparent;">Navigating the complexities of the energy sector requires a solid grasp of procurement strategies, contract management, and an awareness of industry trends. As global energy markets shift, professionals in the field must be equipped to handle evolving contracts, manage supplier relationships, and mitigate risks effectively. The Comprehensive Energy and Procurement Management: Strategies, Contracts, and Future Trends course provides an in-depth understanding of these areas, focusing on essential skills for managing upstream and downstream contracts in energy. This course also explores the fundamentals of risk assessment, supplier management, and strategic sourcing, ensuring that participants are prepared to address challenges unique to energy procurement.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="background-color: transparent;">Designed to offer practical insights, the seven-day program includes case studies and real-world scenarios that allow participants to refine their negotiation skills, develop sustainable procurement processes, and analyze emerging trends that impact the energy industry. By the end of the course, participants will be equipped to lead procurement initiatives with confidence and foresight, positioning their organizations for sustainable growth.</span></p>',
                'duration' => '7',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Global Energy Market and Energy Contracts</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Overview of structure and key players in global energy markets</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Defining energy contracts and their purpose&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring the main types and components of energy contracts&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discovering the lifecycle of energy contracts</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Analyzing the impact of future trends and technological advancements in energy contracts </span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Energy Industry Risk Management&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Describing types of risks in the energy industry:&nbsp;</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ul><li>Market Risks&nbsp;</li><li>Credit Risks</li><li>Operational Risks</li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\">Regulatory Risk</li></ul><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Recognizing the process of risk assessment in energy contracts&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring risk assessment techniques and tools</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing risk mitigation strategies to minimize the impact of risks in the energy industry&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Case studies and real-world examples</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Energy Contract Analysis: Upstream and Downstream Contracts&nbsp;<span class=\\"ql-cursor\\">﻿</span></strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Distinguishing between upstream and downstream contracts&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Describing types of upstream energy contracts:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploration Contract</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Production Contract</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Drilling Contract</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Describing types of downstream energy contracts:&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Refining Contracts</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Distribution Contracts</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Retail Contracts&nbsp;</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Determining and analyzing key clauses and common issues in energy contracts&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Case studies and real-world examples</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Strategic Procurement</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding strategic procurement: Definition, purpose and history&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Determining the role of strategic procurement in driving organizational growth&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Overview of strategic procurement process and its cycle stages&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Describing the main components of procurement planning:&nbsp;</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Needs identification&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Market research&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Budgeting&nbsp;</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Definition of sustainable procurement and the impact of digitalization on strategic procurement </span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Supplier Management and Vendor Relationship Building</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring the methodology and criteria for identifying and selecting suppliers&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Techniques for developing and maintaining supplier relationships:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Communication&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Performance monitoring&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Dispute resolution&nbsp;</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the way of improving supplier performance through development and governance&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring tools and techniques to identify and manage supplier risk&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Case studies and real-world examples</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Strategic Sourcing and Category Management</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Defining strategic sourcing and its benefits&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Describing the process of strategic sourcing&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding category management strategy in procurement&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the role of cross-functional teams in strategic sourcing and category management&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Determining the role of market intelligence in strategic sourcing and category management </span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Negotiation and Contract Management&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Introduction to the principles of contract negotiation:&nbsp;</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ul><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Preparing negotiations</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Conducting negotiations&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Closing negotiations&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring techniques and strategies for effective negotiation of contractual clauses&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Strategies and best practices for effective management of contacts&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing conflict resolution strategies in contract management&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Case studies and real-world examples&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Course review and certification delivery </span></li></ul>"]',
                'related_courses' => '[]',
                'category_id' => 12,
                'online' => 1,
                'created_at' => '2025-04-03 12:55:02',
                'updated_at' => '2025-04-03 12:55:02',
