                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Introduction to International Sustainability Standards Board (ISSB)</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Definition of sustainability and the impact of climate change on businesses</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Recognizing the growing demand for sustainability information</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Understanding the purpose of ISSB and its methodology</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Defining IFRS Sustainability Disclosure Standards and their purpose:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">       IFRS S1: General Requirements for Disclosure of Sustainability-related Financial Information</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">       </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">IFRS S2: Climate-related Disclosures</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Exploring the benefits and challenges of applying ISSB standards</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Discussing the interconnection between IFRS and other standards and frameworks</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">IFRS S1 vs. IFRS S2</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Exploring IFRS S1 requirements and applications</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Exploring IFRS S2 requirements and applications</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Determining the intended users of IFRS disclosures</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Understanding industry-specific disclosure requirements</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Identifying the relationship between IFRS S1 and IFRS S2</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Techniques for ensuring consistency and achieving fair and faithful presentations</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">IFRS Sustainability-Related Financial Disclosures</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Definition of sustainability-related risks and opportunities and identifying their sources</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Identifying types of opportunities and risks ISSB standards focus on</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Discussing types of disclosures required for each sustainability-related risk and opportunity</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Exploring disclosure requirements for different content areas:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">        Governance</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">        </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Strategy</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">        </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Risk Management</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">        </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Metrics and Targets</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Understanding location and timing requirements for sustainability-related financial disclosures</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Exploring transitional relief components and determining when they are applicable</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Producing Decision-Useful Sustainability Disclosers</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Identifying the characteristics of decision-useful disclosures</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">The application of IFRS Sustainability Disclosure Standards and guidance in identifying risks and opportunities</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Definition and characteristics of material information</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">The application of IFRS Sustainability Disclosure Standards and guidance in identifying information about risks and opportunities</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Exploring ISSB standards related to decision-useful information for investors</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Discovering judgment process of assessing whether the information is material</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Development of a Reporting Plan</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Phases of developing a reporting plan: Preparation, Alignment, Implementation, and communication</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Understanding the process of building collective capacity and identifying resorbable people for disclosure</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Techniques to evaluate existing disclosures and plan for the future:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ol><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">        Gap analysis</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">        </span><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Additional reporting requirements</span></li></ol><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Discussing best implementation practices that help in achieving disclosure objectives</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Exploring communication methods and techniques and the best ways to include information in general-purpose reporting</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Activity: Developing a sustainability reporting plan</span></li></ul>"]',
