parent;\\">Discussing the methodology of implementing controls for managing risks&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discovering reconciliation methods and tools in securities operations&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Strategies for establishing regular audit practices and procedures to monitor and validate controls </span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Industry Structure&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Overview of the key roles of industry structures in the security operation industry&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Distinguishing between major exchanges: NASD vs. NYSE</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Examining the role of depositories and clearing corporations in security operations&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Analyzing the benefits and limitations of electronic communication networks (ECNs)</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring securities identifying entities and their purpose&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Explaining the process of securities transfer and identifying parties involved</span></li></ul>"]',
