                'id' => 2356,
                'lang_code' => 'en',
            'name' => 'Certified Fixed Assets Manager (Preparation Course)',
            'description' => '<p><span style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);">Fixed assets are a cornerstone of an organization’s financial stability and operational success. Properly managing and monitoring these assets is essential to ensure accurate reporting, compliance with standards, and optimal utilization. The </span><strong style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);">Certified Fixed Assets Manager</strong><span style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);"> course is designed to equip professionals with the tools and knowledge needed to effectively oversee fixed assets, from acquisition to disposal. By addressing key areas such as financial reporting, budgeting, and technology integration, participants will gain a practical understanding of how to manage diverse asset types while ensuring long-term financial health.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);">Through this five-day course, participants will explore best practices in fixed asset management, including compliance with </span><strong style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);">IFRS standards</strong><span style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);">, the use of technology for tracking and reporting, and strategies for cost reduction and optimization. The program includes real-world case studies and practical exercises, enabling participants to confidently apply these skills within their organizations.</span></p>',
                'duration' => '5',
            'days_content' => '["<p><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Fundamentals of Fixed Asset Management&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Introduction to fixed assets management and its significance in financial health&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discovering different types of fixed assets:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ul><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Capital Work in Progress (CWIP)</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Leasehold improvements&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Right of Use (ROU) assets</span></li><li class=\\"ql-indent-1\\"><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Property, Plant, and Equipment (PP&amp;E)</span></li></ul><p><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\"><span class=\\"ql-cursor\\">﻿</span></span></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing management, monitoring and accounting strategies for each type fixed asset</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Techniques to oversee the acquisition, recording and disposal of fixed assets&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Recognizing the significance of physical inventory and tracking systems in fixed assets management&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing types of information required to maintain accurate and up-to-date records of fixed assets </span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Financial Reporting for Fixed Assets&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Recognizing the impact of fixed assets on financial statements&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing monthly closures and their significance&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Techniques and best practices for developing depreciation schedules and fixed asset valuation reports&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Tools and techniques for developing fixed assets reports&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Understanding IFRS requirements and the significance of aligning reporting practices with it&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Practical exercises on financial reporting for fixed assets </span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Budgeting and Forecasting in Fixed Asset Management&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Identifying the purpose and significance of budgeting and forecasting in fixed asset management</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring budgeting techniques for capital expenditures and asset purchases&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Steps of forecasting future asset needs based on asset trends&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Recognizing the importance of risk assessment in budgeting for fixed assets&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing budgeting and forecasting considerations and challenges in fixed asset management&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Practical exercises on developing budgets for fixed assets and forecasting future needs for assets</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Technology Utilization in Fixed Asset Management&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Identifying the significance of using technological solutions in fixed asset management&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring asset management software and tools&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing ways of implementing system improvements for efficient asset tracking and reporting&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Strategies and tools for automating asset reporting process&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the impact of emerging technology on fixed asset management&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Case studies about using technology in asset management</span></li></ul>","<p><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Fixed Asset Analysis and Recommendations&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Discussing the importance of analyzing assets performance in optimizing efforts&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Exploring techniques for evaluating the performance of asset performance and utilization&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Guidelines for developing optimization and cost-reduction strategies</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Case studies about effective asset optimization strategies&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Practical exercises on analyzing asset performance and utilization&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\\"background-color: transparent;\\">Lesson learned and best practices </span></li></ul>"]',
